Makes a page's sound (see the file comment).\"},{\"line_number\":373,\"content\":\"- `defineCamera` (function from [`engine/gfx/cameras/define.ts`](../engine/gfx/cameras/define.ts)): Adds a game's camera mode on `registry` (the shared one by default).\"},{\"line_number\":379,\"content\":\"- `defineGeometry` (function from [`engine/gfx/geometry/geometry.ts`](../engine/gfx/geometry/geometry.ts)): Defines a geometry on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":384,\"content\":\"- `defineLook` (function from [`engine/gfx/post/looks.ts`](../engine/gfx/post/looks.ts)): Declares a look (`look:<name>`); see `LOOK_FIELDS`.\"},{\"line_number\":390,\"content\":\"- `defineProp` (function from [`engine/world/props/prop.ts`](../engine/world/props/prop.ts)): Defines a prop on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":394,\"content\":\"- `defineSfx` (function from [`engine/audio/data/sfx.ts`](../engine/audio/data/sfx.ts)): Defines an effect on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":397,\"content\":\"- `defineSong` (function from [`engine/audio/data/song.ts`](../engine/audio/data/song.ts)): Defines a song on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":522,\"content\":\"- `GeometrySpec` (interface from [`engine/gfx/geometry/geometry.ts`](../engine/gfx/geometry/geometry.ts)): What `defineGeometry` takes: the entry's fields (`params` and `budget` have defaults), `create` typed by `params`.\"},{\"line_number\":697,\"content\":\"- `LookSpec` (type from [`engine/gfx/post/looks.ts`](../engine/gfx/post/looks.ts)): What `defineLook` takes: any of the fields, the filters as part of a chain.\"},{\"line_number\":868,\"content\":\"- `PropDefinition` (type from [`engine/world/props/prop.ts`](../engine/world/props/prop.ts)): What `defineProp` takes: any field, and of its objects (body, light, place, each part and its flame) any key.\"},{\"line_number\":879,\"content\":\"- `PropPlacement` (interface from [`engine/world/props/place.ts`](../engine/world/props/place.ts)): A prop placed: `{ prop: 'prop:<id>', at: [x, y, z], yaw }`, its base at `at` (m) and its turn `yaw` about +Y (rad), as `spawnProp` takes it and `levelProps` gives it.\"},{\"line_number\":928,\"content\":\"- `readCameraCode` (function from [`engine/gfx/cameras/place.ts`](../engine/gfx/cameras/place.ts)): Reads any camera's code: a follow camera's (`cam3=chase…`, `cam3=first…`, `cam3=rail…`, `cam3=shoulder…`, `cam3=follow…`) by its module, a game camera's (`defineCamera`) as its name and code, every other by `parseCameraCode`.\"},{\"line_number\":1037,\"content\":\"- `SfxSpec` (interface from [`engine/audio/data/sfx.ts`](../engine/audio/data/sfx.ts)): What `defineSfx` takes: voices, layers or both, and every other field optional.\"},{\"line_number\":1089,\"content\":\"- `SongSpec` (interface from [`engine/audio/data/song.ts`](../engine/audio/data/song.ts)): What `defineSong` takes: the tracks, and every other field optional.\"},{\"line_number\":1101,\"content\":\"- `spawnProp` (function from [`engine/sim/props.ts`](../engine/sim/props.ts)): Stands a prop in the scene, `spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:<id>', at: [x, y, z], yaw })`: its base at `at` (m), turned `yaw` about +Y (rad).\"},{\"line_number\":1102,\"content\":\"- `SpawnPropOptions` (interface from [`engine/sim/props.ts`](../engine/sim/props.ts)): How `spawnProp` stands a prop beyond its placement (WP 13.16): a spawn inside a step or a setup joins the world at its end, so a door's or a switch's own component comes with it here.\"},{\"line_number\":1547,\"content\":\"- `defineProp` (function from [`engine/world/props/prop.ts`](../engine/world/props/prop.ts)): Defines a prop on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":1853,\"content\":\"- `PropDefinition` (type from [`engine/world/props/prop.ts`](../engine/world/props/prop.ts)): What `defineProp` takes: any field, and of its objects (body, light, place, each part and its flame) any key.\"},{\"line_number\":1860,\"content\":\"- `PropPlacement` (interface from [`engine/world/props/place.ts`](../engine/world/props/place.ts)): A prop placed: `{ prop: 'prop:<id>', at: [x, y, z], yaw }`, its base at `at` (m) and its turn `yaw` about +Y (rad), as `spawnProp` takes it and `levelProps` gives it.\"},{\"line_number\":2014,\"content\":\"- `spawnProp` (function from [`engine/sim/props.ts`](../engine/sim/props.ts)): Stands a prop in the scene, `spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:<id>', at: [x, y, z], yaw })`: its base at `at` (m), turned `yaw` about +Y (rad).\"},{\"line_number\":2015,\"content\":\"- `SpawnPropOptions` (interface from [`engine/sim/props.ts`](../engine/sim/props.ts)): How `spawnProp` stands a prop beyond its placement (WP 13.16): a spawn inside a step or a setup joins the world at its end, so a door's or a switch's own component comes with it here.\"},{\"line_number\":3524,\"content\":\"- `AudioOptions` (interface from [`engine/audio/runtime/audio.ts`](../engine/audio/runtime/audio.ts)): How `createAudio` is set up; in a page every field has its default.\"},{\"line_number\":3528,\"content\":\"- `createAudio` (function from [`engine/audio/runtime/audio.ts`](../engine/audio/runtime/audio.ts)): Makes a page's sound (see the file comment).\"},{\"line_number\":3529,\"content\":\"- `defineSfx` (function from [`engine/audio/data/sfx.ts`](../engine/audio/data/sfx.ts)): Defines an effect on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":3530,\"content\":\"- `defineSong` (function from [`engine/audio/data/song.ts`](../engine/audio/data/song.ts)): Defines a song on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":3554,\"content\":\"- `SfxSpec` (interface from [`engine/audio/data/sfx.ts`](../engine/audio/data/sfx.ts)): What `defineSfx` takes: voices, layers or both, and every other field optional.\"},{\"line_number\":3558,\"content\":\"- `SongSpec` (interface from [`engine/audio/data/song.ts`](../engine/audio/data/song.ts)): What `defineSong` takes: the tracks, and every other field optional.\"},{\"line_number\":3585,\"content\":\"- `defineSfx` (function): Defines an effect on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":3597,\"content\":\"- `SfxSpec` (interface): What `defineSfx` takes: voices, layers or both, and every other field optional.\"},{\"line_number\":3603,\"content\":\"- `defineSong` (function): Defines a song on `registry` (the shared one by default) and returns it.\"},{\"line_number\":3611,\"content\":\"- `SongSpec` (interface): What `defineSong` takes: the tracks, and every other field optional.\"},{\"line_number\":3703,\"content\":\"- `AudioOptions` (interface): How `createAudio` is set up; in a page every field has its default.\"},{\"line_number\":3705,\"content\":\"- `createAudio` (function): Makes a page's sound (see the file comment).\"},{\"line_number\":4291,\"content\":\"- `CameraKindSpec` (interface from [`engine/gfx/cameras/define.ts`](../engine/gfx/cameras/define.ts)): What `defineCamera` takes: `create` makes the camera from its code and the camera before it.\"},{\"line_number\":4303,\"content\":\"- `defineCamera` (function from [`engine/gfx/cameras/define.ts`](../engine/gfx/cameras/define.ts)): Adds a game's camera mode on `registry` (the shared one by default).\"},{\"line_number\":4318,\"content\":\"- `readCameraCode` (function from [`engine/gfx/cameras/place.ts`](../engine/gfx/cameras/place.ts)): Reads any camera's code: a follow camera's (`cam3=chase…`, `cam3=first…`, `cam3=rail…`, `cam3=shoulder…`, `cam3=follow…`) by its module, a game camera's (`defineCamera`) as its name and code, every other by `parseCameraCode`.\"},{\"line_number\":4420,\"content\":\"- `CameraKindSpec` (interface): What `defineCamera` takes: `create` makes the camera from its code and the camera before it.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8a623feb-8949-47