ach family's rule ids carry its name (`layer/no-restricted-imports`, `sim/no-restricted-globals`,\"},{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\" * `banned/no-restricted-syntax`, `local/ask-the-entry`); tools/eslint/family.ts says why.\"},{\"line_number\":29,\"content\":\"  /** Game code imports only engine/index.ts and engine/sim-api.ts (tools/eslint/publicApi.ts): on since WP 1.6. */\"},{\"line_number\":82,\"content\":\"        'no-restricted-syntax': [\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/index.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * under the hood). A game's pages import only this module, its sim-side code only engine/sim-api.ts, which this module\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" * it is declared (`x docs --check` fails one without). No engine module imports this file or engine/sim-api.ts\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\" * @see engine/sim-api.ts\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\"export * from './sim-api';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/play.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\" * Game code, sim-side: it imports only engine/sim-api.ts, so `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts` runs it in Node.\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"} from '../../../engine/sim-api';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"import { defineScene, type World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-202