,115,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":13,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"## Goal kind\"},{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"## Acceptance criteria\"},{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"2. **The operation is recognizably Trauma Center play, under this plan’s original rules.** Checked from each case’s own start, not one chained marathon: first-person surgery on a living field, with a clock and vitals, lost if time runs out, if slips pass the limit, or if a flatline Code fails, and won only by a closing phase. Eight tools — scalpel, forceps, suture, drain, laser, syringe, gel, scanner — each visibly change tissue on a valid target (cut along a guide, pull a shard or mass, zigzag stitches, shrink a pool, burn, inject within a band, paint gel, reveal buried targets) and otherwise refuse with no penalty and a named right tool. Finished actions rate TEXTBOOK, CLEAN, ROUGH, or SLIP and feed a chain and ranks C, B, A, S, and ★. One to three sites keep deteriorating while the surgeon is elsewhere. Stillpoint slows field time; Second Pulse blocks vitals loss and heals on clean actions; both arm from a beat-timed three-press pulse-lock, with a one-press Simple Gift option; two g [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"2. gating: Same suite: for three seeds, the shipped bot wins each of the eight story cases on Resident from that case’s own start; Cases 1 and 8 also on Intern and Attending; a 2-seat and a 4-seat bot run finish. A separate test drives the shipped flow from the title through story, all eight operations (bot), debrief, credits, and Free Surgery unlocked, with no browser. Capture to `{SCRATCH}/bot.log`. Pass only if each case win and the ending unlock are reported, not merely that the process exited.\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"3. gating: Assert story and case data cover the §8 case list and §9 arc, every scene is 12–35 short boxes, postcard lines exist per rank, voice synthesis is deterministic per line, and a scan of game text finds no never-use names and no TODO, placeholder, or lorem. Capture to `{SCRATCH}/content.log`.\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"## Non-goals\"},{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"- Any campaign past the eight story cases, the Gala Shift, and Free Surgery, or Trauma Team specialties (endoscopy, orthopedics, forensics, diagnosis).\"},{\"line_number\":35,\"content\":\"## Assumed scope\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"## Implementation approach\"},{\"line_number\":48,\"content\":\"## Task checklist\"},{\"line_number\":51,\"content\":\"- [ ] Finish Case 1 (drain, forceps, suture, syringe, gel, radial, vitals, clock, ratings, failure, debrief) and a bot win.\"},{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"## Risks / Contradictions\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"b815eacf-8489-47e9-b815-b8f8ada9076c"}
