{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_56","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"npx created node_modules in the work root.\n\nI will remove the accidentally created node_modules folder. Then I will run all eight test cases from the correct directory using local vitest. I may expand the test temporarily via a node script in scratch.\n\nI will update bot.test.ts to run all cases and difficulties. The 30-second timeout might be exceeded, so I will first time the cases with tsx to gauge runtime.\n\nI will raise the test timeout to 120 seconds if needed. I am also preparing to check line counts and run tsc later. The cases that look most likely to fail are Case 2 guide and bleeders, Case 2 mass, Case 3 multi-site, Case 4 matron, and Case 5 solace.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-188ea106-fd45-4ef4-9c17-68c34983ff00-41","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"rm -rf /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/node_modules","description":"Remove accidental npx node_modules"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-188ea106-fd45-4ef4-9c17-68c34983ff00-42","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/run-cases.ts","new_string":"import { runBot } from '../../../work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/bot.ts';\nimport { storyCases } from '../../../work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts';\nimport { createFromCase, debugOp } from '../../../work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/world.ts';\n\nconst diffs = ['resident', 'intern', 'attending'] as const;\nfor (const def of storyCases()) {\n  for (const difficulty of diffs) {\n    if (difficulty !== 'resident' && def.id !== 'case:first-cut' && def.id !== 'case:mercy') continue;\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\n      if (difficulty !== 'resident' && seed !== 1) continue;\n      const started = Date.now();\n      const op = createFromCase(def.id, { seed, difficulty });\n      runBot(op);\n      const ms = Date.now() - started;\n      console.log(`${def.id} ${difficulty} seed ${seed} ${op.status} ${ms}ms score ${op.score} ${op.status === 'won' ? '' : debugOp(op)}`);\n    }\n  }\n}\nfor (const seats of [2, 4]) {\n  const op = createFromCase('case:first-cut', { seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident', seats });\n  runBot(op);\n  console.log(`coop ${seats} ${op.status} ${op.fail} score ${op.score}`);\n}\nconst gala = createFromCase('case:gala-shift', { seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident' });\nrunBot(gala);\nconsole.log(`gala ${gala.status} ${gala.fail} ${debugOp(gala)}`);\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":682,"output_tokens":1276,"cache_read_input_tokens":136064,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"ea76be58-261b-4445-ad53-8da353d44177"}
