rok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/run-cases.ts\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Re-run bot after grab and stitch fixes\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151/terminal/call-8195d9d9-323d-44eb-aec4-0c3d044b3007-61.log\",\"total_bytes\":2084}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"0d4b1dd5-7171-4bca-8593-e2d6bbb89bc2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_64","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All story cases are complete, including mercy and coop modes.\n\nGala stalls on flap, shard (site 1), and cocoon. The bot still needs to win it. The under-flap shard was retrieved before the flap was completed.\n\nThe under-flap shard was likely grabbable from the start because the 'under:cloth' tag linked it directly to the flap without requiring an open state.\n\nThe under-flap shard was likely just a normal pulled shard. The 'under' tag was never set, so the flap was never lifted and the case remains stalled.\n\nThe bot is stuck on the gala case. It should pick the flap first, but it may be holding the flap while pulling and never reaching lift 0.8. The pull direction moves away from the ox, yet the lift threshold is not being met.\n\nThe stuck signature does not include lift or hold, so the stall is hard to detect. A debug script will print hold state, flap lift, positions, and tool selection every 100 ticks during a gala-only run. The bot may also be selecting the cocoon instead of the flap.\n\nThe bot should reach the flap before the cocoon becomes nearest. The cocoon is 1.14 units away, past the 0.85 threshold. When arriving, use activates and the nearest target becomes the flap. After switching to forceps, the lift and pull should finish the case.\n\nThe bot may be stuck on site 0 with the flap and never switch to site 1. I am re-examining lift() and pull() to find why the lift threshold is not met.\n\nThe lift math and hand positioning look correct. The stall may instead come from the flap being hidden or failing an `open` check, even though it is not locked. The remaining gala targets are flap1, shard3, and cocoon5.\n\nThe under-flap shard was completed while the flap itself is still not done. This contradicts the expected sequence, since the bot should hold the flap and pull it open before reaching the shard. The only remaining explanation is that the bot briefly held the flap, then released it and grabbed the shard in the same step.\n\nThe under-flap shard was likely pulled while the bot held the flap open, but the lift never reached 0.8. The bot then released the flap and became stuck.\n\nThe under-flap shard was likely not linked to the flap at all, since its tag is `under:cloth` and the link logic requires the target to start with that prefix. I will log the shard's `under` value, the flap's lift, holder, and seat hold state to verify this.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ac67c044-b9e1-4d59-a368-cd44049cbcd9-62","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/debug-gala.ts","new_string":"import { botHands } from '../../../work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/bot.ts';\nimport { stepOp } from '../../../work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/step.ts';\nimport { createFromCase } from '../../../work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/world.ts';\n\nconst op = createFromCase('case:gala-shift', { seed: 1, difficulty: 'resident' });\nfor (const target of op.targets) console.log('spawn', target.id, target.kind, target.tag, 'under', target.under, target.x.toFixed(2), target.z.toFixed(2), 'site', target.site);\nlet n = 0;\nwhile (op.status === 'playing' && n < 900) {\n  const hands = botHands(op);\n  if (n % 30 === 0 || n > 640) {\n    const seat = op.seats[0];\n    const left = op.targets.filter((t) => !t.done).map((t) => `${t.kind}${t.id} lift ${t.lift.toFixed(2)} hold ${t.holder}`).join(' | ');\n    console.log(n, 'tool', seat.tool, 'use', hands[0].use, 'pos', seat.x.toFixed(2), seat.z.toFixed(2), 'site', seat.site, 'hold', seat.hold, left);\n  }\n  stepOp(op, hands);\n  n += 1;\n}\nconsole.log('end', op.status, op.fail, 'tick', op.tick);\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1329,"output_tokens":2133,"cache_read_input_tokens":166016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"22659cfb-b15b-4c00-a66f-d72520693a80"}
