{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_68","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All cases win, including gala, coop 2 and 4, mercy on all difficulties, and first cut on all difficulties.\n\nPar scores are now fixed from the resident seed 1 results. The next steps are updating cases.ts, writing comprehensive simulation tests, and continuing with story, director, voice, sequencer, page, UI, audio, one-file, and verify.\n\nGala-shift score is missing from the log and needs to be computed. Mercy variation across seeds is negligible at 0.09%. I will update par values in cases.ts, then write op.test.ts covering the gating simulation tests. The remaining frontend, hub, audio, story, and verify work will be handled in large architectural chunks.\n\nThe remaining work is mapped to six files: op.test.ts, story.ts, voice.ts, director.ts, sequencer.ts, and the page/UI layer. The page layer is the largest task and will require reading labs/game/main.ts, index.html, and the engine API to ensure a bootable build. I also need to review the one-file build script and PLAN sections 16-19 for hub meta and verify.\n\nI will check file line counts to avoid 600-line limits, particularly for act.ts. I also need to fix ESLint issues like Math.hypot and unused imports. I will update each par value in cases.ts with a targeted search_replace, using the case title as context.\n\nRank tests show identical scores across seeds because the bot's actions are nearly unchanged by jitter. I will record the gala-shift par score during the test run and update all pars together.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7e171863-87fe-4609-9892-d3121b94650f-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts","old_string":"    storyBefore: 'before-1',\n    storyAfter