efore: 'before-2',\\n    storyAfter: 'after-2',\\n    par: 1,\",\"new_string\":\"    storyBefore: 'before-2',\\n    storyAfter: 'after-2',\\n    par: 13954,\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    storyBefore: 'before-2',\\n    storyAfter: 'after-2',\\n    par: 1,\",\"old_line\":126,\"new_string\":\"    storyBefore: 'before-2',\\n    storyAfter: 'after-2',\\n    par: 13954,\",\"new_line\":126,\"context_before\":\"      },\\n    ],\\n    sites: [{ id: 'abdomen', name: 'Abdomen' }],\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    phases: [\\n      phase('incision', 'A long curve. Stay on the line.', 'clear', [curve(-3.2, 0, 3.4, 0.2, 0.45, '', 'long')], '', 'The scalpel follows the guide.'),\\n      phase(\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7e171863-87fe-4609-9892-d3121b94650f-70","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    storyBefore: 'before-3',\\n    storyAfter: 'after-3',\\n    par: 1,\",\"new_string\":\"    storyBefore: 'before-3',\\n    storyAfter: 'after-3',\\n    par: 14333,\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts has been