TH.join(', ')}) from engine/sim-api.ts, AnimationClip and AnimationMixer from engine/index.ts; for anything else, the barrel gains a documented re-export (PLAN.md §6.1)`,\"},{\"line_number\":100,\"content\":\"    'game code reaches physics through engine/sim-api.ts (bodies, queries), never Rapier itself (PLAN.md §6.1, ADR-0020)',\"},{\"line_number\":114,\"content\":\"        message: `${where}: import it from ${allowed === 'sim-api' ? 'engine/sim-api.ts' : 'engine/index.ts (pages) or engine/sim-api.ts (sim-side code)'} under the same name; if the barrel lacks it, add the re-export there with its doc comment (PLAN.md §6.1, ADR-0020)`,\"},{\"line_number\":138,\"content\":\"      'index|sim-api',\"},{\"line_number\":145,\"content\":\"      'sim-api',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/tools/eslint/layers.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\" * module imports the public barrels (`../index`, `../sim-api`, `..`): they are for game code, and re-export the\"},{\"line_number\":78,\"content\":\"/** The public barrels from inside the engine: `../index`, `../sim-api`, or `..` (engine/ itself, its index). */\"},{\"line_number\":80,\"content\":\"  regex: '^(?:(?:\\\\\\\\.\\\\\\\\./)+(?:index|sim-api)(?:\\\\\\\\.ts)?|\\\\\\\\.\\\\\\\\.(?:/\\\\\\\\.\\\\\\\\.)*)$',\"},{\"line_number\":82,\"content\":\"    'engine code never imports the public barrels (engine/index.ts, engine/sim-api.ts): they re-export the engine, so the import makes a cycle; import the module that declares the name (PLAN.md §6.1)',\"},{\"line_number\":267,\"content\":\"    name: 'sim-api.ts',\"},{\"line_number\":268,\"content\":\"    files: ['engine/sim-api.ts'],\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/tools/eslint/simSide.ts\",\"ma