: -0.8, tint: 0.3, brightness: 1.15 },\\n      bloom: { scope: 'all', strength: 0.9, threshold: 0.8 },\\n    },\\n  },\\n  'look:posterized-world': {\\n    description: 'The environment in a few flat shades; the characters and objects in full colour.',\\n    filters: { palette: { scope: 'environment', palette: 'none', levels: 8, dither: 0 } },\\n  },\\n  'look:oil-painting': {\\n    description: 'The whole scene in oil paint: flat strokes, brush streaks, canvas.',\\n    filters: {\\n      stylize: { scope: 'all', style: 'paint', size: 6, color: 1 },\\n      grade: { scope: 'all', saturation: 1.15 },\\n    },\\n  },\\n  'look:painted-world': {\\n\",\"total_lines\":363}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-dfb2a372-89c2-4706-bb0c-7ff9ced92e8d-45","content":"{\"type\":\"ListDir\",\"Content\":{\"content\":\"- /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/box/looks/\\n  - daylight.ts\\n  - hall-floor.ts\\n  - torch-bloom.ts\\n  - torch-cel.ts\\n  - torch-fxaa.ts\\n  - torch-lit.ts\\n  - torch-pixel.ts\\n  - torch-toon.ts\",\"absolute_root_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/box/looks\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"7c3c78c4-002c-47fc-8f4e-ffe1af50910b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_88","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking how inspector input axes and custom intents enter the simulation.\n\nReviewing box look files, defineProp examples, and audio specs before writing code. The plan is to fix the sequencer and content tests first, then build a scene that steps the op from game:hands, an HTML overlay page with data-game attributes, and a live mesh field at 320x192 resolution.\n\nSettled on a 128x80 vertex grid for the live mesh field to stay safe under software WebGPU. Next up are audio definitions, the hub session, a one-file build, verify.mjs, end-to-end tests, and the hub harness.\n\nReviewing the engine API for step intents, spawnProp imports, and createEngine options. Checking story.ts exports and line counts for validation. Preparing to download session.js. Now mapping out the exact files to create.\n\nSettled on the file layout. Validation and content tests will live under labs/game/op/. The sequencer addAnchor bug will be fixed there too. The main game scene goes in labs/game/scenes/main.ts. The bridge scene can remain under scenes/ because it only holds an Op reference and does not touch the DOM.\n\nConfirmed the import chain is valid: scenes/ can import bridge, which imports op. A module-level current op could break if two worlds exist, so it will be keyed by a token or set per test run.\n\nThe Op cannot be hashed directly by the engine world because it lacks a fixed component schema. The plan is to mirror essential state into a fixed component so the engine hash changes with the op. A JSON string field will store the full op state, since the engine already supports string fields.\n\nThe mirrored component will hold a JSON string of the full op state plus fixed fields for hash, status, title, vitals, clock, score, phase, slips, tool, site, hint, teach, and seats. The page reads actual Op arrays from the bridge for rendering targets. Engine hash tracks the op through this component. Hands intent will be packed as an array of numbers per seat.\n\nThe `game:hands` intent will be an array of plain objects, each describing a seat with x, z, tool, use, drop, gift, paddle, site, swap, and hint. Missing intents will leave the op unchanged; passing null to stepOp sets use to false.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95cc7cad-210c-491f-b39c-cfa13f64b179-46","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function applyHands","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/body.ts","-A":35}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95cc7cad-210c-491f-b39c-cfa13f64b179-47","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/box/looks/torch-lit.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95cc7cad-210c-491f-b39c-cfa13f64b179-48","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/audio/data/sfx.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95cc7cad-210c-491f-b39c-cfa13f64b179-49","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input/actionMaps.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95cc7cad-210c-491f-b39c-cfa13f64b179-50","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export function spawnProp|export function defineProp","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/sim-api.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2150,"output_tokens":1653,"cache_read_input_tokens":85248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"f5040161-492d-44d9-ac01-6685280cde5b"}
