_engine.input` for an empty action name, an unknown axis, or a value of the wrong shape.',\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"/** The axes the device can hold, and how many numbers each takes (0 for a custom key's plain data). */\"},{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"/** A namespaced custom intent key. */\"},{\"line_number\":60,\"content\":\"  /** Sets an axis: `move` `[right, forward]`, `look`, `aim`, `cam` or a `game:key`; `null` lets go. */\"},{\"line_number\":61,\"content\":\"  axis(name: string, value: unknown): void;\"},{\"line_number\":95,\"content\":\"    axis(name, value) {\"},{\"line_number\":98,\"content\":\"        throw codeError('INPUT_BAD_VIRTUAL', { what: `axis(${show(name)})`, problem: 'no such axis' });\"},{\"line_number\":122,\"content\":\"/** A checked copy of an axis value, or `INPUT_BAD_VIRTUAL`. */\"},{\"line_number\":131,\"content\":\"  throw codeError('INPUT_BAD_VIRTUAL', { what: `axis(${show(name)})`, problem: `${show(value)} is not ${want}` });\"},{\"line_number\":134,\"content\":\"/** One step's intents from a virtual sample: `move` turned by the heading `yaw` (the `cam` axis when it holds one). */\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"30c9b267-8a77-4df7-b38e-ffd293fc1c32"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_93","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Custom intents can be arrays of numbers.\n\nHands will be packed as a flat number array. Each seat stores ten integers for position, tool, and actions. The scene reads this array each tick. Absent intents during pause are treated as no change.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca4600f7-9c63-48cd-a7a8-a937c84ba2b0-66","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/world.ts","offset":260,"limit":140}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca4600f7-9c63-48cd-a7a8-a937c84ba2b0-67","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"BANNED|never-use|Derek|GUILT","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca4600f7-9c63-48cd-a7a8-a937c84ba2b0-68","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/PLAN.md","offset":1,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2900,"output_tokens":447,"cache_read_input_tokens":101632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"aa543786-b3b6-4236-b0e1-0b13c18a0da1"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ca4600f7-9c63-48cd-a7a8-a937c84ba2b0-66","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"260→    pz: 0,\\n    memo: '',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** A hand that changes nothing: stay, let go. */\\nexport function idleHand(seat: Seat): Hand {\\n  return {\\n    x: seat.x,\\n    z: seat.z,\\n270→    tool: seat.tool,\\n    use: false,\\n    drop: false,\\n    gift: false,\\n    paddle: false,\\n    site: -1,\\n    swap: false,\\n    hint: false,\\n  };\\n}\\n280→\\n/** Build an operation from a case. `seats` includes only human or bot seats, not the colleague. */\\nexport function createFromCase(\\n  id: string,\\n  opts: { seed?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number; attract?: boolean; simple?: boolean; gift?: Seat['gift'] },\\n): Op {\\n  const def = caseById(id);\\n  return createFromDef(def, opts);\\n}\\n\\n290→/** Build an operation from an already-resolved case definition. */\\nexport function createFromDef(\\n  def: CaseDef,\\n  opts: { seed?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number; attract?: boolean; simple?: boolean; gift?: Seat['gift'] } = {},\\n): Op {\\n  const difficulty = opts.difficulty ?? 'resident';\\n  const diff = diffOf(difficulty);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, Math.min(4, opts.seats ?? 1));\\n  const op = emptyOp(def, difficulty, opts.seed ?? 1, seats, opts.gift);\\n  op.attract = opts.attract ?? false;\\n300→  op.simple = opts.simple ?? false;\\n  op.slipLimit = diff.slips;\\n  op.slipDefault = diff.slips;\\n  op.balance.slips = diff.slips;\\n  op.clockMax = Math.round(def.seconds * FIELD_SECOND * diff.clock);\\n  op.clock = op.clockMax;\\n  op.patients = def.patients.map((patient, index) => ({\\n    id: index,\\n    name: patient.name,\\n    vitals: patient.vitals,\\n310→    alive: true,\\n    coded: false,\\n  }));\\n  op.sites = def.sites.map((site) => ({ ...site }));\\n  op.phases = def.phases.map((phase) => ({ ...phase, spawn: phase.spawn.map((spawn) => ({ ...spawn })) }));\\n  op.colleague = def.colleague;\\n  op.roll = def.roll;\\n  op.swapOk = def.swap;\\n  op.codeAllowed = def.code;\\n  op.par = def.par;\\n320→  enterPhase(op);\\n  return op;\\n}\\n\\n/** The shell of an operation, before its first phase spawns. */\\nfunction emptyOp(def: CaseDef, difficulty: Difficulty, seed: number, seats: number, gift: Seat['gift'] | undefined): Op {\\n  const leadGift = gift ?? def.gift;\\n  const made: Seat[] = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < seats; i++) {\\n    const seatGift = i === 0 ? leadGift : i === 1 && def.swap ? 'second' : 'none';\\n330→    const charges = seatGift === 'none' ? 0 : def.charges;\\n    made.push(makeSeat(i, seatGift === 'none' ? 'none' : seatGift, charges));\\n  }\\n  return {\\n    id: def.id,\\n    title: def.title,\\n    seed,\\n    difficulty,\\n    tick: 0,\\n    field: 0,\\n340→    clock: 0,\\n    clockMax: 0,\\n    slips: 0,\\n    slipLimit: 5,\\n    slipDefault: 5,\\n    status: 'playing',\\n    fail: '',\\n    phase: 0,\\n    phases: [],\\n    sites: [],\\n350→    patients: [],\\n    seats: made,\\n    targets: [],\\n    nextId: 1,\\n    code: null,\\n    balance: defaultBalance(),\\n    attract: false,\\n    simple: false,\\n    colleague: false,\\n    helper: '',\\n360→    roll: false,\\n    swapOk: false,\\n    persona: 'wren',\\n    events: [],\\n    injected: false,\\n    giftUsed: false,\\n    codeCleared: false,\\n    teach: '',\\n    hint: '',\\n    par: def.par,\\n370→    codeAllowed: def.code,\\n    mercyKills: 0,\\n    mercyRound: 0,\\n    mercyExposed: 0,\\n    mercyBindSpawned: false,\\n    lastBind: 0,\\n    bestChain: 1,\\n    score: 0,\\n  };\\n}\\n380→\\n/** A tiny operation for a unit test or a dev spawn. One site, one patient, a long clock. */\\nexport function createBare(opts: { code?: boolean; vitals?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number } = {}): Op {\\n  const def: CaseDef = {\\n    id: 'case:bare',\\n    title: 'Bare',\\n    surgeon: 'Wren',\\n    seconds: 600,\\n    gift: 'stillpoint',\\n    charges: 2,\\n390→    colleague: false,\\n    swap: false,\\n    roll: false,\\n    code: opts.code ?? true,\\n    rule: 'fixture',\\n    patients: [\\n      {\\n        name: 'Fixture',\\n        age: 40,\\n        line: 'A test patient.',\",\"content_concise\":\"260→    pz: 0,\\n    memo: '',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** A hand that changes nothing: stay, let go. */\\nexport function idleHand(seat: Seat): Hand {\\n  return {\\n    x: seat.x,\\n    z: seat.z,\\n270→    tool: seat.tool,\\n    use: false,\\n    drop: false,\\n    gift: false,\\n    paddle: false,\\n    site: -1,\\n    swap: false,\\n    hint: false,\\n  };\\n}\\n280→\\n/** Build an operation from a case. `seats` includes only human or bot seats, not the colleague. */\\nexport function createFromCase(\\n  id: string,\\n  opts: { seed?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number; attract?: boolean; simple?: boolean; gift?: Seat['gift'] },\\n): Op {\\n  const def = caseById(id);\\n  return createFromDef(def, opts);\\n}\\n\\n290→/** Build an operation from an already-resolved case definition. */\\nexport function createFromDef(\\n  def: CaseDef,\\n  opts: { seed?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number; attract?: boolean; simple?: boolean; gift?: Seat['gift'] } = {},\\n): Op {\\n  const difficulty = opts.difficulty ?? 'resident';\\n  const diff = diffOf(difficulty);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, Math.min(4, opts.seats ?? 1));\\n  const op = emptyOp(def, difficulty, opts.seed ?? 1, seats, opts.gift);\\n  op.attract = opts.attract ?? false;\\n300→  op.simple = opts.simple ?? false;\\n  op.slipLimit = diff.slips;\\n  op.slipDefault = diff.slips;\\n  op.balance.slips = diff.slips;\\n  op.clockMax = Math.round(def.seconds * FIELD_SECOND * diff.clock);\\n  op.clock = op.clockMax;\\n  op.patients = def.patients.map((patient, index) => ({\\n    id: index,\\n    name: patient.name,\\n    vitals: patient.vitals,\\n310→    alive: true,\\n    coded: false,\\n  }));\\n  op.sites = def.sites.map((site) => ({ ...site }));\\n  op.phases = def.phases.map((phase) => ({ ...phase, spawn: phase.spawn.map((spawn) => ({ ...spawn })) }));\\n  op.colleague = def.colleague;\\n  op.roll = def.roll;\\n  op.swapOk = def.swap;\\n  op.codeAllowed = def.code;\\n  op.par = def.par;\\n320→  enterPhase(op);\\n  return op;\\n}\\n\\n/** The shell of an operation, before its first phase spawns. */\\nfunction emptyOp(def: CaseDef, difficulty: Difficulty, seed: number, seats: number, gift: Seat['gift'] | undefined): Op {\\n  const leadGift = gift ?? def.gift;\\n  const made: Seat[] = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < seats; i++) {\\n    const seatGift = i === 0 ? leadGift : i === 1 && def.swap ? 'second' : 'none';\\n330→    const charges = seatGift === 'none' ? 0 : def.charges;\\n    made.push(makeSeat(i, seatGift === 'none' ? 'none' : seatGift, charges));\\n  }\\n  return {\\n    id: def.id,\\n    title: def.title,\\n    seed,\\n    difficulty,\\n    tick: 0,\\n    field: 0,\\n340→    clock: 0,\\n    clockMax: 0,\\n    slips: 0,\\n    slipLimit: 5,\\n    slipDefault: 5,\\n    status: 'playing',\\n    fail: '',\\n    phase: 0,\\n    phases: [],\\n    sites: [],\\n350→    patients: [],\\n    seats: made,\\n    targets: [],\\n    nextId: 1,\\n    code: null,\\n    balance: defaultBalance(),\\n    attract: false,\\n    simple: false,\\n    colleague: false,\\n    helper: '',\\n360→    roll: false,\\n    swapOk: false,\\n    persona: 'wren',\\n    events: [],\\n    injected: false,\\n    giftUsed: false,\\n    codeCleared: false,\\n    teach: '',\\n    hint: '',\\n    par: def.par,\\n370→    codeAllowed: def.code,\\n    mercyKills: 0,\\n    mercyRound: 0,\\n    mercyExposed: 0,\\n    mercyBindSpawned: false,\\n    lastBind: 0,\\n    bestChain: 1,\\n    score: 0,\\n  };\\n}\\n380→\\n/** A tiny operation for a unit test or a dev spawn. One site, one patient, a long clock. */\\nexport function createBare(opts: { code?: boolean; vitals?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number } = {}): Op {\\n  const def: CaseDef = {\\n    id: 'case:bare',\\n    title: 'Bare',\\n    surgeon: 'Wren',\\n    seconds: 600,\\n    gift: 'stillpoint',\\n    charges: 2,\\n390→    colleague: false,\\n    swap: false,\\n    roll: false,\\n    code: opts.code ?? true,\\n    rule: 'fixture',\\n    patients: [\\n      {\\n        name: 'Fixture',\\n        age: 40,\\n        line: 'A test patient.',\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/world.ts\",\"offset\":260,\"limit\":140,\"raw_output\":\"    pz: 0,\\n    memo: '',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** A hand that changes nothing: stay, let go. */\\nexport function idleHand(seat: Seat): Hand {\\n  return {\\n    x: seat.x,\\n    z: seat.z,\\n    tool: seat.tool,\\n    use: false,\\n    drop: false,\\n    gift: false,\\n    paddle: false,\\n    site: -1,\\n    swap: false,\\n    hint: false,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** Build an operation from a case. `seats` includes only human or bot seats, not the colleague. */\\nexport function createFromCase(\\n  id: string,\\n  opts: { seed?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number; attract?: boolean; simple?: boolean; gift?: Seat['gift'] },\\n): Op {\\n  const def = caseById(id);\\n  return createFromDef(def, opts);\\n}\\n\\n/** Build an operation from an already-resolved case definition. */\\nexport function createFromDef(\\n  def: CaseDef,\\n  opts: { seed?: number; difficulty?: Difficulty; seats?: number; attract?: boolean; simple?: boolean; gift?: Seat['gift'] } = {},\\n): Op {\\n  const difficulty = opts.difficulty ?? 'resident';\\n  const diff = diffOf(difficulty);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, Math.min(4, opts.seats ?? 1));\\n  const op = emptyOp(def, difficulty, opts.seed ?? 1, seats, opts.gift);\\n  op.attract = opts.attract ?? false;\\n  op.simple = opts.simple ?? false;\\n  op.slipLimit = diff.