{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_116","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No banned words were found in the labs/game TypeScript files.\n\nThe engine may contain TODO comments, but the scan only covers game text. The page CSS will use 32px body text and 64px menu items. Glyphs will be SVG in code with a PS default and an Xbox toggle. About cards will pull from a data module mirroring the exit interview. The interview JSON will live in labs/game/data/about.json and also in the work root as exit-interview.json for a matching test. The about screen will import that JSON.\n\nThe one-file build must embed the interview data directly into the HTML. Importing the JSON into the bundle achieves this. The work-root exit-interview.json is a separate hand-in file for tools to read.\n\nPROGRESS.md will go in the work folder and TESTING-LOG.md in labs/game. The game flow will be a state machine in app/flow.ts that the page calls; the UI module renders it without touching the DOM. I am also checking rankFor to show ranks on the board. To keep things compact, I will combine several related files into single modules.\n\nui/copy.ts will hold all screen strings for the scan. ui/shell.ts will manage DOM screens. app/save.ts and net/sessionBoot.ts are also being combined into single modules. The main.ts rewrite must keep the starter scene registered so ?scene=game:play still works. The replay tool imports game scenes, so the replay file's scene ID must be discoverable.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cf95ef38-7751-4b08-9003-ba0f98155f0c-104","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/replays/bot.replay.json","limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cf95ef38-7751-4b08-9003-ba0f98155f0c-105","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"scenes|import\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/sim/replay.ts","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1977,"output_tokens":854,"cache_read_input_tokens":137600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"43522120-f50b-4554-9707-1ae4b06f6fd1"}
