{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cfd1c129-0e13-45a6-8f87-4626e948eede-118","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"320→      'WREN: You are on the table. The misunderstanding can wait in the hall.',\\n      'ODIE: Mercy. That is the name on the batch in his chest. They really do not hear themselves.',\\n      'SABINE: Three movements. Motes, then she stops the heart on purpose, then she tries to live in it. We answer all three.',\\n      'WREN: Every tool. I want them where my hands already know the order.',\\n      'ODIE: We could be slow. I said it. I will not say it again. You answered.',\\n      'VOSS: If I die, the city loses a great deal of optimism.',\\n      'WREN: If you die, the city loses a man. I am not operating on the optimism.',\\n      'SABINE: Anesthesia first. Burn the motes. When she opens, the binder, three times, inside the gift if the last movement demands it.',\\n      'ODIE: Codes when she asks for them. Land the green. Do not show off.',\\n      'WREN: Lucan. I am sorry. I will keep saying it. It does not make you clean. It makes me accurate.',\\n330→      'SABINE: I have the second pair of hands. Swap if you freeze. Freezing is information. Use it and move.',\\n      'ODIE: Vitals one hundred. She has not started. The hymn is going to be unpleasant.',\\n      'WREN: Then we play a louder one. Begin.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'after-8',\\n    where: 'Dawn, the ward',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'VOSS: You saved me. That is the one thing I could never have sold.',\\n340→      'WREN: The cuffs were not my department. The heart was. Both seem to be holding.',\\n      'ODIE: Tomás sent a card. Gwen sent a recording of your name, played badly on purpose. I am framing the intent, not the pitch.',\\n      'SABINE: Hal waved at the building from the bus. Ana threatened a winch and then smiled, which I am told is rare and expensive.',\\n      'CHIEF: The files are copied. I will say the sentence in a room with a stenographer. I am tired of rooms without one.',\\n      'MARIS: The wing can keep its name. I am keeping my pulse. We are not even.',\\n      'WREN: I thought there would be a last patient and then a locked door.',\\n      'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN.',\\n      'SABINE: Then we are not finished. We are between pages. Doctors know that shape.',\\n      'WREN: Free surgery. Anyone who comes. The board stays up.',\\n      'ODIE: And you will eat before the next one. This is now a clinical order.',\\n350→      'VOSS: I will testify. Do not thank me. Thank the part of the night that was not for sale.',\\n      'WREN: I was never going to thank you. I am glad you are alive to be difficult.',\\n      'ODIE: Credits, then. Names, then the door. The harbour is still there. So are we.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n];\\n\\n/** The scene with this id. */\\nexport function sceneById(id: string): Scene | undefined {\\n  return SCENES.find((scene) => scene.id === id);\\n360→}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"320→      'WREN: You are on the table. The misunderstanding can wait in the hall.',\\n      'ODIE: Mercy. That is the name on the batch in his chest. They really do not hear themselves.',\\n      'SABINE: Three movements. Motes, then she stops the heart on purpose, then she tries to live in it. We answer all three.',\\n      'WREN: Every tool. I want them where my hands already know the order.',\\n      'ODIE: We could be slow. I said it. I will not say it again. You answered.',\\n      'VOSS: If I die, the city loses a great deal of optimism.',\\n      'WREN: If you die, the city loses a man. I am not operating on the optimism.',\\n      'SABINE: Anesthesia first. Burn the motes. When she opens, the binder, three times, inside the gift if the last movement demands it.',\\n      'ODIE: Codes when she asks for them. Land the green. Do not show off.',\\n      'WREN: Lucan. I am sorry. I