{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_127","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding gala scenes before the closing of SCENES.\n\nAdding a colleague override to world.ts. Writing validate.ts, content.test.ts, and scenes/bridge.ts.\n\nDesigning a shared hands codec in scenes/handsCodec.ts for scene and sim to use. It packs hand data into 10 numbers per seat.\n\nFinishing the hands codec with a null guard. Planning scenes/main.ts under 400 lines. Moving defineSettings to scenes/tune.ts. Starting a Chart component with hash and status fields.\n\nAdding title, vitals, clock, score, phase, slips, and blob fields to the Chart component.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-55aeb881-35df-4273-abe5-94038e567e58-119","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"light:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/world/props","glob":"*.ts","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1084,"output_tokens":2195,"cache_read_input_tokens":156032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"88368117-9c26-4ce2-86ec-6ca0b2797d11"}
