econd-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/dev/actions.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"  help: \\\"Lists the run's dev actions: the scene's own, then the engine's (god, freeze, spawn, travel, timeScale).\\\",\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"df5641d0-1995-47d5-9f9e-edb33c69b640"}
