111,117,110,100,44,32,100,111,109,101,44,32,115,117,110,44,32,97,109,98,105,101,110,116,44,32,102,111,103,44,32,98,97,99,107,100,114,111,112,44,32,112,111,105,110,116,76,105,103,104,116,115,32,125,41,34,44,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":2,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/gfx/skyKind.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\" * defineSky('sky:dusk', { background: '#402030', sun: { intensity: 1, elevation: 0.1 } }, reg).sun.azimuth; // 0: as the field's default\"},{\"line_number\":101,\"content\":\"      defineWith: \\\"defineSky('sky:<name>', { background, dome, sun, ambient, fog, backdrop, pointLights })\\\",\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"61317593-221c-4006-a243-fc3efc0c3d48"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_145","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking for sky:hall and builtins.\n\nLeaving sky empty or using sky:day is optional. Writing code in a large batch now. Tests will run after the content test is written. Campaign autoplay works in Node via director.playThrough. Browser e2e tests remain separate. Invalid custom geometry could fail qa geo checks.\n\nDesigning a 48×32 grid with proper indices, normals, UVs, and positions. Will set a real size to avoid degenerate triangles in QA checks. Including color, normal, UV, position, and index attributes.\n\nWill compute vertex normals, bounding box, and bounding sphere for proper culling. The grid uses Uint16 indices since it has fewer than 65,536 vertices. Also planning a test to verify the sheet module loads correctly.\n\nSheet module imports are valid in Vitest. Headless scene tests will spawn a crate instead of the sheet prop if props.ts is not imported, which is acceptable for simulation. I will import the props module into the scene test to prevent spawnProp from throwing on an unknown prop.\n\nProps and geometry are registered through the page barrel at import time, so headless tests must import the props module before calling createHeadless. The test will import '../view/props' to trigger defineProp, then create the scene. Importing sheet.ts also registers the custom geometry.\n\nHeadless tests will import the props module before starting to ensure the registry is populated. The scene file itself does not need to import props because the registry is global. Missing prop IDs fall back to crate with a warning. Physics bodies for the custom level require the level to be compiled first.\n\nHeadless tests can omit level registration because the simulation adds bodies manually. The play scene references level:arena, but compileLevel does not register it. createHeadless works without that registration. The level ID is likely optional for the sim.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b6bd5fa-2d86-44ec-b9dc-2ebcf88a28de-137","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export async function createHeadless|levels\\?","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/app/headless.ts","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":433,"output_tokens":1091,"cache_read_input_tokens":175104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"7e9ee1ec-96fa-41dc-8176-9064bd3f36b6"}
