{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8383a070-7090-4b5f-b021-c81a082d4987-138","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"300→            draw: drawing && (() => drawing.draw()),\\n            carry: drawing && view ? () => view.carry() : undefined,\\n            camera: view ? (code, blend) => void view.setCamera(code, { blend }) : undefined,\\n            setView: (path, value) => (drawing ? drawing.setView(path, value) : run.session.set(path, value)),\\n            shoot: drawing && ((shotOptions) => drawing.shot(shotOptions)),\\n          },\\n          text,\\n          playOptions,\\n        );\\n      } finally {\\n310→        playing = false;\\n        // The loop was held, so no frame passed for the stops its steps asked for: left in the outbox, they would\\n        // freeze the first live frame after it.\\n        takeHitStop(run.session.world);\\n      }\\n    },\\n  };\\n  const inspector = createInspector(host);\\n  hosts.set(inspector, host);\\n  return {\\n320→    inspector,\\n    host,\\n    get session() {\\n      return run.session;\\n    },\\n    get clock() {\\n      return run.clock;\\n    },\\n    view,\\n    stepOnce,\\n330→    stepped,\\n    get playing() {\\n      return playing;\\n    },\\n    begin,\\n    meter,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n340→ * Starts a scene headless, in this process, and returns its inspector: the members a page's `window.__engine` has\\n * (`step`, `hash`, `state`, `set`…; `help()` lists them all), minus a renderer. With `view: true` it also builds the\\n * scene's view, for `scene.dump()` and `camera`. Throws `CORE_NO_ENTRY` for an unknown scene id, `CORE_BAD_SETTING`\\n * for a bad setting, `SIM_BAD_SEED` for a seed a replay cannot hold, and with a view `APP_NO_LEVEL` for a level not\\n * registered.\\n */\\nexport async function createHeadless<C extends object = AnyComponents, E extends EventMap = EventMap>(\\n  options: HeadlessOptions<C, E>,\\n): Promise<Headless> {\\n  return createAppHost(options).inspector;\\n350→}\\n\\n/** The run behind a headless engine: its session (world, settings, recording) and clock. Tools only. */\\nexport function headlessHost(headless: Headless): InspectorHost {\\n  const host = hosts.get(headless);\",\"content_concise\":\"300→            draw: drawing && (() => drawing.draw()),\\n            carry: drawing && view ? () => view.carry() : undefined,\\n            camera: view ? (code, blend) => void view.setCamera(code, { blend }) : undefined,\\n            setView: (path, value) => (drawing ? drawing.setView(path, value) : run.session.set(path, value)),\\n            shoot: drawing && ((shotOptions) => drawing.shot(shotOptions)),\\n          },\\n          text,\\n          playOptions,\\n        );\\n      } finally {\\n310→        playing = false;\\n        // The loop was held, so no frame passed for the stops its steps asked for: left in the outbox, they would\\n        // freeze the first live frame after it.\\n        takeHitStop(run.session.world);\\n      }\\n    },\\n  };\\n  const inspector = createInspector(host);\\n  hosts.set(inspector, host);\\n  return {\\n320→    inspector,\\n    host,\\n    get session() {\\n      return run.session;\\n    },\\n    get clock() {\\n      return run.clock;\\n    },\\n    view,\\n    stepOnce,\\n330→    stepped,\\n    get playing() {\\n      return playing;\\n    },\\n    begin,\\n    meter,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n340→ * Starts a scene headless, in this process, and returns its inspector: the members a page's `window.__engine` has\\n * (`step`, `hash`, `state`, `set`…; `help()` lists them all), minus a renderer. With `view: true` it also builds the\\n * scene's view, for `scene.dump()` and `camera`. Throws `CORE_NO_ENTRY` for an unknown scene id, `CORE_BAD_SETTING`\\n * for a bad setting, `SIM_BAD_SEED` for a seed a replay cannot hold, and with a view `APP_NO_LEVEL` for a level not\\n * registered.\\n */\\nexport async function createHeadless<C extends object = AnyComponents, E extends EventMap = EventMap>(\\n  options: HeadlessOptions<C, E>,\\n): Promise<Headless> {\\n  return createAppHost(options).inspector;\\n350→}\\n\\n/** The run behind a headless engine: its session (world, settings, recording) and clock. Tools only. */\\nexport function headlessHost(headless: Headless): InspectorHost {\\n  const host = hosts.get(headless);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/app/headless.ts\",\"offset\":300,\"limit\":55,\"raw_output\":\"            draw: drawing && (() => drawing.draw()),\\n            carry: drawing && view ? () => view.carry() : undefined,\\n            camera: view ? (code, blend) => void view.setCamera(code, { blend }) : undefined,\\n            setView: (path, value) => (drawing ? drawing.setView(path, value) : run.session.set(path, value)),\\n            shoot: drawing && ((shotOptions) => drawing.shot(shotOptions)),\\n          },\\n          text,\\n          playOptions,\\n        );\\n      } finally {\\n        playing = false;\\n        // The loop was held, so no frame passed for the stops its steps asked for: left in the outbox, they would\\n        // freeze the first live frame after it.\\n        takeHitStop(run.session.world);\\n      }\\n    },\\n  };\\n  const inspector = createInspector(host);\\n  hosts.set(inspector, host);\\n  return {\\n    inspector,\\n    host,\\n    get session() {\\n      return run.session;\\n    },\\n    get clock() {\\n      return run.clock;\\n    },\\n    view,\\n    stepOnce,\\n    stepped,\\n    get playing() {\\n      return playing;\\n    },\\n    begin,\\n    meter,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Starts a scene headless, in this process, and returns its inspector: the members a page's `window.__engine` has\\n * (`step`, `hash`, `state`, `set`…; `help()` lists them all), minus a renderer. With `view: true` it also builds the\\n * scene's view, for `scene.dump()` and `camera`. Throws `CORE_NO_ENTRY` for an unknown scene id, `CORE_BAD_SETTING`\\n * for a bad setting, `SIM_BAD_SEED` for a seed a replay cannot hold, and with a view `APP_NO_LEVEL` for a level not\\n * registered.\\n */\\nexport async function createHeadless<C extends object = AnyComponents, E extends EventMap = EventMap>(\\n  options: HeadlessOptions<C, E>,\\n): Promise<Headless> {\\n  return createAppHost(options).inspector;\\n}\\n\\n/** The run behind a headless engine: its session (world, settings, recording) and clock. Tools only. */\\nexport function headlessHost(headless: Headless): InspectorHost {\\n  const host = hosts.get(headless);\\n\",\"total_lines\":357}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"f8082001-7e4f-4917-96f3-213013411502"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_147","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A missing level is acceptable without view:true.\n\nThe default view is false. The scene test will import props directly and add bodies from a compiled level if the level is missing. Rapier physics works in Node. The Headless step signature matches the starter. Files will be written in parallel.\n\nsession.js will be downloaded via curl. The story, types, body, world, and hash files will be updated. emptyOp needs three new fields. createFromDef will accept a colleague override from options or the definition. The scene setup will read game.colleague from settings and pass it to the operation.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The sequencer was spreading an empty target list. I’ll correct that, then wire the operation into a scene the page can actually play."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9212814b-cfbd-4480-9fab-dbac71ae0469-139","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/types.ts","old_string":"  swap: boolean;\n  hint: boolean;\n}","new_string":"  swap: boolean;\n  hint: boolean;\n  /** The radial is open, so the field runs at three fifths. */\n  radial?: boolean;\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9212814b-cfbd-4480-9fab-dbac71ae0469-140","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/types.ts","old_string":"  attract: boolean;\n  simple: boolean;","new_string":"  attract: boolean;\n  /** Dev Mode: vitals do not fall. */\n  holdVitals: boolean;\n  /** Dev Mode: the clock does not fall. */\n  holdClock: boolean;\n  /** A radial menu is open on some seat. */\n  radial: boolean;\n  si