meras. No speech. A clean landing and a worse story they can tell later.',\\n      'EDDA: I will tell it with the stairs as the villain. The stairs can take it.',\\n      'CHRIS: Thank you for the hands. I will get the next door from the side.',\\n      'WREN: Sit for one song. Then you may be heroic again.',\\n      'ODIE: Heroic is optional. Upright is the discharge criterion.',\\n      'SABINE: The night is not over. This part of it is.',\\n      'WREN: Go up slowly. We will be here if the stairs have a second opinion.',\\n      'ODIE: They will not. I have had a word with the building.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n];\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"      'ODIE: Credits, then. Names, then the door. The harbour is still there. So are we.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n];\",\"old_line\":352,\"new_string\":\"      'ODIE: Credits, then. Names, then the door. The harbour is still there. So are we.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'gala-brief',\\n    where: 'The gala stairs',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'ODIE: Two guests. One staircase. The band is still playing, which I take personally.',\\n      'WREN: Left table is Edda. Right table is Chris. Neither of them came here to be a patient.',\\n      'SABINE: I have the other pair of hands if you freeze. You will not freeze.',\\n      'WREN: 