{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_157","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The drama caption check expects `CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN` without a period, but the story line includes one because `boxes()` appends the caption after ` :: `.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The closing caption had a trailing period, so the story walk never saw the last beat. I’ll match the caption exactly."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0e07475a-bf6a-4e91-a18d-81dbe9dfdce4-168","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts","old_string":"'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN.',","new_string":"'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN',"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2598,"output_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":199680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"0954f725-0642-4474-b893-38daf7ffb610"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0e07475a-bf6a-4e91-a18d-81dbe9dfdce4-168","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN.',\",\"new_string\":\"'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN',\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN.',\",\"old_line\":346,\"new_string\":\"'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN',\",\"new_line\":346,\"context_before\":\"      'CHIEF: The files are copied. I will say the sentence in a room with a stenographer. I am tired of rooms without one.',\\n      'MARIS: The wing can keep its name. I am keeping my pulse. We are not even.',\\n      'WREN: I thought there would be a last patient and then a locked door.',\\n\",\"context_after\":\"      'SABINE: Then we are not finished. We are between pages. Doctors know that shape.',\\n      'WREN: Free surgery. Anyone who comes. The board stays up.',\\n      'ODIE: And you will eat before the next one. This is now a clinical order.',\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"      \"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"c4e08cfc-b3bb-4089-b761-ad8519b6f1ef"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_158","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Re-running the content test while writing the page.\n\nPlanning to write the remaining core files in parallel with the test: view/looks.ts, audio/songs.ts, input/hands.ts, app/campaign.ts, ui/shell.css, ui/screens.ts, net/hub.ts, main.ts, index.html, and a scene test. Also refining the campaign state machine and screen accept() behavior for end-to-end testing.\n\nCampaign flow is now fully mapped. Title screen routes to continue, new, board, scrub, settings, or about. Story advances boxes and branches to brief or credits. Brief starts the operation. Operation watches live status and ends in debrief. Debrief returns to story. Pause offers resume, retry, handbook, settings, controls, dev, or quit. Campaign will be a pure module called by the page. Autoplay logic is being drafted.\n\nAutoplay tick logic is now defined: it auto-accepts story, brief, and debrief screens, accepts title once, and advances to debrief after a win. The page will call this every frame during autoplay. An attract mode will idle on title, board, settings, about, handbook, and scrub for ten seconds before launching an attract operation; any input returns to title. Next up are campaign.ts and save.ts, followed by the DOM layer rendering HTML from the campaign state.\n\nDuring operations, hands will use botHands when autoplay, attract, or dev auto is active. The couch screen supports up to four pads; each pad claims a seat in scrub, and the operation reads from those active seats. If no pad claims a seat, the keyboard becomes seat zero. Solo play skips scrub entirely. Hands.ts will poll for active seats and return a Pointer array.\n\nThe Pointer interface now defines x, z, and a buttons map. readHands will be pure: the page passes a snapshot of input state, keys, pads, and delta time. Keyboard controls include WASD or arrows for cursor movement, mouse for absolute positioning, 1-8 for tools, click to use, and space to gift an edge. Glyphs will track the last device used as pad, key, or mouse.\n\nRadial input triggers on right-mouse or right-stick above 0.55, mapping to an angle sector and equipping on release while blocking use. Field slow is fixed at 0.6 in the simulation rather than reading the slider, since field time is not a balance key.\n\nThe radial slow slider will be exposed to the simulation by marking `game.radialSlow` as a non-view setting. The scene step will copy this value into the operation's `radialRate` field, letting the simulation read it directly.\n\nAdding `radialRate` to the Op type with a default of 0.6. The simulation will use this value for fieldDelta when radial mode is active, and the field will be hashed so replay sequences stay synchronized across peers.\n\nThe `game.radialSlow` setting will be split from the FEEL category and marked as non-view so the scene step can read it directly. `emptyOp` will initialize `radialRate` to 0.6, and the field delta calculation will clamp to a minimum of 10.\n\nDecided to keep the field slow rate fixed at 60 and skip wiring the radial slow slider into the simulation. This avoids adding a new per-operation field and keeps the replay hash stable.\n\nA scene test using createHeadless and step will be written to catch bugs in settings, spawnProp, physics, and schema validation. The scene file is expected to be about 220 lines. A double jumpPhase call was spotted in setup and openRun.\n\nConfirmed the setup publish and blob flow is safe: lastHash falls back to hashOp, the first step reconcile matches the blob snapshot, and createHeadless initializes settings correctly. A potential player spawn throw during character creation was noted.\n\nThe HTML shell will use a single draw function that writes innerHTML for story text and cards, while using textContent only for hub player names to prevent XSS. A string escape helper is being drafted.\n\nThe string escape helper is now defined. Shell sections will use `data-game` attributes. The campaign state machine is being fully drafted with a `Screen` union type and a `Camp` interface tracking focus, story box, case index, board index, and board tab.\n\nThe campaign state machine is being fully drafted with a `Screen` union type and a `Camp` interface tracking focus, story box, case index, board index, and board tab.\n\nCampaign state now tracks text size, free mode, attendance, cleared stories, ranks, postcards, hub status, touch input, HUD visibility, and author path. Menus will generate items dynamically per screen and activate the focused entry on accept. New campaigns start at story box zero with case index zero. Continue resumes the next uncleared story or falls back to new.\n\nDebrief accept will push the story after and branch to the next case or credits. Rank saving happens on debrief entry so it survives a quit; attract, dev auto, and hub modes skip local saves. The campaign module will stay compact under 400 lines. Screens will be a single HTML-returning file of roughly 400–500 lines. CSS will be one file using 10-foot sizes. main.ts will wire everything together. Audio assets are defined at import time, voice uses offline buffers, and the sheet renders live.\n\nThe hands module will use a mutable Cursors state owned by the page, tracking x, z, tool, radial, and previous edge states per seat. Mouse input maps to absolute field coordinates for seat zero when moved this frame, while pads integrate stick input.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-703919b4-5b1e-4664-8faa-cd6422da1310-169","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.test.ts","new_string":"/**\n * @file `game:main` steps an operation from `game:hands`, and a capture continues as the same body.\n */\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\nimport { createHeadless } from '../../../engine';\nimport { packHands } from '../op/codec';\nimport { idleHand } from '../op/world';\nimport { liveOp } from './bridge';\nimport { main, type Chart } from './main';\n\ndescribe('game:main', () => {\n  it('steps a case from packed hands and restores it', async () => {\n    const engine = await createHeadless({\n      scene: main,\n      seed: 1,\n      settings: { 'game.run': 'op:first-cut', 'game.seed': 1 },\n    });\n    const hand = () => {\n      const op = liveOp();\n      if (!op) return [];\n      const hands = op.seats.map((seat) => ({ ...idleHand(seat), x: seat.x + 0.01, z: seat.z }));\n      return packHands(hands);\n    };\n    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    const mid = liveOp();\n    expect(mid?.tick).toBe(30);\n    expect(mid?.status).toBe('playing');\n    const capture = engine.capture();\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    const ahead = engine.hash();\n    engine.restore(capture);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    expect(engine.hash()).toBe(ahead);\n    const chart = engine.state().entities.find((entity) => entity.chart) as { chart?: Chart } | undefined;\n    expect(chart?.chart?.status).toBe('playing');\n  });\n});\n","old_string":""}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-703919b4-5b1e-4664-8faa-cd6422da1310-170","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731 && ./node_modules/.bin/vitest run labs/game/op/content.test.ts labs/game/scenes/main.test.ts --reporter=verbose","description":"Re-run content test and scene boot"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":532,"output_tokens":3708,"cache_read_input_tokens":202240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"4de485eb-31f5-430b-9a3b-8e74f25d5ee3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-703919b4-5b1e-4664-8faa-cd6422da1310-169","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file `game:main` steps an operation from `game:hands`, and a capture continues as the same body.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createHeadless } from '../../../engine';\\nimport { packHands } from '../op/codec';\\nimport { idleHand } from '../op/world';\\nimport { liveOp } from './bridge';\\nimport { main, type Chart } from './main';\\n\\ndescribe('game:main', () => {\\n  it('steps a case from packed hands and restores it', async () => {\\n    const engine = await createHeadless({\\n      scene: main,\\n      seed: 1,\\n      settings: { 'game.run': 'op:first-cut', 'game.seed': 1 },\\n    });\\n    const hand = () => {\\n      const op = liveOp();\\n      if (!op) return [];\\n      const hands = op.seats.map((seat) => ({ ...idleHand(seat), x: seat.x + 0.01, z: seat.z }));\\n      return packHands(hands);\\n    };\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\\n    const mid = liveOp();\\n    expect(mid?.tick).toBe(30);\\n    expect(mid?.status).toBe('playing');\\n    const capture = engine.capture();\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\\n    const ahead = engine.hash();\\n    engine.restore(capture);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\\n    expect(engine.hash()).toBe(ahead);\\n    const chart = engine.state().entities.find((entity) => entity.chart) as { chart?: Chart } | undefined;\\n    expect(chart?.chart?.status).toBe('playing');\\n  });\\n});\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.test.ts has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.test.ts has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.test.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file `game:main` steps an operation from `game:hands`, and a capture continues as the same body.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createHeadless } from '../../../engine';\\nimport { packHands } from '../op/codec';\\nimport { idleHand } from '../op/world';\\nimport { liveOp } from './bridge';\\nimport { main, type Chart } from './main';\\n\\ndescribe('game:main', () => {\\n  it('steps a case from packed hands and restores it', async () => {\\n    const engine = await createHeadless({\\n      scene: main,\\n      seed: 1,\\n      settings: { 'game.run': 'op:first-cut', 'game.seed': 1 },\\n    });\\n    const hand = () => {\\n      const op = liveOp();\\n      if (!op) return [];\\n      const hands = op.seats.map((seat) => ({ ...idleHand(seat), x: seat.x + 0.01, z: seat.z }));\\n      return packHands(hands);\\n    };\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\\n    const mid = liveOp();\\n    expect(mid?.tick).toBe(30);\\n    expect(mid?.status).toBe('playing');\\n    const capture = engine.capture();\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\\n    const ahead = engine.hash();\\n    engine.restore(capture);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\\n    expect(engine.hash()).toBe(ahead);\\n    const chart = engine.state().entities.find((entity) => entity.chart) as { chart?: Chart } | undefined;\\n    expect(chart?.chart?.status).toBe('playing');\\n  });\\n});\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-703919b4-5b1e-4664-8faa-cd6422da1310-170","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[40,110,111,100,101,58,52,49,48,53,52,54,50,41,32,87,97,114,110,105,110,103,58,32,84,104,101,32,39,78,79,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,105,115,32,105,103,110,111,114,101,100,32,100,117,101,32,116,111,32,116,104,101,32,39,70,79,82,67,69,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,98,101,105,110,103,32,115,101,116,46,10,40,85,115,101,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,45,45,116,114,97,99,101,45,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,115,32,46,46,46,96,32,116,111,32,115,104,111,119,32,119,104,101,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,32,119,97,115,32,99,114,101,97,116,101,100,41,10,10,32,82,85,78,32,32,118,52,46,49,46,49,50,32,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,111,109,112,97,115,115,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,101,110,116,101,114,45,83,101,99,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,10,10,40,110,111,100,101,58,52,49,48,53,52,57,50,41,32,87,97,114,110,105,110,103,58,32,84,104,101,32,39,78,79,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,105,115,32,105,103,110,111,114,101,100,32,100,117,101,32,116,111,32,116,104,101,32,39,70,79,82,67,69,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,98,101,105,110,103,32,115,101,116,46,10,40,85,115,101,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,45,45,116,114,97,99,101,45,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,115,32,46,46,46,96,32,116,111,32,115,104,111,119,32,119,104,101,114,101,32,116,10