 the step)',\"},{\"line_number\":179,\"content\":\"  restore(capture: WorldCapture): void;\"},{\"line_number\":372,\"content\":\"    restore(capture) {\"},{\"line_number\":373,\"content\":\"      enter('restore()', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":379,\"content\":\"        physics?.restore(restored.physics);\"},{\"line_number\":386,\"content\":\"        timers.restore(restored.timers);\"},{\"line_number\":387,\"content\":\"        if (restored.systems) systems.restore(restored.systems as readonly never[]);\"},{\"line_number\":388,\"content\":\"        if (restored.listeners) emitter.restore(restored.listeners);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/core/events.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\" * memory only), and `restore(snapshot)` puts them back on the same emitter: a used-up `once` or a removed listener\"},{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"    template: 'restore() got {what}, not a snapshot of this emitter',\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"    fix: 'pass restore() what snapshot() of the same emitter returned: listeners are functions, which never move between emitters',\"},{\"line_number\":116,\"content\":\"  restore(snapshot: EventsSnapshot): void;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/sim/capture.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * sim RNG state, plus the physics hook's part (Rapier's snapshot, WP 3.1), and `restore()` puts it back so the next\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\" * w.restore(deserialize(text) as unknown as WorldCapture);\"},{\"line_number\":52,\"content\":\"    fix: 'pass restore() what capture() returned (or its serialize/deserialize round trip), unchanged, to a world with the same step rate, component kinds, settings, physics and schedule (systems and listeners)',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/sim/state.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":89,\"content\":\"  restore(data: unknown): void;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/dev/members.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":108,\"content\":\"    restore: (capture: Parameters<Session['restore']>[0]) => session.restore(capture),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/dev/inspector.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":101,\"content\":\"  restore(capture: WorldCapture): void;\"},{\"line_number\":281,\"content\":\"    impl: (h, capture: WorldCapture) => h.session.restore(capture),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/gfx/post/chain.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":313,\"content\":\"      grid.restore();\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/gfx/post/grid.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\" * Invariants: pure but for `frameGrid`, which moves the camera until its `restore()`; equal chains and sizes give\"},{\"line_number\":81,\"content\":\"  restore(): void;\"},{\"line_number\":84,\"content\":\"/** Snaps `camera` for a frame of `chain` drawn `size` big (see the file comment); call `restore()` after it. */\"},{\"line_number\":95,\"content\":\"    restore: () => grid?.restore(),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/run