Prop('<id>', { parts: [{ geometry: '…', material: '…' }], body: { type: 'dynamic', … } })\\n[CORE_UNKNOWN_ID] there is no prop \\\"prop:monitor\\\" (did you mean \\\"prop:door\\\"?); prop \\\"prop:crate\\\" stands in for it: fix the id (node x describe prop lists the defined ones), or define it with defineProp('<id>', { parts: [{ geometry: '…', material: '…' }], body: { type: 'dynamic', … } })\\n[CORE_UNKNOWN_ID] there is no prop \\\"prop:board\\\" (did you mean \\\"prop:door\\\"?); prop \\\"prop:crate\\\" stands in for it: fix the id (node x describe prop lists the defined ones), or define it with defineProp('<id>', { parts: [{ geometry: '…', material: '…' }], body: { type: 'dynamic', … } })\\ntick 30 snapLen 5360 roundtrip true\\nahead 27dfa482dd0f47c4 op ec27d203 tick 50\\nafter restore live tick 50 chart blob tick 30\\nchart blob equals midSnap true\\nmodule still ahead? 30\\nstale path 27dfa482dd0f47c4 op 5b750215 vs 5b750215 end ec27d203 tick 50\\nrecorded path 27dfa482dd0f47c4 expected 27dfa482dd0f47c4 match true tick 50\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731 && ./node_modules/.bin/tsx /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/debug-restore.mts\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Diagnose capture/restore hash mismatch\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151/terminal/call-c233f911-a69d-4f30-a83a-4fbeb1485c34-30.log\",\"total_bytes\":1953}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"8a5b2ffe-2124-