{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_172","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The dining table is dynamic and small.\n\nI'll keep the existing table and lamp. The four missing props will be added as fixed or none. This avoids dynamic crate physics but changes behavior from the previous failing test, which has no golden reference.\n\nProps will be defined in `labs/game/scenes/props.ts` using `defineProp` from sim-api. The test needs to sync from chart before hands, and the bridge needs `followChart`. I'm checking line length limits and prettier formatting.\n\nThe props file is being written with `defineProp` for the sheet and drape. The sheet is a thin tinted box. The drape is a green part on a stand.\n\nThe drape now has a green cloth and a brown pole. The monitor prop is being defined with a screen part.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The hash diverges because the cursor is read from the in-memory operation before a restore copies the chart back. I’ll sync from the chart first, and define the four missing props."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-65bb3af7-4506-449c-b20c-a4dfeaa6d59d-36","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/bridge.ts","old_string":"/** Replace the live operation. Capture and restore call this with the parsed snapshot. */\nexport function adoptOp(op: Op | null): void {\n  live = op;\n}","new_string":"/** Replace the live operation. Capture and restore call this with the parsed snapshot. */\nexport function adoptOp(op: Op | null): void {\n  live = op;\n}\n\n/**\n * Make the live operation the chart's snapshot. Call this after a restore and before reading cursors: the module\n * copy is not part of the world capture, and the chart is.\n */\nexport function followChart(blob: string): void {\n  if (!blob) {\n    live = null;\n    return;\n  }\n  if (live && snapshot(live) === blob) return;\n  live = parseSnapshot(blob);\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-65bb3af7-4506-449c-b20c-a4dfeaa6d59d-37","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.ts","old_string":"import { FIELD_AT, OR } from './room';\nimport { GAME_SETTINGS, TUNE } from './tune';","new_string":"import { FIELD_AT, OR } from './room';\nimport './props';\nimport { GAME_SETTINGS, TUNE } from './tune';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-65bb3af7-4506-449c-b20c-a4dfeaa6d59d-38","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.test.ts","old_string":"import { packHands } from '../op/codec';\nimport { idleHand } from '../op/world';\nimport { liveOp } from './bridge';\nimport { main, type Chart } from './main';\n\ndescribe('game:main', () => {\n  it('steps a case from packed hands and restores it', async () => {\n    const engine = await createHeadless({\n      scene: main,\n      seed: 1,\n      settings: { 'game.run': 'op:first-cut', 'game.seed': 1 },\n    });\n    const hand = () => {\n      const op = liveOp();\n      if (!op) return [];\n      const hands = op.seats.map((seat) => ({ ...idleHand(seat), x: seat.x + 0.01, z: seat.z }));\n      return packHands(hands);\n    };\n    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    const mid = liveOp();\n    expect(mid?.tick).toBe(30);\n    expect(mid?.status).toBe('playing');\n    const capture = engine.capture();\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    const ahead = engine.hash();\n    engine.restore(capture);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    expect(engine.hash()).toBe(ahead);","new_string":"import { packHands } from '../op/codec';\nimport { idleHand } from '../op/world';\nimport { followChart, liveOp } from './bridge';\nimport { main, type Chart } from './main';\n\n/** The chart is what capture stores. The cursors are read from it, so a restore is in effect before the next hands. */\nfunction sync(engine: { state: () => { entities: { chart?: Chart }[] } }): void {\n  const blob = engine.state().entities.find((entity) => entity.chart)?.chart?.blob;\n  if (blob) followChart(blob);\n}\n\ndescribe('game:main', () => {\n  it('steps a case from packed hands and restores it', async () => {\n    const engine = await createHeadless({\n      scene: main,\n      seed: 1,\n      settings: { 'game.run': 'op:first-cut', 'game.seed': 1 },\n    });\n    const hand = () => {\n      sync(engine);\n      const op = liveOp();\n      if (!op) return [];\n      const hands = op.seats.map((seat) => ({ ...idleHand(seat), x: seat.x + 0.01, z: seat.z }));\n      return packHands(hands);\n    };\n    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    const mid = liveOp();\n    expect(mid?.tick).toBe(30);\n    expect(mid?.status).toBe('playing');\n    const capture = engine.capture();\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    const ahead = engine.hash();\n    engine.restore(capture);\n    sync(engine);\n    expect(liveOp()?.tick).toBe(30);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) engine.step(1, { 'game:hands': hand() });\n    expect(engine.hash()).toBe(ahead);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-65bb3af7-4506-449c-b20c-a4dfeaa6d59d-39","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/props.ts","content":"/**\n * @file The theatre props the scene stands around the sheet. The table and the lamp are the engine's. These four are\n * this game's: a pad, two drapes, a monitor and a board. None of them has a body, so they never fall onto the player.\n */\nimport { defineProp } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\n\ndefineProp('prop:sheet', {\n  description: 'The sterile pad on the table. The operation is drawn on a mesh above it.',\n  parts: [\n    {\n      name: 'pad',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 2.4, height: 0.04, depth: 1.2 },\n      material: 'material:cloth',\n      tint: '#efe8dc',\n    },\n  ],\n});\n\ndefineProp('prop:drape', {\n  description: 'A green drape on a pole, screening the theatre from the rest of the room.',\n  parts: [\n    {\n      name: 'cloth',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 1.6, height: 2.4, depth: 0.02 },\n      material: 'material:cloth',\n      tint: '#1c6b58',\n      position: [0, 1.2, 0],\n    },\n    {\n      name: 'pole',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 0.04, height: 2.4, depth: 0.04 },\n      material: 'material:iron',\n      tint: '#8d887c',\n    },\n  ],\n});\n\ndefineProp('prop:monitor', {\n  description: 'A vitals monitor on a stand, its dark screen facing the table.',\n  parts: [\n    {\n      name: 'screen',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 0.56, height: 0.36, depth: 0.04 },\n      material: 'material:paint',\n      tint: '#141c1a',\n      position: [0, 1.4, 0],\n    },\n    {\n      name: 'bezel',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 0.62, height: 0.42, depth: 0.03 },\n      material: 'material:paint',\n      tint: '#2c3330',\n      position: [0, 1.4, -0.02],\n    },\n    {\n      name: 'stand',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 0.08, height: 1.2, depth: 0.08 },\n      material: 'material:iron',\n    },\n  ],\n});\n\ndefineProp('prop:board', {\n  description: 'A board of case notes on a stand beside the table.',\n  parts: [\n    {\n      name: 'face',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 0.9, height: 0.7, depth: 0.03 },\n      material: 'material:planks',\n      tint: '#d9d3c4',\n      position: [0, 1.45, 0],\n    },\n    {\n      name: 'post',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 0.06, height: 1.2, depth: 0.06 },\n      material: 'material:iron',\n    },\n  ],\n});\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3860,"output_tokens":4095,"cache_read_input_tokens":78336,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"27950a86-4e1c-40e2-a2c1-439f04739613"}
