14,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":11,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"/** `WHO: line` or `WHO: line :: CAPTION`. */\"},{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"    const cut = line.indexOf(' :: ');\"},{\"line_number\":99,\"content\":\"      'WREN: It moved. :: IT MOVED.',\"},{\"line_number\":159,\"content\":\"      'GWEN: It is moving. I would like to be wrong in public. :: THE SCAR MOVES.',\"},{\"line_number\":179,\"content\":\"      'CHIEF: The sample is gone. :: SAMPLE GONE.',\"},{\"line_number\":204,\"content\":\"      'ANA: I am not a trial. I am a stevedore and I am going over. :: ON THE DECK.',\"},{\"line_number\":239,\"content\":\"      'CHIEF: Not here. Not in front of them. :: THE COLLAR OPENS.',\"},{\"line_number\":259,\"content\":\"      'CHIEF: I signed them all. :: I SIGNED THEM.',\"},{\"line_number\":280,\"content\":\"      'ODIE: Three tables. Three donors. One speech that will not stop for haemorrhage. :: THEY ARE FALLING.',\"},{\"line_number\":304,\"content\":\"      'VOSS: And if you have ever felt too much, ask yourself who sold you that— :: HE FALLS.',\"},{\"line_number\":346,\"content\":\"      'ODIE: There is a manifest. A crate. Already at sea. :: CASE FILE REMAINS OPEN',\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"886edb6d-d3bb-49c9-8876-492834cb1cc0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_206","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking if the Attract story clip uses before-4, which contains IT MOVED.\n\nThe IT MOVED drama clip belongs in after-2. The attract sequence now uses logo, op, and story scenes.\n\nThe attract sequence now includes six case clips and a cards clip. Total runtime is 192 seconds.\n\nThe attract sequence is now 186 seconds. Five short ops are 24 seconds each, mercy is 26 seconds, logo is 6 seconds, story is 18 seconds, and cards is 16 seconds.\n\nNext: write the code, patch scene and props, and tune. The followChart logic will update liveOp after every simulation step so the page stays current.\n\nfollowChart will read the chart blob from the world entity at the start of each frame to handle restores. Dev sliders will call inspector.set so scene applyTune can apply the changes.\n\nReset sliders will return to fallback values. Dev actions like oneHit and spawnStrain will use inspector.actions.run with the correct arguments. Frame stepping pauses the simulation before advancing one step. Time scale, free camera mode, HUD visibility, and replay recording are also wired through inspector calls.\n\nA compact dev panel will record cursor points while the author tab is active and copy them to the clipboard. Hash values from inspector and chart will be shown on screen. A fast Vitest test in app/ will avoid DOM or engine imports.\n\nCampaign.ts will import TUNE and FEEL from tune, which pulls in the engine via sim-api. This is acceptable for Vitest because other tests already load the engine.\n\nThe attract idle logic ticks while the screen is a menu and the hub is inactive. After ten seconds of idle time, it enters the attract sequence.\n\nThe autoplay driver lives in the page, not the campaign. It advances automatically through story, brief, and debrief screens by calling accept. At the title screen it selects a new shift and accepts immediately. Credits are skipped entirely.\n\nAutoplay will call a new `startShift` helper to begin a fresh shift instead of selecting Continue. E2E tests will use keyboard input for menus, with a stub pad available if the page polls gamepads.\n\nA dedicated pad test will initialize a gamepad and verify that D-pad and cross inputs move menu focus. Menu navigation will also support mouse clicks on items and pointer movement to set focus. The engine's player input will be suppressed during menus so the UI can receive controls.\n\nDuring an operation, modal mode blocks all engine intents so the virtual hand axis never reaches the simulation. Pausing the inspector stops the clock entirely. The card hub is HTML-based and does not use menus; it pauses the simulation until its timer reaches zero.\n\nThe host steps the simulation directly with explicit intents, bypassing the virtual device entirely. The host will merge the latest client packets with its own seat data to build hands. Seats will be assigned by player index, and the README is being checked for a `seat` field in local player info.\n\nThe README will be downloaded in parallel with writing the first files. The hub code will stay flexible for the `isHost`, `players`, and `local` fields that appear there. Campaign.ts will be kept under 450 lines. The title menu will show Continue only when progress.cleared is between 1 and 7, plus New Shift, Board, Scrub, Settings, and About. Board is not a list of items.\n\nBoard navigation will use a `nudge` function. Horizontal input changes the case index, while vertical input moves focus between tabs. The board screen will list Play, Postcards, and Back. Accepting Play opens the brief if the case is cleared or free surgery is unlocked.\n\nVertical input moves focus in menus. Horizontal input browses pages or board cases.\n\nBoard accepts open the brief for unlocked cases. Postcards do nothing.\n\nScrub has four slots. Keyboard claims seat zero. Pads claim their own seats via the page. Start appears only when a seat is claimed.\n\nSettings has four pages: Audio, Controls, Gameplay, and Display.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The scene restore path is fixed. Next I’ll add the operation view, the campaign screens, and the page that boots them."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96c0ba61-9042-4536-acae-c323fd50b4b8-126","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.ts","old_string":"import { setSlider } from '../op/balance';\nimport { unpackHands } from '../op/codec';\nimport { failOp } from '../op/ratings';\nimport { stepOp, lastHash } from '../op/step';","new_string":"import { setSlider } from '../op/balance';\nimport { botHands } from '../op/bot';\nimport { unpackHands } from '../op/codec';\nimport { failOp } from '../op/ratings';\nimport { stepOp, lastHash } from '../op/step';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96c0ba61-9042-4536-acae-c323fd50b4b8-127","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.ts","old_string":"    applyTune(w, op);\n    stepOp(op, unpackHands(intents['game:hands'], op.seats.length));\n  }","new_string":"    applyTune(w, op);\n    const auto = op.attract || w.settings.get<boolean>('game.autoplay');\n    const hands = auto ? botHands(op) : unpackHands(intents['game:hands'], op.seats.length);\n    stepOp(op, hands);\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96c0ba61-9042-4536-acae-c323fd50b4b8-128","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/main.ts","old_string":"  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:board', at: [at.x - 3.2, 0, at.z - 1], yaw: 0.2 });\n}","new_string":"  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:board', at: [at.x - 3.2, 0, at.z - 1], yaw: 0.2 });\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:cursor', at: [at.x, at.y, at.z], yaw: 0 });\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96c0ba61-9042-4536-acae-c323fd50b4b8-129","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/tune.ts","old_string":"  'game.seed': {\n    type: 'integer',\n    default: 1,\n    minimum: 0,\n    maximum: 999999,\n    when: 'scene',\n    description: 'The operation seed. The engine seed still restarts the scene.',\n  },","new_string":"  'game.seed': {\n    type: 'integer',\n    default: 1,\n    minimum: 0,\n    maximum: 999999,\n    when: 'scene',\n    description: 'The operation seed. The engine seed still restarts the scene.',\n  },\n  'game.autoplay': {\n    type: 'boolean',\n    default: false,\n    when: 'now',\n    description: 'The operation plays itself, one fresh bot hand every step. The page uses it to walk the shift.',\n  },"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96c0ba61-9042-4536-acae-c323fd50b4b8-130","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/props.ts","old_string":"defineProp('prop:sheet', {\n  description: 'The sterile pad on the table. The operation is drawn on a mesh above it.',\n  parts: [\n    {\n      name: 'pad',\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\n      params: { width: 2.4, height: 0.04, depth: 1.2 },\n      material: 'material:cloth',\n      tint: '#efe8dc',\n    },\n  ],\n});","new_string":"defineProp('prop:sheet', {\n  description: 'The living sheet. The page rewrites its vertices each frame: breath, heartbeat, wounds and blood.',\n  parts: [\n    {\n      name: 'mesh',\n      geometry: 'geometry:sheet',\n      material: 'material:tissue',\n    },\n  ],\n});\n\ndefineProp('prop:cursor', {\n  description: 'The gloved hand and the tool, rewritten each frame so they sit on the cursor.',\n  parts: [\n    {\n      name: 'mesh',\n      geometry: 'geometry:cursor',\n      material: 'material:glove',\n    },\n  ],\n});"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96c0ba61-9042-4536-acae-c323fd50b4b8-131","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"field","content":"field: Living sheet, hands, HUD, campaign screens","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"front","content":"front: Title, story, board, pause, settings, glyphs, attract, dev mode","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":490,"output_tokens":3919,"cache_read_input_tokens":182272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"973588d8-9372-49a5-99f6-ec1b9e8a47cc"}
