{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_219","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to identify the Hand interface fields and Op fields the HUD requires.\n\nI also need inspector.input.axis, screenRay, onFloor, FIELD_AT, OR_TEXT, ARENA_TEXT, and play.id. I will check the defineSfx schema and run tests after writing. I am reviewing Hand, Op events, the inspector axis method, and screenRay signature to support Odie lines. Page files under labs/game/ can import engine/index. Sim-side files cannot. tools/*.mjs need @file headers and a 600-line limit.\n\nI will examine the story box type and case patient. The e2e test must cover boot, playthrough, attract mode, glyphs, menus, dev slider, touch and WebGPU messages, audio analyser, couch pads, and data-game attributes. I will design the DOM with data-game attributes and expose campaign on window.__compass so the test can drive it.\n\nThe e2e playthrough will use a stub pad to walk through title, board, story, and debriefs. The page must read gamepads for menu navigation. When autoplay is set via URL, the scene will bot the ops at a raised timeScale. The page will also raise timeScale during autoplay ops and call finishOp when an op wins.\n\nI mapped the stub pad buttons and axes. Accept is Cross, cancel is Circle, and the dpad is on buttons 12 through 15. Left stick is axes 0 and 1.\n\nAt timescale 8, eight cases should finish in about four minutes of wall time.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b371ac21-d7f4-4c9d-8849-b868e48a047a-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/types.ts","offset":120,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b371ac21-d7f4-4c9d-8849-b868e48a047a-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"events|odie|line","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-x