21,112,101,115,46,116,115,10,50,52,50,58,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,105,110,116,101,114,102,97,99,101,32,71,97,109,101,69,118,101,110,116,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":1,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/types.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":242,\"content\":\"export interface GameEvent {\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-62895556-3c0b-4c48-939c-8121c0aa6a2f-43","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# The starter game\\n\\nEvery game made with my-3dge starts as this one (`node tools/game/new-game.mjs`), then becomes its own: rewrite this\\npage as the game grows. It is the game's page for the owner and the next agent: what the game is, how it plays, how to\\nsee it, and the calls made along the way.\\n\\n## The game\\n\\nRun round the arena collecting every gem before the clock runs out. WASD or the arrows run, Space jumps (over the low\\n10→walls), Shift dashes. All the gems: won. The clock at 0: lost. Enter starts a new round on the next seed.\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n| File                              | What it is                                                                    |\\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\\n| labs/game/scenes/play.ts          | The rules, sim-side: the arena's text, the settings, the gems, the round, the systems |\\n| labs/game/cast/player.ts          | The player: its character (run, jump, dash) and the body it is drawn as        |\\n| labs/game/bot.ts                  | The bot: plays through intents, down the flow field to the nearest gem         |\\n| labs/game/main.ts, index.html     | The page: the engine, the HUD, Enter to play again, the chase camera           |\\n20→| labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts     | The tests: the golden replay, capture and restore, the bot wins on 10 seeds, the clock |\\n| labs/game/replays/bot.replay.json | The bot's play from seed 1, with its golden hashes                             |\\n\\n## Settings\\n\\n`game.gems` (10), `game.seconds` (30) and `game.speed` (6 m/s), read when the round starts: `?game.gems=20` in the\\npage, `--set game.gems=20` for `node x sim` and `node x shot`.\\n\\n## See it\\n\\n30→```sh\\nnpm run dev                                         # http://127.0.0.1:5173/labs/game/ (?replay=bot plays the bot's run)\\nnpm test                                            # the tests\\nnode x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --feel          # the rules in Node: hash, events, how the player handles\\nnode x shot labs/game                               # the page on WebGPU, as numbers\\nnode x replay labs/game/replays --browser sim       # the goldens, in Node and Chromium\\n```\\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n40→<!-- The calls made without the owner, newest first: the date, what was decided, why. -->\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# The starter game\\n\\nEvery game made with my-3dge starts as this one (`node tools/game/new-game.mjs`), then becomes its own: rewrite this\\npage as the game grows. It is the game's page for the owner and the next agent: what the game is, how it plays, how to\\nsee it, and the calls made along the way.\\n\\n## The game\\n\\nRun round the arena collecting every gem before the clock runs out. WASD or the arrows run, Space jumps (over the low\\n10→walls), Shift dashes. All the gems: won. The clock at 0: lost. Enter starts a new round on the next seed.\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n| File                              | What it is                                                                    |\\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\\n| labs/game/scenes/play.ts          | The rules, sim-side: the arena's text, the settings, the gems, the round, the systems |\\n| labs/game/cast/player.ts          | The player: its character (run, jump, dash) and the body it is drawn as        |\\n| labs/game/bot.ts                  | The bot: plays through intents, down the flow field to the nearest gem         |\\n| labs/game/main.ts, index.html     | The page: the engine, the HUD, Enter to play again, the chase camera           |\\n20→| labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts     | The tests: the golden replay, capture and restore, the bot wins on 10 seeds, the clock |\\n| labs/game/replays/bot.replay.json | The bot's play from seed 1, with its golden hashes                             |\\n\\n## Settings\\n\\n`game.gems` (10), `game.seconds` (30) and `game.speed` (6 m/s), read when the round starts: `?game.gems=20` in the\\npage, `--set game.gems=20` for `node x sim` and `node x shot`.\\n\\n## See it\\n\\n30→```sh\\nnpm run dev                                         # http://127.0.0.1:5173/labs/game/ (?replay=bot plays the bot's run)\\nnpm test                                            # the tests\\nnode x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --feel          # the rules in Node: hash, events, how the player handles\\nnode x shot labs/game                               # the page on WebGPU, as numbers\\nnode x replay labs/game/replays --browser sim       # the goldens, in Node and Chromium\\n```\\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n40→<!-- The calls made without the owner, newest first: the date, what was decided, why. -->\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/README.md\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"# The starter game\\n\\nEvery game made with my-3dge starts as this one (`node tools/game/new-game.mjs`), then becomes its own: rewrite this\\npage as the game grows. It is the game's page for the owner and the next agent: what the game is, how it plays, how to\\nsee it, and the calls made along the way.\\n\\n## The game\\n\\nRun round the arena collecting every gem before the clock runs out. WASD or the arrows run, Space jumps (over the low\\nwalls), Shift dashes. All the gems: won. The clock at 0: lost. Enter starts a new round on the next seed.\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n| File                              | What it is                                                                    |\\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\\n| labs/game/scenes/play.ts          | The rules, sim-side: the arena's text, the settings, the gems, the round, the systems |\\n| labs/game/cast/player.ts          | The player: its character (run, jump, dash) and the body it is drawn as        |\\n| labs/game/bot.ts                  | The bot: plays through intents, down the flow field to the nearest gem         |\\n| labs/game/main.ts, index.html     | The page: the engine, the HUD, Enter to play again, the chase camera           |\\n| labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts     | The tests: the golden replay, capture and restore, the bot wins on 10 seeds, the clock |\\n| labs/game/replays/bot.replay.json | The bot's play from seed 1, with its golden hashes                             |\\n\\n## Settings\\n\\n`game.gems` (10), `game.seconds` (30) and `game.speed` (6 m/s), read when the round starts: `?game.gems=20` in the\\npage, `--set game.gems=20` for `node x sim` and `node x shot`.\\n\\n## See it\\n\\n```sh\\nnpm run dev                                         # http://127.0.0.1:5173/labs/game/ (?replay=bot plays the bot's run)\\nnpm test                                            # the tests\\nnode x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --feel          # the rules in Node: hash, events, how the player handles\\nnode x shot labs/game                               # the page on WebGPU, as numbers\\nnode x replay labs/game/replays --browser sim       # the goldens, in Node and Chromium\\n```\\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n<!-- The calls made without the owner, newest first: the date, what was decided, why. -->\\n\",\"total_lines\":40}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"9f22a56b-9864-46bb-8664-4386365f0529"}
