{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_225","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Finished cases remain on the board for score attack.\n\nThe record logic for finished cases needs fixing. Currently it only updates when the index equals cleared, so replaying a case cannot improve the best rank. I will update it to keep the better rank instead.\n\nThe extra \"Free Surgery\" card is a duplicate first-cut bug. I will remove it from boardIds so the board shows only the eight cases. The free label will appear in the shell instead. Campaign tests do not cover boardIds, so this change is safe. I also need to download session.js for the hub.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-477656af-2c18-4f3b-865b-f460a07ac0bb-54","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"events\\.push|type: 'say'|type: 'line'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-477656af-2c18-4f3b-865b-f460a07ac0bb-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input/devices/virtual.ts","offset":40,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-477656af-2c18-4f3b-865b-f460a07ac0bb-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TOOL_NAMES|export const TOOLS|name:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/table.ts","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4537,"output_tokens":630,"cache_read_input_tokens":94208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"e62db1ee-a486-