{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_248","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Music volume is set to 0.1 and master volume to 0.\n\nMaster volume is 70. I'll create an analyser node and connect it to the audio context. I'll expose a `window.__compass.hear` helper to read music volume. After the first user gesture, I'll render the song via the engine's exported `renderSong` function.\n\nI'll add a `__compass` helper that renders `sfx:beep` via an `OfflineAudioContext` and returns its peak. The end-to-end test will verify this path, confirm `volume('music')` is 0.1 and `music('song:title')` is called, and after the click check that the context runs and read the analyser's time-domain data. I'll also ensure the HTML contains no `<audio>` tags or `data:audio` URIs. Now I'm ready to batch the file writes.\n\nI'll fix the campaign and sheet paint signatures. The source index.html will contain session.js inline as a classic script so Vite leaves it untouched. I'll also download session.js.\n\nCampaign.js is 594 lines. Adding a boot field and branches could push it over the 600-line limit. I'll trim blank lines and shorten comments to stay under.\n\nI'll check line counts after edits and split files if needed. I'll run Prettier afterward. The implementation plan covers patching campaign.ts, sheet.ts, input handlers, UI modules, the audio mixer, app frame logic, main.ts, index.html, and the verification and end-to-end test scripts.\n\nI'll also write a one-file bundler script, a rain emitter, and the project documentation files. I'll add a test that compares the inline session.js in index.html against the downloaded vendor file to ensure they match.\n\nI'm starting the file writes and downloads now. I'm also defining a `PageInspector` TypeScript interface to type the inspector input methods.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce620f35-ba7d-4dff-ab42-85c6bf946a34-95","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"actions","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/dev/actions.ts","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce620f35-ba7d-4dff-ab42-85c6bf946a34-96","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"camera\\.set|id: 'camera'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/dev","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":357,"output_tokens":1241,"cache_read_input_tokens":138368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"e62a9b92-9df5-4e70-9c29-c389ca55ed50"}
