{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_252","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"currentBox returns four values: who, text, drama, and where.\n\nI'll write files now. I'll escape shell HTML and use a small helper. The interview object will match the TASK shape exactly for JSON.stringify. interview.ts will be the source of truth, with a script copying it to exit-interview.json. Tests will read that JSON file. About cards will generate from the object. The usage element stays in the DOM even when hidden so the importer can find it. It uses data-about=\"usage\" with text \"added on import\".\n\nI'll keep a single usage element in the shell footer rather than duplicating it. I'm starting to edit campaign.ts first, then I'll run tests in the background while writing the remaining files.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The operation sim is in place. I’m wiring the page around it: campaign fixes first, then input, the shell, and the hub boot."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-478a10e2-0f6d-440f-9918-e9d9ab59a530-101","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts","old_string":"import { storyCases } from '../op/cases';\nimport { caseById } from '../op/cases';","new_string":"import { caseById, storyCases } from '../op/cases';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-478a10e2-0f6d-440f-9918-e9d9ab59a530-102","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts","old_string":"  devTab: number;\n  hideHud: boolean;\n  claimed: boolean[];\n}","new_string":"  devTab: number;\n  hideHud: boolean;\n  claimed: boolean[];\n  /** Bumps when the operation should start again.