{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_266","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Releasing every step while drop is true.\n\nAdding per-seat latches for gift, drop, swap, and hint to scenes/main.ts. Each button needs its own rising-edge detection.\n\nImplemented `pulseEdges` and a `rise` helper to detect button presses. Auto hands won't update latches. Null hands are skipped.\n\nWriting the page files in a few write() calls. Checking scenes/main.ts line count after edits. The host applies gift counters as a single tick pulse so multiple steps per interval don't double-count. handsForTick builds each hand from the latest pose and sets gift true only when the sample's giftCount exceeds the applied count.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8a50f536-71ac-453d-8fb2-296ff043f014-156","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export const FIELD_SECOND","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8a50f536-71ac-453d-8fb2-296ff043f014-157","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"failReason|reason|status:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/types.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":500,"output_tokens":827,"cache_read_input_tokens":163840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"d99059b0-508c-4c61-87bb-b0f557d97b9f"}
