{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_280","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The TickMsg import may now be unused.","signature":"P3Meucm7+p0NhgIHS8mTgH+cVM0sCQqfBNy6/7hUb1DRKEgDUYiPIiQP5qjRWNptI1d7YGP64XghA4WnteLs9zVTyNTKIZthe9rOVRIjdawav5iwSeg24IaHXCjybg+gtTQFDRAmzARrAsbCY+hRXxej58ce8R7an+RN0E++skcwx6rmji4SojIo4Ezc1fTpmp4QfixSphnj+MJBdEUYfdcVCepQvAvRm9jlRIVL//rS3aaO/VOoEK+y/74F4IPPILb1tE4GUQwn"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3149553f-4f94-4ec2-92d2-36ce0f727a27-193","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/net/live.ts","old_string":"import { drainCount, HostBook, type HubInfo, type IntentMsg, type TickMsg } from './hub';","new_string":"import { drainCount, HostBook, type HubInfo, type IntentMsg } from './hub';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3149553f-4f94-4ec2-92d2-36ce0f727a27-194","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","content":"/**\n * @file The page. It starts the engine after the hub has connected, draws the screens, and feeds the operation.\n */\nimport {\n  createAudio,\n  createEngine,\n  createStore,\n  voiceOf,\n  type Engine,\n  type EngineFrame,\n  type Input,\n} from '../../../engine';\nimport { ARENA_TEXT, play } from '../scenes/play';\nimport { main } from '../scenes/main';\nimport { FIELD_AT, OR_TEXT } from '../scenes/room';\nimport { followChart, liveOp } from '../scenes/bridge';\nimport { TUNE } from '../scenes/tune';\nimport { SURGEON_MAP } from '../input/map';\nimport { endSample, gloveSpots, packedHands, samplePads, touchOnly, watchPointer, type Feel } from '../input/hands';\nimport { usePrompt } from '../input/glyphs';\nimport { paintField } from '../view/field/sheet';\nimport '../view/looks';\nimport '../view/rain';\nimport '../audio/library';\nimport { createHud, paintHud, type Hud } from '../ui/hud';\nimport { renderShell, shellStamp, type ShellExtra } from '../ui/shell';\nimport {\n  accept,\n  act,\n  browse,\n  cancel,\n  claimSeat,\n  createCampaign,\n  desiredAttract,\n  desiredRun,\n  finishOp,\n  move,\n  noteInput,\n  tickFront,\n  type Campaign,\n  type Progress,\n} from './campaign';\nimport { countPress, ZERO, type HubInfo, type Sample } from '../net/hub';\nimport { startRound, type RoundView } from '../net/live';\n\n/** The inspector calls this page uses. The engine's own type is an open bag of members. */\ninterface PageEngine {\n  pause(): void;\n  resume(): void;\n  step(n?: number, intents?: { 'game:hands': number[] }): number;\n  timeScale(k?: number): number;\n  seed(n?: number): number;\n  hash(): string;\n  set(path: string, value: unknown): unknown;\n  input: { axis(name: string, value: unknown): void; record(): unknown };\n  actions: { run(name: string, args?: unknown): unknown };\n  camera: { set(code: string, opts?: { blend?: boolean }): unknown };\n  errors: readonly { code: string }[];\n}\n\n/** AI Hub, as the pasted client exposes it. */\ninterface Hub {\n  active: boolean;\n  connect(opts: { mode: string; seats: [number, number]; card?: boolean }): Promise<HubInfo | null>;\n  ready(): void;\n  answer(which: 'ready' | 'more'): void;\n  time(): number;\n  finish(body: unknown): void;\n  send(data: unknown, opts?: { to?: number; reliable?: boolean }): boolean;\n  on(event: string, fn: (data: unknown, from?: number) => void): () => void;\n  fail(message: string): void;\n}\n\n/** The round info plus the card the players are looking at. */\ninterface Session {\n  info: HubInfo;\n  hub: Hub;\n  round: RoundView | null;\n  card: ShellExtra['card'];\n  playing: boolean;\n  sample: Sample;\n  sent: number;\n}\n\nconst DEV: Readonly<Record<string, (engine: PageEngine) => void>> = {\n  win: (engine) => engine.actions.run('winPhase'),\n  fail: (engine) => engine.actions.run('failPhase'),\n  heal: (engine) => engine.actions.run('heal'),\n  freezeVitals: (engine) => engine.actions.run('freezeVitals'),\n  freezeClock: (engine) => engine.actions.run('freezeClock'),\n  gift: (engine) => engine.actions.run('infiniteGift'),\n  oneHit: (engine) => engine.actions.run('oneHit'),\n  spawn: (engine) => engine.actions.run('spawnStrain', { kind: 'lull' }),\n  auto: (engine) => engine.set('game.autoplay', true),\n  step: (engine) => {\n    engine.pause();\n    engine.step(1);\n  },\n  slow: (engine) => engine.timeScale(0.25),\n  fast: (engine) => engine.timeScale(4),\n  fly: (engine) => engine.camera.set('cam3=fly'),\n  copy: (engine) => {\n    const text = JSON.stringify(engine.input.record());\n    void navigator.clipboard?.writeText(text);\n  },\n  reset: (engine) => {\n    for (const row of TUNE) engine.set(row.setting, row.fallback);\n  },\n};\n\n/** Query keys the engine already understands, plus this game's settings. */\nfunction searchFrom(info: HubInfo | null, autoplay: boolean): string {\n  const incoming = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\n  const search = new URLSearchParams();\n  search.set('touch', 'off');\n  search.set('post.look', 'look:harbor');\n  if (!incoming.has('cam') && !incoming.has('cam3')) {\n    search.set('cam3', `fixed,${FIELD_AT.x},${FIELD_AT.y + 11},${FIELD_AT.z},0,-78,46`);\n  }\n  for (const [key, value] of incoming) {\n    if (key.startsWith('aihub')) continue;\n    if (key === 'touch') continue;\n    if (key.startsWith('game.') || key === 'seed' || key === 'cam' || key === 'cam3' || key.startsWith('post.') || key.startsWith('gfx.')) {\n      search.set(key, value);\n    }\n  }\n  if (info) {\n    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\n    search.set('game.seed', String(info.seed));\n    search.set('game.run', 'op:case:gala-shift');\n    search.set('game.seats', String(Math.max(1, info.players.length)));\n    search.set('game.colleague', info.players.length === 1 ? '1' : '0');\n    search.set('gfx.warmUp', 'asked');\n  }\n  if (autoplay) search.set('game.autoplay', '1');\n  return `?${search}`;\n}\n\n/** Saved night, or a fresh one. */\nfunction loadProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>): Progress {\n  return store.get('progress', createCampaign().progress);\n}\n\n/** Keep a night. Attract and a hub round do not. */\nfunction saveProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>, c: Campaign, session: boolean): void {\n  if (session || c.screen === 'attract' || !c.record) return;\n  store.set('progress', c.progress);\n}\n\n/** Overhead on an operation, the harbour shot otherwise. */\nfunction placeCamera(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\n  const at = FIELD_AT;\n  const code = run.startsWith('op:')\n    ? `cam3=fixed,${at.x},${at.y + 9},${at.z + 0.4},0,-80,42`\n    : `cam3=fixed,${at.x - 1},${at.y + 4},${at.z + 6},20,-18,48`;\n  engine.camera.set(code, { blend: true });\n}\n\n/** Stillpoint, Second Pulse, and a low line, laid over the field. */\nfunction layLooks(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\n  const op = liveOp();\n  engine.set('post.look', run.startsWith('op:') ? 'look:field' : 'look:harbor');\n  const layers: { look: string; amount: number }[] = [];\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'still')) layers.push({ look: 'look:still', amount: 0.8 });\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'pulse')) layers.push({ look: 'look:pulse', amount: 0.7 });\n  if ((op?.patients[0]?.vitals ?? 100) < 30 && run.startsWith('op:')) layers.push({ look: 'look:low', amount: 0.55 });\n  engine.set('post.combine', layers);\n}\n\n/** A few syllables of the line, through the page's own gain. */\nfunction speak(audio: ReturnType<typeof createAudio>, who: string, text: string, volume: number): void {\n  const ctx = audio.context;\n  if (!ctx || ctx.state !== 'running') return;\n  const gain = ctx.createGain();\n  gain.gain.value = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, volume));\n  gain.connect(ctx.destination);\n  const indexes = voiceOf(who, text).slice(0, 18);\n  indexes.forEach((syllable, index) => {\n    const osc = ctx.createOscillator();\n    osc.type = 'sawtooth';\n    osc.frequency.value = 180 + syllable * 28;\n    osc.connect(gain);\n    const at = ctx.currentTime + index * 0.08;\n    osc.start(at);\n    osc.stop(at + 0.07);\n  });\n  audio.duck(0.4);\n}\n\n/** Start the game. `info` is null when there is no hub. */\nexport async function start(info: HubInfo | null, hub: Hub | null): Promise<void> {\n  if (!navigator.gpu) return;\n  const canvas = document.querySelector<HTMLCanvasElement>('#view');\n  const shell = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#shell');\n  if (!canvas || !shell) return;\n  watchPointer(canvas);\n  const autoplay = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('game.autoplay') === '1';\n  const store = createStore({ prefix: 'trauma-compass:', mode: 'play' });\n  const campaign = createCampaign(info ? createCampaign().progress : loadProgress(store));\n  if (info) campaign.screen = 'op';\n  const audio = createAudio();\n  audio.volume('master', campaign.progress.master / 100);\n  audio.volume('music', campaign.progress.music / 100);\n  audio.volume('effects', campaign.progress.effects / 100);\n  const hud = createHud(document.body);\n  const session: Session | null = info && hub ? { info, hub, round: null, card: null, playing: false, sample: { ...ZERO }, sent: 0 } : null;\n  let engine: Engine | null = null;\n  let page: PageEngine | null = null;\n  let stamp = '';\n  let line = '';\n  let spoken = '';\n  let song = '';\n  let sig = '';\n  let touchHold = true;\n  const mismatches: string[] = [];\n\n  const feel = (frame: EngineFrame, input: Input): Feel => ({\n    speed: Number(frame.setting('game.cursorSpeed') ?? 8),\n    curve: Number(frame.setting('game.cursorCurve') ?? 2.2),\n    magnet: Number(frame.setting('game.magnet') ?? 0.55),\n    precision: input.held('precision'),\n  });\n\n  const extra = (): ShellExtra => ({\n    prompt: page ? usePrompt(engine?.input?.lastDevice ?? 'gamepad', campaign.progress.glyphs === 'xbox') : '',\n    hash: liveOp() ? (page?.hash() ?? '') : '',\n    cursor: `${gloveSpots(1)[0]?.x.toFixed(2) ?? 0}, ${gloveSpots(1)[0]?.z.toFixed(2) ?? 0}`,\n    sliders: TUNE.map((row) => ({ setting: row.setting, label: row.label, value: Number(page ? 0 : row.fallback) })),\n    touch: touchOnly() && touchHold && !session,\n    card: session?.card ?? null,\n  });\n\n  const drawShell = (): void => {\n    const next = shellStamp(campaign, extra());\n    if (next === stamp) return;\n    stamp = next;\n    renderShell(shell, campaign, {\n      ...extra(),\n      sliders: TUNE.map((row) => ({\n        setting: row.setting,\n        label: row.label,\n        value: Number(page ? 0 : row.fallback),\n      })),\n    });\n  };\n\n  const pick = (id: string): void => {\n    if (session && (id === 'hub-ready' || id === 'hub-more')) {\n      hub?.answer(id === 'hub-ready' ? 'ready' : 'more');\n      return;\n    }\n    if (session && id !== 'settings') return;\n    noteInput(campaign);\n    touchHold = false;\n    const dev = DEV[id];\n    act(campaign, id);\n    if (dev && page) dev(page);\n    saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\n    stamp = '';\n  };\n\n  shell.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\n    if (!target?.dataset.act) return;\n    pick(target.dataset.act);\n  });\n  shell.addEventListener('pointerover', (event) => {\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\n    if (!target) return;\n    const rows = [...shell.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-act]')];\n    const index = rows.indexOf(target);\n    if (index >= 0) campaign.focus = index;\n  });\n  shell.addEventListener('input', (event) => {\n    const target = event.target as HTMLInputElement | null;\n    const setting = target?.dataset.set;\n    if (!setting || !page || session) return;\n    page.set(setting, Number(target.value));\n  });\n  addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\n    touchHold = false;\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') noteInput(campaign);\n    if (event.key === 't' || event.key === 'T') session?.hub.answer('more');\n  });\n\n  engine = await createEngine({\n    canvas,\n    scenes: [main.id, play.id],\n    levels: {\n      'level:or': { text: OR_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/room.ts' },\n      'level:arena': { text: ARENA_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts' },\n    },\n    search: searchFrom(info, autoplay),\n    store,\n    actionMap: SURGEON_MAP,\n    modal: () => campaign.screen !== 'op' || !!session?.card || !session?.playing && !!session,\n    onFrame: (frame) => onFrame(frame, hud),\n  });\n  page = engine.inspector as PageEngine | null;\n  const msg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#msg');\n  if (msg) msg.hidden = true;\n\n  if (session && page && hub) {\n    const enginePage = page;\n    const wait = async (): Promise<void> => {\n      while (typeof (window as unknown as { __engine?: { step?: unknown } }).__engine?.step !== 'function') {\n        await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 25));\n      }\n    };\n    void wait().then(() => {\n      enginePage.pause();\n      hub.ready();\n      session.round = startRound(hub, info as HubInfo, enginePage, Math.max(1, info?.players.length ?? 1));\n    });\n    hub.on('card', (data) => {\n      const card = data as { left?: number | null; ready?: number[]; asked?: boolean };\n      const left = card.left == null ? 'Starting' : `${Math.ceil(card.left / 1000)}s`;\n      session.card = {\n        names: (info?.players ?? []).map((player) => player.name),\n        ready: card.ready ?? [],\n        left,\n        asked: !!card.asked,\n      };\n      stamp = '';\n    });\n    hub.on('start', () => {\n      session.card = null;\n      session.playing = false;\n      stamp = '';\n    });\n    hub.on('end', () => {\n      audio.mute(true);\n      session.card = null;\n    });\n  }\n\n  function syncRun(enginePage: PageEngine): void {\n    if (session) return;\n    const run = desiredRun(campaign);\n    const attract = desiredAttract(campaign);\n    const next = [run, attract, campaign.progress.seats, campaign.progress.difficulty, campaign.progress.simple, campaign.boot].join('|');\n    if (next === sig) return;\n    const phase = campaign.keepPhase ? (liveOp()?.phase ?? 0) : 0;\n    campaign.keepPhase = false;\n    enginePage.set('game.run', run);\n    enginePage.set('game.attract', attract);\n    enginePage.set('game.seats', campaign.progress.seats);\n    enginePage.set('game.difficulty', campaign.progress.difficulty);\n    enginePage.set('game.simple', campaign.progress.simple);\n    enginePage.set('game.phase', phase);\n    enginePage.set('game.colleague', false);\n    enginePage.set('game.autoplay', attract || (autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op'));\n    enginePage.seed(1);\n    placeCamera(enginePage, run);\n    sig = next;\n  }\n\n  function menus(input: Input): void {\n    const pads = samplePads();\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') {\n      if (pads.any || input.pressed('pause') || input.pressed('uiAccept')) noteInput(campaign);\n      return;\n    }\n    if (pads.claim >= 0 && campaign.screen === 'scrub') claimSeat(campaign, pads.claim);\n    if (session?.card) {\n      if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) hub?.answer('ready');\n      if (input.pressed('uiCancel')) hub?.answer('more');\n      return;\n    }\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op') {\n      if (pads.pause || input.pressed('pause')) {\n        if (session) {\n          campaign.back = 'op';\n          campaign.screen = 'settings';\n        } else cancel(campaign);\n      }\n      return;\n    }\n    if (pads.up || input.pressed('uiUp')) move(campaign, -1);\n    if (pads.down || input.pressed('uiDown')) move(campaign, 1);\n    if (pads.left || input.pressed('uiLeft')) browse(campaign, -1);\n    if (pads.right || input.pressed('uiRight')) browse(campaign, 1);\n    if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) accept(campaign);\n    if (pads.cancel || input.pressed('uiCancel')) cancel(campaign);\n    if (pads.any) noteInput(campaign);\n  }\n\n  function onFrame(frame: EngineFrame, bar: Hud): void {\n    const enginePage = page;\n    const input = engine?.input;\n    if (!enginePage || !input) return;\n    const blob = (frame.world.query('chart')[0] as { chart?: { blob?: string } } | undefined)?.chart?.blob ?? '';\n    if (blob) followChart(blob);\n    menus(input);\n    tickFront(campaign, frame.dt * 1000, !!session);\n    syncRun(enginePage);\n    const run = session ? 'op:case:gala-shift' : desiredRun(campaign);\n    const op = liveOp();\n    if (!session && campaign.screen === 'op' && op && op.status !== 'playing') {\n      finishOp(campaign, op.status === 'won', op.score, op.slips, op.fail);\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, false);\n      audio.play(op.status === 'won' ? 'sfx:rank' : 'sfx:alarm');\n    }\n    const busy = !session && ['pause', 'debrief', 'settings', 'dev', 'handbook'].includes(campaign.screen);\n    if (busy) enginePage.pause();\n    else if (!session?.round) enginePage.resume();\n    if (!session && (autoplay || desiredAttract(campaign)) && campaign.screen === 'op') enginePage.timeScale(8);\n    else if (!session && campaign.screen !== 'dev') enginePage.timeScale(1);\n    layLooks(enginePage, run);\n    const sites = Math.max(1, op?.sites.length ?? 1);\n    const seats = op?.seats.length ?? campaign.progress.seats;\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op' && !session && !op?.attract && !autoplay) {\n      enginePage.input.axis('game:hands', packedHands(input, canvas, frame.camera, frame.dt, seats, sites, feel(frame, input)));\n    }\n    if (session?.round && session.playing === false && hub && hub.time() >= 0) session.playing = true;\n    if (session && session.playing && !session.round?.ended && op) {\n      const hands = packedHands(input, canvas, frame.camera, frame.dt, 1, sites, feel(frame, input));\n      void hands;\n      const local = gloveSpots(1)[0];\n      const hand = {\n        x: local?.x ?? 0,\n        z: local?.z ?? 0,\n        tool: op.seats[session.info.me]?.tool ?? 1,\n        use: input.held('use'),\n        gift: input.pressed('gift'),\n        drop: input.pressed('drop'),\n        swap: input.pressed('swap'),\n        hint: input.pressed('hint'),\n        paddle: input.held('precision') && input.held('use'),\n        site: -1,\n      };\n      session.sample = countPress(session.sample, hand, input.pressed('siteNext') || input.pressed('sitePrev'));\n      const now = performance.now();\n      if (session.info.isHost) session.round?.book.hear(session.info.me, { t: 'i', ...session.sample });\n      else if (now - session.sent > 55) {\n        hub?.send({ t: 'i', ...session.sample }, { reliable: false });\n        session.sent = now;\n      }\n    }\n    paintField(op, performance.now() / 1000, campaign.progress.blood, gloveSpots(seats));\n    const said = op?.events.find((event) => event.type === 'hint' || event.type === 'phase' || event.type === 'drama');\n    if (said?.text) line = said.text;\n    paintHud(bar, campaign.screen === 'op' || campaign.screen === 'attract' ? op : null, campaign.hideHud, line);\n    if (!run.startsWith('op:')) frame.emit('emitter:rain', [FIELD_AT.x, 8, FIELD_AT.z - 2], 'rain');\n    const nextSong = run.startsWith('op:') ? (op?.id === 'case:mercy' ? 'song:mercy' : 'song:or') : campaign.screen === 'story' ? 'song:story' : 'song:title';\n    if (nextSong !== song) {\n      song = nextSong;\n      audio.music(song, { intensity: 0.4 });\n    }\n    audio.volume('master', campaign.progress.master / 100);\n    audio.volume('music', campaign.progress.music / 100);\n    audio.volume('effects', campaign.progress.effects / 100);\n    audio.update(frame.camera);\n    const box = campaign.screen === 'story' ? `${campaign.storyId}:${campaign.box}` : '';\n    if (box && box !== spoken) {\n      spoken = box;\n      const who = shell.querySelector('[data-game=\"who\"]')?.textContent ?? '';\n      const text = shell.querySelector('[data-game=\"line\"]')?.textContent ?? '';\n      if (text) speak(audio, who, text, campaign.progress.voice / 100);\n    }\n    drawShell();\n    endSample();\n    const found = enginePage.errors.some((error) => error.code === 'GFX_NO_WEBGPU');\n    if (found && msg) {\n      msg.hidden = false;\n      msg.textContent = 'This game needs a browser with WebGPU.';\n    }\n    const view = (window as unknown as { __compass?: Compass }).__compass;\n    if (view) {\n      view.screen = campaign.screen;\n      view.mismatches = session?.round?.mismatches ?? mismatches;\n    }\n  }\n\n  const compass: Compass = {\n    campaign,\n    screen: campaign.screen,\n    mismatches,\n    audio,\n    live: liveOp,\n  };\n  (window as unknown as { __compass: Compass }).__compass = compass;\n  drawShell();\n}\n\n/** What a test reads from the page. */\nexport interface Compass {\n  campaign: Campaign;\n  screen: string;\n  mismatches: string[];\n  audio: ReturnType<typeof createAudio>;\n  live: typeof liveOp;\n}\n\nexport type { HubInfo };\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1940,"output_tokens":5954,"cache_read_input_tokens":195328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"4a34e35e-0458-4627-bdf5-6f16a70671d8"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3149553f-4f94-4ec2-92d2-36ce0f727a27-193","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"import { drainCount, HostBook, type HubInfo, type IntentMsg, type TickMsg } from './hub';\",\"new_string\":\"import { drainCount, HostBook, type HubInfo, type IntentMsg } from './hub';\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/net/live.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/net/live.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/net/live.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"import { drainCount, HostBook, type HubInfo, type IntentMsg, type TickMsg } from './hub';\",\"old_line\":7,\"new_string\":\"import { drainCount, HostBook, type HubInfo, type IntentMsg } from './hub';\",\"new_line\":7,\"context_before\":\" */\\nimport { packHands } from '../op/codec';\\nimport { liveOp } from '../scenes/bridge';\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n/** The slice of the inspector this round uses. */\\nexport interface Stepper {\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3149553f-4f94-4ec2-92d2-36ce0f727a27-194","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The page. It starts the engine after the hub has connected, draws the screens, and feeds the operation.\\n */\\nimport {\\n  createAudio,\\n  createEngine,\\n  createStore,\\n  voiceOf,\\n  type Engine,\\n  type EngineFrame,\\n  type Input,\\n} from '../../../engine';\\nimport { ARENA_TEXT, play } from '../scenes/play';\\nimport { main } from '../scenes/main';\\nimport { FIELD_AT, OR_TEXT } from '../scenes/room';\\nimport { followChart, liveOp } from '../scenes/bridge';\\nimport { TUNE } from '../scenes/tune';\\nimport { SURGEON_MAP } from '../input/map';\\nimport { endSample, gloveSpots, packedHands, samplePads, touchOnly, watchPointer, type Feel } from '../input/hands';\\nimport { usePrompt } from '../input/glyphs';\\nimport { paintField } from '../view/field/sheet';\\nimport '../view/looks';\\nimport '../view/rain';\\nimport '../audio/library';\\nimport { createHud, paintHud, type Hud } from '../ui/hud';\\nimport { renderShell, shellStamp, type ShellExtra } from '../ui/shell';\\nimport {\\n  accept,\\n  act,\\n  browse,\\n  cancel,\\n  claimSeat,\\n  createCampaign,\\n  desiredAttract,\\n  desiredRun,\\n  finishOp,\\n  move,\\n  noteInput,\\n  tickFront,\\n  type Campaign,\\n  type Progress,\\n} from './campaign';\\nimport { countPress, ZERO, type HubInfo, type Sample } from '../net/hub';\\nimport { startRound, type RoundView } from '../net/live';\\n\\n/** The inspector calls this page uses. The engine's own type is an open bag of members. */\\ninterface PageEngine {\\n  pause(): void;\\n  resume(): void;\\n  step(n?: number, intents?: { 'game:hands': number[] }): number;\\n  timeScale(k?: number): number;\\n  seed(n?: number): number;\\n  hash(): string;\\n  set(path: string, value: unknown): unknown;\\n  input: { axis(name: string, value: unknown): void; record(): unknown };\\n  actions: { run(name: string, args?: unknown): unknown };\\n  camera: { set(code: string, opts?: { blend?: boolean }): unknown };\\n  errors: readonly { code: string }[];\\n}\\n\\n/** AI Hub, as the pasted client exposes it. */\\ninterface Hub {\\n  active: boolean;\\n  connect(opts: { mode: string; seats: [number, number]; card?: boolean }): Promise<HubInfo | null>;\\n  ready(): void;\\n  answer(which: 'ready' | 'more'): void;\\n  time(): number;\\n  finish(body: unknown): void;\\n  send(data: unknown, opts?: { to?: number; reliable?: boolean }): boolean;\\n  on(event: string, fn: (data: unknown, from?: number) => void): () => void;\\n  fail(message: string): void;\\n}\\n\\n/** The round info plus the card the players are looking at. */\\ninterface Session {\\n  info: HubInfo;\\n  hub: Hub;\\n  round: RoundView | null;\\n  card: ShellExtra['card'];\\n  playing: boolean;\\n  sample: Sample;\\n  sent: number;\\n}\\n\\nconst DEV: Readonly<Record<string, (engine: PageEngine) => void>> = {\\n  win: (engine) => engine.actions.run('winPhase'),\\n  fail: (engine) => engine.actions.run('failPhase'),\\n  heal: (engine) => engine.actions.run('heal'),\\n  freezeVitals: (engine) => engine.actions.run('freezeVitals'),\\n  freezeClock: (engine) => engine.actions.run('freezeClock'),\\n  gift: (engine) => engine.actions.run('infiniteGift'),\\n  oneHit: (engine) => engine.actions.run('oneHit'),\\n  spawn: (engine) => engine.actions.run('spawnStrain', { kind: 'lull' }),\\n  auto: (engine) => engine.set('game.autoplay', true),\\n  step: (engine) => {\\n    engine.pause();\\n    engine.step(1);\\n  },\\n  slow: (engine) => engine.timeScale(0.25),\\n  fast: (engine) => engine.timeScale(4),\\n  fly: (engine) => engine.camera.set('cam3=fly'),\\n  copy: (engine) => {\\n    const text = JSON.stringify(engine.input.record());\\n    void navigator.clipboard?.writeText(text);\\n  },\\n  reset: (engine) => {\\n    for (const row of TUNE) engine.set(row.setting, row.fallback);\\n  },\\n};\\n\\n/** Query keys the engine already understands, plus this game's settings. */\\nfunction searchFrom(info: HubInfo | null, autoplay: boolean): string {\\n  const incoming = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\n  const search = new URLSearchParams();\\n  search.set('touch', 'off');\\n  search.set('post.look', 'look:harbor');\\n  if (!incoming.has('cam') && !incoming.has('cam3')) {\\n    search.set('cam3', `fixed,${FIELD_AT.x},${FIELD_AT.y + 11},${FIELD_AT.z},0,-78,46`);\\n  }\\n  for (const [key, value] of incoming) {\\n    if (key.startsWith('aihub')) continue;\\n    if (key === 'touch') continue;\\n    if (key.startsWith('game.') || key === 'seed' || key === 'cam' || key === 'cam3' || key.startsWith('post.') || key.startsWith('gfx.')) {\\n      search.set(key, value);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (info) {\\n    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.run', 'op:case:gala-shift');\\n    search.set('game.seats', String(Math.max(1, info.players.length)));\\n    search.set('game.colleague', info.players.length === 1 ? '1' : '0');\\n    search.set('gfx.warmUp', 'asked');\\n  }\\n  if (autoplay) search.set('game.autoplay', '1');\\n  return `?${search}`;\\n}\\n\\n/** Saved night, or a fresh one. */\\nfunction loadProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>): Progress {\\n  return store.get('progress', createCampaign().progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Keep a night. Attract and a hub round do not. */\\nfunction saveProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>, c: Campaign, session: boolean): void {\\n  if (session || c.screen === 'attract' || !c.record) return;\\n  store.set('progress', c.progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Overhead on an operation, the harbour shot otherwise. */\\nfunction placeCamera(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const at = FIELD_AT;\\n  const code = run.startsWith('op:')\\n    ? `cam3=fixed,${at.x},${at.y + 9},${at.z + 0.4},0,-80,42`\\n    : `cam3=fixed,${at.x - 1},${at.y + 4},${at.z + 6},20,-18,48`;\\n  engine.camera.set(code, { blend: true });\\n}\\n\\n/** Stillpoint, Second Pulse, and a low line, laid over the field. */\\nfunction layLooks(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const op = liveOp();\\n  engine.set('post.look', run.startsWith('op:') ? 'look:field' : 'look:harbor');\\n  const layers: { look: string; amount: number }[] = [];\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'still')) layers.push({ look: 'look:still', amount: 0.8 });\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'pulse')) layers.push({ look: 'look:pulse', amount: 0.7 });\\n  if ((op?.patients[0]?.vitals ?? 100) < 30 && run.startsWith('op:')) layers.push({ look: 'look:low', amount: 0.55 });\\n  engine.set('post.combine', layers);\\n}\\n\\n/** A few syllables of the line, through the page's own gain. */\\nfunction speak(audio: ReturnType<typeof createAudio>, who: string, text: string, volume: number): void {\\n  const ctx = audio.context;\\n  if (!ctx || ctx.state !== 'running') return;\\n  const gain = ctx.createGain();\\n  gain.gain.value = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, volume));\\n  gain.connect(ctx.destination);\\n  const indexes = voiceOf(who, text).slice(0, 18);\\n  indexes.forEach((syllable, index) => {\\n    const osc = ctx.createOscillator();\\n    osc.type = 'sawtooth';\\n    osc.frequency.value = 180 + syllable * 28;\\n    osc.connect(gain);\\n    const at = ctx.currentTime + index * 0.08;\\n    osc.start(at);\\n    osc.stop(at + 0.07);\\n  });\\n  audio.duck(0.4);\\n}\\n\\n/** Start the game. `info` is null when there is no hub. */\\nexport async function start(info: HubInfo | null, hub: Hub | null): Promise<void> {\\n  if (!navigator.gpu) return;\\n  const canvas = document.querySelector<HTMLCanvasElement>('#view');\\n  const shell = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#shell');\\n  if (!canvas || !shell) return;\\n  watchPointer(canvas);\\n  const autoplay = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('game.autoplay') === '1';\\n  const store = createStore({ prefix: 'trauma-compass:', mode: 'play' });\\n  const campaign = createCampaign(info ? createCampaign().progress : loadProgress(store));\\n  if (info) campaign.screen = 'op';\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  audio.volume('master', campaign.progress.master / 100);\\n  audio.volume('music', campaign.progress.music / 100);\\n  audio.volume('effects', campaign.progress.effects / 100);\\n  const hud = createHud(document.body);\\n  const session: Session | null = info && hub ? { info, hub, round: null, card: null, playing: false, sample: { ...ZERO }, sent: 0 } : null;\\n  let engine: Engine | null = null;\\n  let page: PageEngine | null = null;\\n  let stamp = '';\\n  let line = '';\\n  let spoken = '';\\n  let song = '';\\n  let sig = '';\\n  let touchHold = true;\\n  const mismatches: string[] = [];\\n\\n  const feel = (frame: EngineFrame, input: Input): Feel => ({\\n    speed: Number(frame.setting('game.cursorSpeed') ?? 8),\\n    curve: Number(frame.setting('game.cursorCurve') ?? 2.2),\\n    magnet: Number(frame.setting('game.magnet') ?? 0.55),\\n    precision: input.held('precision'),\\n  });\\n\\n  const extra = (): ShellExtra => ({\\n    prompt: page ? usePrompt(engine?.input?.lastDevice ?? 'gamepad', campaign.progress.glyphs === 'xbox') : '',\\n    hash: liveOp() ? (page?.hash() ?? '') : '',\\n    cursor: `${gloveSpots(1)[0]?.x.toFixed(2) ?? 0}, ${gloveSpots(1)[0]?.z.toFixed(2) ?? 0}`,\\n    sliders: TUNE.map((row) => ({ setting: row.setting, label: row.label, value: Number(page ? 0 : row.fallback) })),\\n    touch: touchOnly() && touchHold && !session,\\n    card: session?.card ?? null,\\n  });\\n\\n  const drawShell = (): void => {\\n    const next = shellStamp(campaign, extra());\\n    if (next === stamp) return;\\n    stamp = next;\\n    renderShell(shell, campaign, {\\n      ...extra(),\\n      sliders: TUNE.map((row) => ({\\n        setting: row.setting,\\n        label: row.label,\\n        value: Number(page ? 0 : row.fallback),\\n      })),\\n    });\\n  };\\n\\n  const pick = (id: string): void => {\\n    if (session && (id === 'hub-ready' || id === 'hub-more')) {\\n      hub?.answer(id === 'hub-ready' ? 'ready' : 'more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session && id !== 'settings') return;\\n    noteInput(campaign);\\n    touchHold = false;\\n    const dev = DEV[id];\\n    act(campaign, id);\\n    if (dev && page) dev(page);\\n    saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    stamp = '';\\n  };\\n\\n  shell.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target?.dataset.act) return;\\n    pick(target.dataset.act);\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('pointerover', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target) return;\\n    const rows = [...shell.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-act]')];\\n    const index = rows.indexOf(target);\\n    if (index >= 0) campaign.focus = index;\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('input', (event) => {\\n    const target = event.target as HTMLInputElement | null;\\n    const setting = target?.dataset.set;\\n    if (!setting || !page || session) return;\\n    page.set(setting, Number(target.value));\\n  });\\n  addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\\n    touchHold = false;\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') noteInput(campaign);\\n    if (event.key === 't' || event.key === 'T') session?.hub.answer('more');\\n  });\\n\\n  engine = await createEngine({\\n    canvas,\\n    scenes: [main.id, play.id],\\n    levels: {\\n      'level:or': { text: OR_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/room.ts' },\\n      'level:arena': { text: ARENA_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts' },\\n    },\\n    search: searchFrom(info, autoplay),\\n    store,\\n    actionMap: SURGEON_MAP,\\n    modal: () => campaign.screen !== 'op' || !!session?.card || !session?.playing && !!session,\\n    onFrame: (frame) => onFrame(frame, hud),\\n  });\\n  page = engine.inspector as PageEngine | null;\\n  const msg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#msg');\\n  if (msg) msg.hidden = true;\\n\\n  if (session && page && hub) {\\n    const enginePage = page;\\n    const wait = async (): Promise<void> => {\\n      while (typeof (window as unknown as { __engine?: { step?: unknown } }).__engine?.step !== 'function') {\\n        await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 25));\\n      }\\n    };\\n    void wait().then(() => {\\n      enginePage.pause();\\n      hub.ready();\\n      session.round = startRound(hub, info as HubInfo, enginePage, Math.max(1, info?.players.length ?? 1));\\n    });\\n    hub.on('card', (data) => {\\n      const card = data as { left?: number | null; ready?: number[]; asked?: boolean };\\n      const left = card.left == null ? 'Starting' : `${Math.ceil(card.left / 1000)}s`;\\n      session.card = {\\n        names: (info?.players ?? []).map((player) => player.name),\\n        ready: card.ready ?? [],\\n        left,\\n        asked: !!card.asked,\\n      };\\n      stamp = '';\\n    });\\n    hub.on('start', () => {\\n      session.card = null;\\n      session.playing = false;\\n      stamp = '';\\n    });\\n    hub.on('end', () => {\\n      audio.mute(true);\\n      session.card = null;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function syncRun(enginePage: PageEngine): void {\\n    if (session) return;\\n    const run = desiredRun(campaign);\\n    const attract = desiredAttract(campaign);\\n    const next = [run, attract, campaign.progress.seats, campaign.progress.difficulty, campaign.progress.simple, campaign.boot].join('|');\\n    if (next === sig) return;\\n    const phase = campaign.keepPhase ? (liveOp()?.phase ?? 0) : 0;\\n    campaign.keepPhase = false;\\n    enginePage.set('game.run', run);\\n    enginePage.set('game.attract', attract);\\n    enginePage.set('game.seats', campaign.progress.seats);\\n    enginePage.set('game.difficulty', campaign.progress.difficulty);\\n    enginePage.set('game.simple', campaign.progress.simple);\\n    enginePage.set('game.phase', phase);\\n    enginePage.set('game.colleague', false);\\n    enginePage.set('game.autoplay', attract || (autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op'));\\n    enginePage.seed(1);\\n    placeCamera(enginePage, run);\\n    sig = next;\\n  }\\n\\n  function menus(input: Input): void {\\n    const pads = samplePads();\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') {\\n      if (pads.any || input.pressed('pause') || input.pressed('uiAccept')) noteInput(campaign);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (pads.claim >= 0 && campaign.screen === 'scrub') claimSeat(campaign, pads.claim);\\n    if (session?.card) {\\n      if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) hub?.answer('ready');\\n      if (input.pressed('uiCancel')) hub?.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op') {\\n      if (pads.pause || input.pressed('pause')) {\\n        if (session) {\\n          campaign.back = 'op';\\n          campaign.screen = 'settings';\\n        } else cancel(campaign);\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (pads.up || input.pressed('uiUp')) move(campaign, -1);\\n    if (pads.down || input.pressed('uiDown')) move(campaign, 1);\\n    if (pads.left || input.pressed('uiLeft')) browse(campaign, -1);\\n    if (pads.right || input.pressed('uiRight')) browse(campaign, 1);\\n    if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) accept(campaign);\\n    if (pads.cancel || input.pressed('uiCancel')) cancel(campaign);\\n    if (pads.any) noteInput(campaign);\\n  }\\n\\n  function onFrame(frame: EngineFrame, bar: Hud): void {\\n    const enginePage = page;\\n    const input = engine?.input;\\n    if (!enginePage || !input) return;\\n    const blob = (frame.world.query('chart')[0] as { chart?: { blob?: string } } | undefined)?.chart?.blob ?? '';\\n    if (blob) followChart(blob);\\n    menus(input);\\n    tickFront(campaign, frame.dt * 1000, !!session);\\n    syncRun(enginePage);\\n    const run = session ? 'op:case:gala-shift' : desiredRun(campaign);\\n    const op = liveOp();\\n    if (!session && campaign.screen === 'op' && op && op.status !== 'playing') {\\n      finishOp(campaign, op.status === 'won', op.score, op.slips, op.fail);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, false);\\n      audio.play(op.status === 'won' ? 'sfx:rank' : 'sfx:alarm');\\n    }\\n    const busy = !session && ['pause', 'debrief', 'settings', 'dev', 'handbook'].includes(campaign.screen);\\n    if (busy) enginePage.pause();\\n    else if (!session?.round) enginePage.resume();\\n    if (!session && (autoplay || desiredAttract(campaign)) && campaign.screen === 'op') enginePage.timeScale(8);\\n    else if (!session && campaign.screen !== 'dev') enginePage.timeScale(1);\\n    layLooks(enginePage, run);\\n    const sites = Math.max(1, op?.sites.length ?? 1);\\n    const seats = op?.seats.length ?? campaign.progress.seats;\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op' && !session && !op?.attract && !autoplay) {\\n      enginePage.input.axis('game:hands', packedHands(input, canvas, frame.camera, frame.dt, seats, sites, feel(frame, input)));\\n    }\\n    if (session?.round && session.playing === false && hub && hub.time() >= 0) session.playing = true;\\n    if (session && session.playing && !session.round?.ended && op) {\\n      const hands = packedHands(input, canvas, frame.camera, frame.dt, 1, sites, feel(frame, input));\\n      void hands;\\n      const local = gloveSpots(1)[0];\\n      const hand = {\\n        x: local?.x ?? 0,\\n        z: local?.z ?? 0,\\n        tool: op.seats[session.info.me]?.tool ?? 1,\\n        use: input.held('use'),\\n        gift: input.pressed('gift'),\\n        drop: input.pressed('drop'),\\n        swap: input.pressed('swap'),\\n        hint: input.pressed('hint'),\\n        paddle: input.held('precision') && input.held('use'),\\n        site: -1,\\n      };\\n      session.sample = countPress(session.sample, hand, input.pressed('siteNext') || input.pressed('sitePrev'));\\n      const now = performance.now();\\n      if (session.info.isHost) session.round?.book.hear(session.info.me, { t: 'i', ...session.sample });\\n      else if (now - session.sent > 55) {\\n        hub?.send({ t: 'i', ...session.sample }, { reliable: false });\\n        session.sent = now;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    paintField(op, performance.now() / 1000, campaign.progress.blood, gloveSpots(seats));\\n    const said = op?.events.find((event) => event.type === 'hint' || event.type === 'phase' || event.type === 'drama');\\n    if (said?.text) line = said.text;\\n    paintHud(bar, campaign.screen === 'op' || campaign.screen === 'attract' ? op : null, campaign.hideHud, line);\\n    if (!run.startsWith('op:')) frame.emit('emitter:rain', [FIELD_AT.x, 8, FIELD_AT.z - 2], 'rain');\\n    const nextSong = run.startsWith('op:') ? (op?.id === 'case:mercy' ? 'song:mercy' : 'song:or') : campaign.screen === 'story' ? 'song:story' : 'song:title';\\n    if (nextSong !== song) {\\n      song = nextSong;\\n      audio.music(song, { intensity: 0.4 });\\n    }\\n    audio.volume('master', campaign.progress.master / 100);\\n    audio.volume('music', campaign.progress.music / 100);\\n    audio.volume('effects', campaign.progress.effects / 100);\\n    audio.update(frame.camera);\\n    const box = campaign.screen === 'story' ? `${campaign.storyId}:${campaign.box}` : '';\\n    if (box && box !== spoken) {\\n      spoken = box;\\n      const who = shell.querySelector('[data-game=\\\"who\\\"]')?.textContent ?? '';\\n      const text = shell.querySelector('[data-game=\\\"line\\\"]')?.textContent ?? '';\\n      if (text) speak(audio, who, text, campaign.progress.voice / 100);\\n    }\\n    drawShell();\\n    endSample();\\n    const found = enginePage.errors.some((error) => error.code === 'GFX_NO_WEBGPU');\\n    if (found && msg) {\\n      msg.hidden = false;\\n      msg.textContent = 'This game needs a browser with WebGPU.';\\n    }\\n    const view = (window as unknown as { __compass?: Compass }).__compass;\\n    if (view) {\\n      view.screen = campaign.screen;\\n      view.mismatches = session?.round?.mismatches ?? mismatches;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const compass: Compass = {\\n    campaign,\\n    screen: campaign.screen,\\n    mismatches,\\n    audio,\\n    live: liveOp,\\n  };\\n  (window as unknown as { __compass: Compass }).__compass = compass;\\n  drawShell();\\n}\\n\\n/** What a test reads from the page. */\\nexport interface Compass {\\n  campaign: Campaign;\\n  screen: string;\\n  mismatches: string[];\\n  audio: ReturnType<typeof createAudio>;\\n  live: typeof liveOp;\\n}\\n\\nexport type { HubInfo };\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The page. It starts the engine after the hub has connected, draws the screens, and feeds the operation.\\n */\\nimport {\\n  createAudio,\\n  createEngine,\\n  createStore,\\n  voiceOf,\\n  type Engine,\\n  type EngineFrame,\\n  type Input,\\n} from '../../../engine';\\nimport { ARENA_TEXT, play } from '../scenes/play';\\nimport { main } from '../scenes/main';\\nimport { FIELD_AT, OR_TEXT } from '../scenes/room';\\nimport { followChart, liveOp } from '../scenes/bridge';\\nimport { TUNE } from '../scenes/tune';\\nimport { SURGEON_MAP } from '../input/map';\\nimport { endSample, gloveSpots, packedHands, samplePads, touchOnly, watchPointer, type Feel } from '../input/hands';\\nimport { usePrompt } from '../input/glyphs';\\nimport { paintField } from '../view/field/sheet';\\nimport '../view/looks';\\nimport '../view/rain';\\nimport '../audio/library';\\nimport { createHud, paintHud, type Hud } from '../ui/hud';\\nimport { renderShell, shellStamp, type ShellExtra } from '../ui/shell';\\nimport {\\n  accept,\\n  act,\\n  browse,\\n  cancel,\\n  claimSeat,\\n  createCampaign,\\n  desiredAttract,\\n  desiredRun,\\n  finishOp,\\n  move,\\n  noteInput,\\n  tickFront,\\n  type Campaign,\\n  type Progress,\\n} from './campaign';\\nimport { countPress, ZERO, type HubInfo, type Sample } from '../net/hub';\\nimport { startRound, type RoundView } from '../net/live';\\n\\n/** The inspector calls this page uses. The engine's own type is an open bag of members. */\\ninterface PageEngine {\\n  pause(): void;\\n  resume(): void;\\n  step(n?: number, intents?: { 'game:hands': number[] }): number;\\n  timeScale(k?: number): number;\\n  seed(n?: number): number;\\n  hash(): string;\\n  set(path: string, value: unknown): unknown;\\n  input: { axis(name: string, value: unknown): void; record(): unknown };\\n  actions: { run(name: string, args?: unknown): unknown };\\n  camera: { set(code: string, opts?: { blend?: boolean }): unknown };\\n  errors: readonly { code: string }[];\\n}\\n\\n/** AI Hub, as the pasted client exposes it. */\\ninterface Hub {\\n  active: boolean;\\n  connect(opts: { mode: string; seats: [number, number]; card?: boolean }): Promise<HubInfo | null>;\\n  ready(): void;\\n  answer(which: 'ready' | 'more'): void;\\n  time(): number;\\n  finish(body: unknown): void;\\n  send(data: unknown, opts?: { to?: number; reliable?: boolean }): boolean;\\n  on(event: string, fn: (data: unknown, from?: number) => void): () => void;\\n  fail(message: string): void;\\n}\\n\\n/** The round info plus the card the players are looking at. */\\ninterface Session {\\n  info: HubInfo;\\n  hub: Hub;\\n  round: RoundView | null;\\n  card: ShellExtra['card'];\\n  playing: boolean;\\n  sample: Sample;\\n  sent: number;\\n}\\n\\nconst DEV: Readonly<Record<string, (engine: PageEngine) => void>> = {\\n  win: (engine) => engine.actions.run('winPhase'),\\n  fail: (engine) => engine.actions.run('failPhase'),\\n  heal: (engine) => engine.actions.run('heal'),\\n  freezeVitals: (engine) => engine.actions.run('freezeVitals'),\\n  freezeClock: (engine) => engine.actions.run('freezeClock'),\\n  gift: (engine) => engine.actions.run('infiniteGift'),\\n  oneHit: (engine) => engine.actions.run('oneHit'),\\n  spawn: (engine) => engine.actions.run('spawnStrain', { kind: 'lull' }),\\n  auto: (engine) => engine.set('game.autoplay', true),\\n  step: (engine) => {\\n    engine.pause();\\n    engine.step(1);\\n  },\\n  slow: (engine) => engine.timeScale(0.25),\\n  fast: (engine) => engine.timeScale(4),\\n  fly: (engine) => engine.camera.set('cam3=fly'),\\n  copy: (engine) => {\\n    const text = JSON.stringify(engine.input.record());\\n    void navigator.clipboard?.writeText(text);\\n  },\\n  reset: (engine) => {\\n    for (const row of TUNE) engine.set(row.setting, row.fallback);\\n  },\\n};\\n\\n/** Query keys the engine already understands, plus this game's settings. */\\nfunction searchFrom(info: HubInfo | null, autoplay: boolean): string {\\n  const incoming = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\n  const search = new URLSearchParams();\\n  search.set('touch', 'off');\\n  search.set('post.look', 'look:harbor');\\n  if (!incoming.has('cam') && !incoming.has('cam3')) {\\n    search.set('cam3', `fixed,${FIELD_AT.x},${FIELD_AT.y + 11},${FIELD_AT.z},0,-78,46`);\\n  }\\n  for (const [key, value] of incoming) {\\n    if (key.startsWith('aihub')) continue;\\n    if (key === 'touch') continue;\\n    if (key.startsWith('game.') || key === 'seed' || key === 'cam' || key === 'cam3' || key.startsWith('post.') || key.startsWith('gfx.')) {\\n      search.set(key, value);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (info) {\\n    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.run', 'op:case:gala-shift');\\n    search.set('game.seats', String(Math.max(1, info.players.length)));\\n    search.set('game.colleague', info.players.length === 1 ? '1' : '0');\\n    search.set('gfx.warmUp', 'asked');\\n  }\\n  if (autoplay) search.set('game.autoplay', '1');\\n  return `?${search}`;\\n}\\n\\n/** Saved night, or a fresh one. */\\nfunction loadProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>): Progress {\\n  return store.get('progress', createCampaign().progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Keep a night. Attract and a hub round do not. */\\nfunction saveProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>, c: Campaign, session: boolean): void {\\n  if (session || c.screen === 'attract' || !c.record) return;\\n  store.set('progress', c.progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Overhead on an operation, the harbour shot otherwise. */\\nfunction placeCamera(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const at = FIELD_AT;\\n  const code = run.startsWith('op:')\\n    ? `cam3=fixed,${at.x},${at.y + 9},${at.z + 0.4},0,-80,42`\\n    : `cam3=fixed,${at.x - 1},${at.y + 4},${at.z + 6},20,-18,48`;\\n  engine.camera.set(code, { blend: true });\\n}\\n\\n/** Stillpoint, Second Pulse, and a low line, laid over the field. */\\nfunction layLooks(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const op = liveOp();\\n  engine.set('post.look', run.startsWith('op:') ? 'look:field' : 'look:harbor');\\n  const layers: { look: string; amount: number }[] = [];\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'still')) layers.push({ look: 'look:still', amount: 0.8 });\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'pulse')) layers.push({ look: 'look:pulse', amount: 0.7 });\\n  if ((op?.patients[0]?.vitals ?? 100) < 30 && run.startsWith('op:')) layers.push({ look: 'look:low', amount: 0.55 });\\n  engine.set('post.combine', layers);\\n}\\n\\n/** A few syllables of the line, through the page's own gain. */\\nfunction speak(audio: ReturnType<typeof createAudio>, who: string, text: string, volume: number): void {\\n  const ctx = audio.context;\\n  if (!ctx || ctx.state !== 'running') return;\\n  const gain = ctx.createGain();\\n  gain.gain.value = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, volume));\\n  gain.connect(ctx.destination);\\n  const indexes = voiceOf(who, text).slice(0, 18);\\n  indexes.forEach((syllable, index) => {\\n    const osc = ctx.createOscillator();\\n    osc.type = 'sawtooth';\\n    osc.frequency.value = 180 + syllable * 28;\\n    osc.connect(gain);\\n    const at = ctx.currentTime + index * 0.08;\\n    osc.start(at);\\n    osc.stop(at + 0.07);\\n  });\\n  audio.duck(0.4);\\n}\\n\\n/** Start the game. `info` is null when there is no hub. */\\nexport async function start(info: HubInfo | null, hub: Hub | null): Promise<void> {\\n  if (!navigator.gpu) return;\\n  const canvas = document.querySelector<HTMLCanvasElement>('#view');\\n  const shell = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#shell');\\n  if (!canvas || !shell) return;\\n  watchPointer(canvas);\\n  const autoplay = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('game.autoplay') === '1';\\n  const store = createStore({ prefix: 'trauma-compass:', mode: 'play' });\\n  const campaign = createCampaign(info ? createCampaign().progress : loadProgress(store));\\n  if (info) campaign.screen = 'op';\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  audio.volume('master', campaign.progress.master / 100);\\n  audio.volume('music', campaign.progress.music / 100);\\n  audio.volume('effects', campaign.progress.effects / 100);\\n  const hud = createHud(document.body);\\n  const session: Session | null = info && hub ? { info, hub, round: null, card: null, playing: false, sample: { ...ZERO }, sent: 0 } : null;\\n  let engine: Engine | null = null;\\n  let page: PageEngine | null = null;\\n  let stamp = '';\\n  let line = '';\\n  let spoken = '';\\n  let song = '';\\n  let sig = '';\\n  let touchHold = true;\\n  const mismatches: string[] = [];\\n\\n  const feel = (frame: EngineFrame, input: Input): Feel => ({\\n    speed: Number(frame.setting('game.cursorSpeed') ?? 8),\\n    curve: Number(frame.setting('game.cursorCurve') ?? 2.2),\\n    magnet: Number(frame.setting('game.magnet') ?? 0.55),\\n    precision: input.held('precision'),\\n  });\\n\\n  const extra = (): ShellExtra => ({\\n    prompt: page ? usePrompt(engine?.input?.lastDevice ?? 'gamepad', campaign.progress.glyphs === 'xbox') : '',\\n    hash: liveOp() ? (page?.hash() ?? '') : '',\\n    cursor: `${gloveSpots(1)[0]?.x.toFixed(2) ?? 0}, ${gloveSpots(1)[0]?.z.toFixed(2) ?? 0}`,\\n    sliders: TUNE.map((row) => ({ setting: row.setting, label: row.label, value: Number(page ? 0 : row.fallback) })),\\n    touch: touchOnly() && touchHold && !session,\\n    card: session?.card ?? null,\\n  });\\n\\n  const drawShell = (): void => {\\n    const next = shellStamp(campaign, extra());\\n    if (next === stamp) return;\\n    stamp = next;\\n    renderShell(shell, campaign, {\\n      ...extra(),\\n      sliders: TUNE.map((row) => ({\\n        setting: row.setting,\\n        label: row.label,\\n        value: Number(page ? 0 : row.fallback),\\n      })),\\n    });\\n  };\\n\\n  const pick = (id: string): void => {\\n    if (session && (id === 'hub-ready' || id === 'hub-more')) {\\n      hub?.answer(id === 'hub-ready' ? 'ready' : 'more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session && id !== 'settings') return;\\n    noteInput(campaign);\\n    touchHold = false;\\n    const dev = DEV[id];\\n    act(campaign, id);\\n    if (dev && page) dev(page);\\n    saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    stamp = '';\\n  };\\n\\n  shell.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target?.dataset.act) return;\\n    pick(target.dataset.act);\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('pointerover', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target) return;\\n    const rows = [...shell.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-act]')];\\n    const index = rows.indexOf(target);\\n    if (index >= 0) campaign.focus = index;\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('input', (event) => {\\n    const target = event.target as HTMLInputElement | null;\\n    const setting = target?.dataset.set;\\n    if (!setting || !page || session) return;\\n    page.set(setting, Number(target.value));\\n  });\\n  addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\\n    touchHold = false;\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') noteInput(campaign);\\n    if (event.key === 't' || event.key === 'T') session?.hub.answer('more');\\n  });\\n\\n  engine = await createEngine({\\n    canvas,\\n    scenes: [main.id, play.id],\\n    levels: {\\n      'level:or': { text: OR_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/room.ts' },\\n      'level:arena': { text: ARENA_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts' },\\n    },\\n    search: searchFrom(info, autoplay),\\n    store,\\n    actionMap: SURGEON_MAP,\\n    modal: () => campaign.screen !== 'op' || !!session?.card || !session?.playing && !!session,\\n    onFrame: (frame) => onFrame(frame, hud),\\n  });\\n  page = engine.inspector as PageEngine | null;\\n  const msg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#msg');\\n  if (msg) msg.hidden = true;\\n\\n  if (session && page && hub) {\\n    const enginePage = page;\\n    const wait = async (): Promise<void> => {\\n      while (typeof (window as unknown as { __engine?: { step?: unknown } }).__engine?.step !== 'function') {\\n        await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 25));\\n      }\\n    };\\n    void wait().then(() => {\\n      enginePage.pause();\\n      hub.ready();\\n      session.round = startRound(hub, info as HubInfo, enginePage, Math.max(1, info?.players.length ?? 1));\\n    });\\n    hub.on('card', (data) => {\\n      const card = data as { left?: number | null; ready?: number[]; asked?: boolean };\\n      const left = card.left == null ? 'Starting' : `${Math.ceil(card.left / 1000)}s`;\\n      session.card = {\\n        names: (info?.players ?? []).map((player) => player.name),\\n        ready: card.ready ?? [],\\n        left,\\n        asked: !!card.asked,\\n      };\\n      stamp = '';\\n    });\\n    hub.on('start', () => {\\n      session.card = null;\\n      session.playing = false;\\n      stamp = '';\\n    });\\n    hub.on('end', () => {\\n      audio.mute(true);\\n      session.card = null;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function syncRun(enginePage: PageEngine): void {\\n    if (session) return;\\n    const run = desiredRun(campaign);\\n    const attract = desiredAttract(campaign);\\n    const next = [run, attract, campaign.progress.seats, campaign.progress.difficulty, campaign.progress.simple, campaign.boot].join('|');\\n    if (next === sig) return;\\n    const phase = campaign.keepPhase ? (liveOp()?.phase ?? 0) : 0;\\n    campaign.keepPhase = false;\\n    enginePage.set('game.run', run);\\n    enginePage.set('game.attract', attract);\\n    enginePage.set('game.seats', campaign.progress.seats);\\n    enginePage.set('game.difficulty', campaign.progress.difficulty);\\n    enginePage.set('game.simple', campaign.progress.simple);\\n    enginePage.set('game.phase', phase);\\n    enginePage.set('game.colleague', false);\\n    enginePage.set('game.autoplay', attract || (autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op'));\\n    enginePage.seed(1);\\n    placeCamera(enginePage, run);\\n    sig = next;\\n  }\\n\\n  function menus(input: Input): void {\\n    const pads = samplePads();\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') {\\n      if (pads.any || input.pressed('pause') || input.pressed('uiAccept')) noteInput(campaign);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (pads.claim >= 0 && campaign.screen === 'scrub') claimSeat(campaign, pads.claim);\\n    if (session?.card) {\\n      if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) hub?.answer('ready');\\n      if (input.pressed('uiCancel')) hub?.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op') {\\n      if (pads.pause || input.pressed('pause')) {\\n        if (session) {\\n          campaign.back = 'op';\\n          campaign.screen = 'settings';\\n        } else cancel(campaign);\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (pads.up || input.pressed('uiUp')) move(campaign, -1);\\n    if (pads.down || input.pressed('uiDown')) move(campaign, 1);\\n    if (pads.left || input.pressed('uiLeft')) browse(campaign, -1);\\n    if (pads.right || input.pressed('uiRight')) browse(campaign, 1);\\n    if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) accept(campaign);\\n    if (pads.cancel || input.pressed('uiCancel')) cancel(campaign);\\n    if (pads.any) noteInput(campaign);\\n  }\\n\\n  function onFrame(frame: EngineFrame, bar: Hud): void {\\n    const enginePage = page;\\n    const input = engine?.input;\\n    if (!enginePage || !input) return;\\n    const blob = (frame.world.query('chart')[0] as { chart?: { blob?: string } } | undefined)?.chart?.blob ?? '';\\n    if (blob) followChart(blob);\\n    menus(input);\\n    tickFront(campaign, frame.dt * 1000, !!session);\\n    syncRun(enginePage);\\n    const run = session ? 'op:case:gala-shift' : desiredRun(campaign);\\n    const op = liveOp();\\n    if (!session && campaign.screen === 'op' && op && op.status !== 'playing') {\\n      finishOp(campaign, op.status === 'won', op.score, op.slips, op.fail);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, false);\\n      audio.play(op.status === 'won' ? 'sfx:rank' : 'sfx:alarm');\\n    }\\n    const busy = !session && ['pause', 'debrief', 'settings', 'dev', 'handbook'].includes(campaign.screen);\\n    if (busy) enginePage.pause();\\n    else if (!session?.round) enginePage.resume();\\n    if (!session && (autoplay || desiredAttract(campaign)) && campaign.screen === 'op') enginePage.timeScale(8);\\n    else if (!session && campaign.screen !== 'dev') enginePage.timeScale(1);\\n    layLooks(enginePage, run);\\n    const sites = Math.max(1, op?.sites.length ?? 1);\\n    const seats = op?.seats.length ?? campaign.progress.seats;\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op' && !session && !op?.attract && !autoplay) {\\n      enginePage.input.axis('game:hands', packedHands(input, canvas, frame.camera, frame.dt, seats, sites, feel(frame, input)));\\n    }\\n    if (session?.round && session.playing === false && hub && hub.time() >= 0) session.playing = true;\\n    if (session && session.playing && !session.round?.ended && op) {\\n      const hands = packedHands(input, canvas, frame.camera, frame.dt, 1, sites, feel(frame, input));\\n      void hands;\\n      const local = gloveSpots(1)[0];\\n      const hand = {\\n        x: local?.x ?? 0,\\n        z: local?.z ?? 0,\\n        tool: op.seats[session.info.me]?.tool ?? 1,\\n        use: input.held('use'),\\n        gift: input.pressed('gift'),\\n        drop: input.pressed('drop'),\\n        swap: input.pressed('swap'),\\n        hint: input.pressed('hint'),\\n        paddle: input.held('precision') && input.held('use'),\\n        site: -1,\\n      };\\n      session.sample = countPress(session.sample, hand, input.pressed('siteNext') || input.pressed('sitePrev'));\\n      const now = performance.now();\\n      if (session.info.isHost) session.round?.book.hear(session.info.me, { t: 'i', ...session.sample });\\n      else if (now - session.sent > 55) {\\n        hub?.send({ t: 'i', ...session.sample }, { reliable: false });\\n        session.sent = now;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    paintField(op, performance.now() / 1000, campaign.progress.blood, gloveSpots(seats));\\n    const said = op?.events.find((event) => event.type === 'hint' || event.type === 'phase' || event.type === 'drama');\\n    if (said?.text) line = said.text;\\n    paintHud(bar, campaign.screen === 'op' || campaign.screen === 'attract' ? op : null, campaign.hideHud, line);\\n    if (!run.startsWith('op:')) frame.emit('emitter:rain', [FIELD_AT.x, 8, FIELD_AT.z - 2], 'rain');\\n    const nextSong = run.startsWith('op:') ? (op?.id === 'case:mercy' ? 'song:mercy' : 'song:or') : campaign.screen === 'story' ? 'song:story' : 'song:title';\\n    if (nextSong !== song) {\\n      song = nextSong;\\n      audio.music(song, { intensity: 0.4 });\\n    }\\n    audio.volume('master', campaign.progress.master / 100);\\n    audio.volume('music', campaign.progress.music / 100);\\n    audio.volume('effects', campaign.progress.effects / 100);\\n    audio.update(frame.camera);\\n    const box = campaign.screen === 'story' ? `${campaign.storyId}:${campaign.box}` : '';\\n    if (box && box !== spoken) {\\n      spoken = box;\\n      const who = shell.querySelector('[data-game=\\\"who\\\"]')?.textContent ?? '';\\n      const text = shell.querySelector('[data-game=\\\"line\\\"]')?.textContent ?? '';\\n      if (text) speak(audio, who, text, campaign.progress.voice / 100);\\n    }\\n    drawShell();\\n    endSample();\\n    const found = enginePage.errors.some((error) => error.code === 'GFX_NO_WEBGPU');\\n    if (found && msg) {\\n      msg.hidden = false;\\n      msg.textContent = 'This game needs a browser with WebGPU.';\\n    }\\n    const view = (window as unknown as { __compass?: Compass }).__compass;\\n    if (view) {\\n      view.screen = campaign.screen;\\n      view.mismatches = session?.round?.mismatches ?? mismatches;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const compass: Compass = {\\n    campaign,\\n    screen: campaign.screen,\\n    mismatches,\\n    audio,\\n    live: liveOp,\\n  };\\n  (window as unknown as { __compass: Compass }).__compass = compass;\\n  drawShell();\\n}\\n\\n/** What a test reads from the page. */\\nexport interface Compass {\\n  campaign: Campaign;\\n  screen: string;\\n  mismatches: string[];\\n  audio: ReturnType<typeof createAudio>;\\n  live: typeof liveOp;\\n}\\n\\nexport type { HubInfo };\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"904171cb-a986-4299-b396-7ab80f4b7fd3"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_281","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"boot.ts imports voiceOf from engine, but it actually lives in op/voice.ts.\n\nThe modal expression operator precedence is wrong. It should return true when a card is active, when the session exists but has not started playing, or when the screen is not op.\n\nSlider values are hardcoded to zero because the code checks `page` instead of reading the actual setting. I will store the last settings in a map updated during onFrame.\n\ncreateAudio has import and type issues. Sample must be exported from hub.ts because countPress uses it. HubInfo is imported from hub and re-exported in boot.ts; start() will receive both info and hub.\n\npackedHands is called during sessions to update cursors via gloveSpots, so its return value is intentionally discarded.\n\nThe modal expression is actually correct. It returns true when the screen is not op, or when a card is active, or when a session exists but has not started playing. The precedence bug was a false alarm.\n\nboot.ts may exceed the 400-line warning threshold. main.ts should remain thin.\n\nThe modal expression is actually correct. It returns true when the screen is not op, when a card is active, or when a session exists but has not started playing. The precedence bug was a false alarm.\n\nDuring sessions the frame loop pauses, so onFrame runs only for drawing while syncRun returns early. The host interval then steps the simulation directly, preventing double stepping.\n\nBefore ready() resolves, the engine may run a few frames of the gala op unpaused. Those frames step the simulation without lockstep, so the host starts from a non-zero tick while clients start from zero, causing a hash mismatch. The fix is to pause the inspector immediately when the engine exists, before any frames run.\n\nThe pause-on-first-frame fix still allows one step to run before the engine stops. Clients and host may step once from the same seed before pausing, so timing can diverge. The warm-up steps during load also break lockstep, because the prototype paused only after about a second and many frames had already executed.\n\nAll copies will call `enginePage.seed(info.seed)` immediately after pausing, before the interval starts. This resets the scene to tick zero for every copy, so lockstep begins at the same absolute tick even if load times differ.\n\nClients must call `seed()` before applying any buffered ticks. This ensures they start from tick zero and apply the host's queued messages onto a fresh world state, so hashes match even if the client loaded after the host began stepping.\n\nThe host interval will use AIHub.time(). The exact boot sequence is: pause the inspector, seed the scene to tick zero, mark the hub ready, then start the round. This ensures any messages that arrive before the handler attaches are queued by the hub and applied after seeding, so they do not corrupt the fresh world state.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7e08b138-567a-4e36-bb1a-c4ca758c090d-195","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"boolean","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/app/routes.ts","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7e08b138-567a-4e36-bb1a-c4ca758c090d-196","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"'true'|boolean","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/core/settings.ts","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6155,"output_tokens":1701,"cache_read_input_tokens":197248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"dbfa2d92-de98-4c26-80cf-78a841dd55f2"}
