{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_286","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A large implementation task remains.\n\nFixing compile errors in boot.ts and hub.ts. Updating slider caching, session logic, timeScale, speak timing, and pointer focus. Then writing main.ts and index.html, then one-file build, verification, tests, and hand-ins.\n\nChecking campaign exports, shell types, hands exports, and audio API signatures. Reviewing PLAN verification and TASK hand-in requirements to ensure nothing is missed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e55411be-9333-4196-a706-7ba1abcae162-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/net/hub.ts","offset":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e55411be-9333-4196-a706-7ba1abcae162-12","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export function (currentBox|items|handbookPage)","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e55411be-9333-4196-a706-7ba1abcae162-13","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export (function|const|interface|type)","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/ui/shell.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e55411be-9333-4196-a706-7ba1abcae162-14","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export (function|interface|type|const)","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/input/hands.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e55411be-9333-4196-a706-7ba1abcae162-15","name":"