setsMore.ts), and every look's `combine` and `strength` (engine/gfx/post/combine.ts): the looks\"},{\"line_number\":48,\"content\":\"import { COMBINE_FIELD, STRENGTH_FIELD, type CombineLayer } from './combine';\"},{\"line_number\":152,\"content\":\"  combine: COMBINE_FIELD,\"},{\"line_number\":161,\"content\":\"export type LookSpec = Partial<Omit<EntryOf<typeof LOOK_FIELDS>, 'filters' | 'toon' | 'shells' | 'combine'>> & {\"},{\"line_number\":165,\"content\":\"  combine?: readonly CombineLayer[];\"},{\"line_number\":325,\"content\":\" * itself, as problems (a longer cycle is skipped where it is drawn, engine/gfx/post/combine.ts).\"},{\"line_number\":335,\"content\":\"    ...entry.combine.map((layer, i) =>\"},{\"line_number\":336,\"content\":\"      layer.look === entry.id ? `combine[${i}] lays ${entry.id} on itself: name another look` : null,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/gfx/post/combine.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * alone. A look's `combine` (engine/gfx/post/looks.ts) lists layers: each a look, how much of it shows (`amount`),\"},{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\" * setting `post.filters`'s form). `combineChain` lays them in order on a chain with every filter off, then the look's\"},{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\" * `post.combine` and `post.strength` do the same over the look the page draws (engine/gfx/post/resolveLook.ts), so a\"},{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\" * page, a tool or an agent tunes and combines looks live, each change a uniform write.\"},{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\" * off. A layer's look is combined first, so looks build on looks; a look already being combined is skipped with\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\" * // combineChain(registry.get('look', 'look:mine') as LookEntry, registry, warn).grade.contrast;\"},{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\" * @see engine/gfx/post/combine.test.ts\"},{\"line_number\":55,\"content\":\"/** The field a look's `combine` and the setting `post.combine` share: the layers, in order. */\"},{\"line_number\":153,\"content\":\"/** `layers` laid in order on `chain`, each layer's look combined first; `seen` holds the looks being combined. */\"},{\"line_number\":169,\"content\":\"    const own = combineChain(look, registry, warn, [...seen, layer.look]);\"},{\"line_number\":176,\"content\":\"/** A look's whole chain: its `combine` layers, then its own filters that are on, then its `strength`. */\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"export function combineChain(\"},{\"line_number\":183,\"content\":\"  if (look.combine.length === 0 && look.strength >= 1) return look.filters;\"},{\"line_number\":184,\"content\":\"  const combined = layLooks(chainOf(), look.combine as readonly CombineLayer[], registry, warn, seen);\"},{\"line_number\":185,\"content\":\"  return strengthen(layChain(combined, look.filters, 1), look.strength);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/gfx/post/filters.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * much of it shows, 0 to 1, so blends and a look's strength fade it: engine/gfx/post/combine.ts) and its numbers.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/gfx/post/presetsMore.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * looks built only by combining them (`combine`, engine/gfx/post/combine.ts), the way an agent makes a look of its\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" * COMBINED_LOOKS['look:cinematic'].combine?.length; // 4\"},{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\" * @see engine/gfx/post/combine.test.ts\"},{\"line_number\":66,\"content\":\"    combine: [\"},{\"line_number\":76,\"content\":\"    combine: [{ look: 'look:tiltshift/miniature' }, { look: 'look:sharpen/crisp', amount: 0.7 }],\"},{\"line_number\":82,\"content\":\"    combine: [\"},{\"line_number\":93,\"content\":\"    combine: [\"},{\"line_number\":102,\"content\":\"    combine: [\"},{\"line_number\":111,\"content\":\"    combine: [{ look: 'look:duotone/ember' }, { look: 'look:misregister/risograph' }, { look: 'look:paper/newsprint' }],\"},{\"line_number\":115,\"content\":\"    combine: [\"},{\"line_number\":123,\"content\":\"    combine: [\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/gfx/post/resolveLook.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * `resolve(perspective)`: the look `post.look` names (engine/gfx/post/looks.ts), its chain combined from its layers\"},{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * (`combineChain`, engine/gfx/post/combine.ts), the looks `post.combine` lays over it, then `post.filters` laid over\"},{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\" * Invariants: it reads the settings and the registry, never writes them; while `post.look`, `post.combine`,\"},{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\"import { combineChain, layLooks, strengthen, type CombineLayer } from './combine';\"},{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"  /** `post.filters`, `post.combine` and `post.strength` as they were read (compared by identity). */\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"    const combined = layLooks(combineChain(look, registry, warn), layers, registry, warn);\"},{\"line_number\":54,\"content\":\"    return strengthen(layerChain(combined, spec), strength);\"},{\"line_number\":59,\"content\":\"    const layers = settings.get('post.combine');\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"333afa04-22e6-48b5-b243-615747eb7279"}
