{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_293","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The post.combine array of {look, amount} should work if the look IDs exist.\n\nboot.ts edits are planned. voiceOf moves to the op module. currentBox and items are imported. Slider values and session handling are added. timescale and speak logic are included. The compass object is assigned before createEngine.\n\nThe compass object is assigned to window.__compass before createEngine. Function declarations inside start() are hoisted, so onFrame can reference it immediately.\n\nPointerover targets [data-game=\"row\"]. Seed is applied after pause. When info.server is present, the canvas hides and local input is skipped. Modal mode stops intents but not simulation steps; inspector.pause() must be called to halt play.\n\nModal mode must stay false during a session. Blocking intents would also block local input, breaking hub and couch controls. Pause alone stops simulation steps while keeping input active.\n\nModal mode is defined as false when the screen is op and no card is active, keeping input active during a session. When a card is up, modal becomes true. Menus read gamepads directly via samplePads, and uiAccept actions remain functional because they are separate from intents.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cdb65346-73f0-47c2-93b8-e52c5f4b7851-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"slider|data-set","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/ui/shell.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":900,"output_tokens":836,"cache_read_input_tokens":78592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"7f72ea91-140b-46b9-b4f0-207b45c01be1"}
