{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_308","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Tool sounds could be triggered by rating events with a tool field, or by actual tool use.\n\nRating events lack tool names. Menu accept and nick/rating/code events will drive the audio test. The e2e test will verify music volume at 0.1 and offline song rendering. A small sound map will be added to boot. Hash events will be skipped.\n\nA `blip` helper now routes each event type to a specific sound ID. Menu clicks trigger `sfx:menu`. The boot import list is being updated, and the remaining files are being written.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c440217f-eb12-4b72-b581-9be718f8b20e-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"lastDevice","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input","glob":"*.ts","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1966,"output_tokens":589,"cache_read_input_tokens":91264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"53c44cfb-1d34-4fb4-9c73-526f156cb0fb"}
