{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_325","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The session file size dropped from 16707 to 16701.\n\nThe file comparison passed. Next steps are writing exit-interview.json with tsx, running typecheck, formatting edited files with prettier, and running vitest for page, campaign, main, and play.\n\nTop-level await in main.ts is safe because the index script uses type module. I will grep package.json to pick between tsc and vue-tsc for typecheck. Prettier printWidth is 120. Unused imports were not added.\n\nI will run prettier on boot.ts, page.test.ts, main.ts, hub.ts, live.ts, and shell.ts. I am checking applyTune and scene for pre-existing compile issues. I will also check campaign.ts line count. The typecheck command may take a while, so I will set a 120-second timeout.\n\nJSON.stringify preserves key order, so the interview test will pass. I am writing a small scratch script to generate exit-interview.json, since tsx -e may not support imports.\n\nI am checking interview.ts for banned words that could fail validation scans. I will scan the file for substrings like \"guilt\" or \"second opinion\" and keep page copy clean.\n\nI identified banned words to scan for in interview.ts, shell.ts, and boot.ts. I will grep those files before running tests. I also need to verify that game.bleedRate matches the balance key and that scenes/main.ts still compiles with the botHands import.\n\nI will check tsconfig to see if labs/game is included, since that determines whether typecheck surfaces errors. I am keeping line counts low: boot is about 510 lines, campaign near 589, and cases near 587. I verified that page.test imports interview without pulling in the engine, and index.html tests read files directly. I also need to inspect defineLook in looks.ts for schema issues that could crash when tests import boot.\n\nCampaign and page tests do not import boot. Main.test imports scene instead of boot. Importing boot in Node would load the entire engine, but top-level code avoids DOM globals like document and window. This makes it a safe smoke test for import-time errors.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-da817360-5ed8-49df-a1be-27a373e74515-102","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|placeholder|lorem|GUILT|Healing Touch|Caduceus|Delphi|Kyriaki|Z-Cells|second opinion|Derek|Bliss|Adam","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game","glob":"*.{ts,html}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-da817360-5ed8-49df-a1be-27a373e74515-103","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"./node_modules/.bin/prettier --write labs/game/app/boot.ts labs/game/app/page.test.ts labs/game/main.ts labs/game/net/hub.ts labs/game/net/live.ts labs/game/ui/shell.ts && ./node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --pretty false --pretty false 2>&1 | head -c 20000","description":"Format page files and typecheck the project","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2142,"output_tokens":1345,"cache_read_input_tokens":116224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"5d00ff5c-f337-40bd-b52f-f623c8cf7cc0"}
