{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_337","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The before-1 boxes start at line 38 and the next scene begins at line 58.\n\nThe first test expected 40 accepts to reach brief, but the story actually enters op after 40 accepts. The second test passed because finishOp works in op. I will revise the first test to accept until brief with a cap and assert it reached there within 40 steps.\n\nThe revised first test will loop up to 40 accepts while the screen is story, then assert it reached brief. On the op screen, accept does nothing because items are empty, so finishOp still works.\n\nThe second test will be tightened to accept until the screen reaches op, then call finishOp. This removes dependency on 40 accepts always overshooting brief.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce57d804-b481-4850-ac96-c1a00115a6e5-153","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts","offset":36,"limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce57d804-b481-4850-ac96-c1a00115a6e5-154","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts","offset":330,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1402,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":144640,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"83f5441d-8646-4aa1-b9da-93b896041d4f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ce57d804-b481-4850-ac96-c1a00115a6e5-153","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"36→    id: 'before-1',\\n    where: 'Harbor Light, night',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'ODIE: Congratulations, Doctor. You are the only surgeon in the building.',\\n40→      'WREN: The storm took the bridge. I can hear the glass in it.',\\n      'ODIE: And the ad. Turn that down before it turns you.',\\n      'VOSS: Pain is just a feeling you have not paid to remove yet.',\\n      'WREN: Halcyon. Because you deserve to feel nothing. Who bought that line?',\\n      'ODIE: Everyone with a wallet. Tomás Reyes is on table one. Deck hatch. Glass.',\\n      'WREN: Is he awake?',\\n      'ODIE: Awake enough to ask after a dog. The dog is in the corridor, against every rule I have.',\\n      'WREN: Leave the dog. I will be quick.',\\n      'ODIE: You will be careful. Quick is how people become stories.',\\n      'WREN: Drain, forceps, suture. I have had the lecture.',\\n50→      'ODIE: Then give it back to me with your hands. Vitals are seventy and rude about it.',\\n      'WREN: Sorry. I say that to them even when they cannot hear.',\\n      'ODIE: Good. Start with the water. The glass can wait its turn.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'after-1',\\n    where: 'The corridor',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'ODIE: He is breathing like a man who intends to keep the habit.',\\n60→      'WREN: The dog is still here.',\",\"content_concise\":\"36→    id: 'before-1',\\n    where: 'Harbor Light, night',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'ODIE: Congratulations, Doctor. You are the only surgeon in the building.',\\n40→      'WREN: The storm took the bridge. I can hear the glass in it.',\\n      'ODIE: And the ad. Turn that down before it turns you.',\\n      'VOSS: Pain is just a feeling you have not paid to remove yet.',\\n      'WREN: Halcyon. Because you deserve to feel nothing. Who bought that line?',\\n      'ODIE: Everyone with a wallet. Tomás Reyes is on table one. Deck hatch. Glass.',\\n      'WREN: Is he awake?',\\n      'ODIE: Awake enough to ask after a dog. The dog is in the corridor, against every rule I have.',\\n      'WREN: Leave the dog. I will be quick.',\\n      'ODIE: You will be careful. Quick is how people become stories.',\\n      'WREN: Drain, forceps, suture. I have had the lecture.',\\n50→      'ODIE: Then give it back to me with your hands. Vitals are seventy and rude about it.',\\n      'WREN: Sorry. I say that to them even when they cannot hear.',\\n      'ODIE: Good. Start with the water. The glass can wait its turn.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'after-1',\\n    where: 'The corridor',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'ODIE: He is breathing like a man who intends to keep the habit.',\\n60→      'WREN: The dog is still here.',\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts\",\"offset\":36,\"limit\":25,\"raw_output\":\"    id: 'before-1',\\n    where: 'Harbor Light, night',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'ODIE: Congratulations, Doctor. You are the only surgeon in the building.',\\n      'WREN: The storm took the bridge. I can hear the glass in it.',\\n      'ODIE: And the ad. Turn that down before it turns you.',\\n      'VOSS: Pain is just a feeling you have not paid to remove yet.',\\n      'WREN: Halcyon. Because you deserve to feel nothing. Who bought that line?',\\n      'ODIE: Everyone with a wallet. Tomás Reyes is on table one. Deck hatch. Glass.',\\n      'WREN: Is he awake?',\\n      'ODIE: Awake enough to ask after a dog. The dog is in the corridor, against every rule I have.',\\n      'WREN: Leave the dog. I will be quick.',\\n      'ODIE: You will be careful. Quick is how people become stories.',\\n      'WREN: Drain, forceps, suture. I have had the lecture.',\\n      'ODIE: Then give it back to me with your hands. Vitals are seventy and rude about it.',\\n      'WREN: Sorry. I say that to them even when they cannot hear.',\\n      'ODIE: Good. Start with the water. The glass can wait its turn.',\\n    ]),\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'after-1',\\n    where: 'The corridor',\\n    boxes: boxes([\\n      'ODIE: He is breathing like a man who intends to keep the habit.',\\n      'WREN: The dog is still here.',\\n\",\"total_lines\":396}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ce57d804-b481-4850-ac96-c1a00115a6e5-154","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"330→  if (id === 'unlock') {\\n    c.progress.free = true;\\n    c.progress.attending = true;\\n    c.progress.cleared = storyCases().length;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  cycleSetting(c, id);\\n}\\n\\nexport function cancel(c: Campaign): void {\\n340→  c.idle = 0;\\n  if (c.screen === 'story') {\\n    finishScene(c);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'op') {\\n    c.back = 'op';\\n    c.screen = 'pause';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n350→  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'pause') {\\n    c.screen = 'op';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') return leaveAttract(c);\\n  if (c.screen === 'credits') {\\n    c.screen = 'title';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n360→  }\\n  c.screen = c.back === c.screen ? 'title' : c.back;\\n  if (c.screen === 'pause' || c.screen === 'title') c.focus = 0;\\n}\\n\\nexport function noteInput(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.idle = 0;\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') leaveAttract(c);\\n}\\n\\n370→export function tickFront(c: Campaign, dtMs: number, inSession: boolean): void {\\n  if (inSession) return;\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') {\\n    c.clipMs -= dtMs;\\n    if (c.clipMs <= 0) {\\n      c.clip = (c.clip + 1) % ATTRACT.length;\\n      c.clipMs = ATTRACT[c.clip].ms;\\n      if (ATTRACT[c.clip].kind === 'story') c.box = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\",\"content_concise\":\"330→  if (id === 'unlock') {\\n    c.progress.free = true;\\n    c.progress.attending = true;\\n    c.progress.cleared = storyCases().length;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  cycleSetting(c, id);\\n}\\n\\nexport function cancel(c: Campaign): void {\\n340→  c.idle = 0;\\n  if (c.screen === 'story') {\\n    finishScene(c);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'op') {\\n    c.back = 'op';\\n    c.screen = 'pause';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n350→  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'pause') {\\n    c.screen = 'op';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') return leaveAttract(c);\\n  if (c.screen === 'credits') {\\n    c.screen = 'title';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n360→  }\\n  c.screen = c.back === c.screen ? 'title' : c.back;\\n  if (c.screen === 'pause' || c.screen === 'title') c.focus = 0;\\n}\\n\\nexport function noteInput(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.idle = 0;\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') leaveAttract(c);\\n}\\n\\n370→export function tickFront(c: Campaign, dtMs: number, inSession: boolean): void {\\n  if (inSession) return;\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') {\\n    c.clipMs -= dtMs;\\n    if (c.clipMs <= 0) {\\n      c.clip = (c.clip + 1) % ATTRACT.length;\\n      c.clipMs = ATTRACT[c.clip].ms;\\n      if (ATTRACT[c.clip].kind === 'story') c.box = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts\",\"offset\":330,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"  if (id === 'unlock') {\\n    c.progress.free = true;\\n    c.progress.attending = true;\\n    c.progress.cleared = storyCases().length;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  cycleSetting(c, id);\\n}\\n\\nexport function cancel(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.idle = 0;\\n  if (c.screen === 'story') {\\n    finishScene(c);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'op') {\\n    c.back = 'op';\\n    c.screen = 'pause';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'pause') {\\n    c.screen = 'op';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') return leaveAttract(c);\\n  if (c.screen === 'credits') {\\n    c.screen = 'title';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.screen = c.back === c.screen ? 'title' : c.back;\\n  if (c.screen === 'pause' || c.screen === 'title') c.focus = 0;\\n}\\n\\nexport function noteInput(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.idle = 0;\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') leaveAttract(c);\\n}\\n\\nexport function tickFront(c: Campaign, dtMs: number, inSession: boolean): void {\\n  if (inSession) return;\\n  if (c.screen === 'attract') {\\n    c.clipMs -= dtMs;\\n    if (c.clipMs <= 0) {\\n      c.clip = (c.clip + 1) % ATTRACT.length;\\n      c.clipMs = ATTRACT[c.clip].ms;\\n      if (ATTRACT[c.clip].kind === 'story') c.box = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n\",\"total_lines\":589}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"71c62601-8651-4afb-967d-796e9e695aef"}
