{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1a2f3462-ca38-4354-b1bd-b38ab71e0007-156","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"490→  if (!def) {\\n    c.screen = 'credits';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.caseIndex = index;\\n  c.caseId = def.id;\\n  c.leg = leg;\\n  c.storyId = leg === 'before' ? def.storyBefore : def.storyAfter;\\n  c.box = 0;\\n  c.lineMs = 0;\\n500→  c.screen = 'story';\\n}\\n\\nfunction advanceStory(c: Campaign): void {\\n  const scene = sceneById(c.storyId);\\n  if (!scene) return;\\n  if (c.box < scene.boxes.length - 1) {\\n    c.box += 1;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n510→  finishScene(c);\\n}\\n\\nfunction finishScene(c: Campaign): void {\\n  if (c.leg === 'before') {\\n    c.screen = 'brief';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.progress.cleared = Math.max(c.progress.cleared, c.caseIndex + 1);\\n520→  if (c.progress.cleared >= storyCases().length) {\\n    c.progress.free = true;\\n    c.progress.attending = true;\\n    c.screen = 'credits';\\n    c.page = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  openCase(c, c.progress.cleared, 'before');\\n}\\n\\n530→function afterWin(c: Campaign): void {\\n  if (c.caseIndex < 0) {\\n    c.screen = 'board';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.leg = 'after';\\n  const def = storyCases()[c.caseIndex];\\n  c.storyId = def?.storyAfter ?? 'after-1';\\n  c.box = 0;\\n540→  c.screen = 'story';\\n}\\n\\nfunction retryCase(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.boot += 1;\\n  c.keepPhase = false;\\n  c.screen = 'op';\\n  c.won = false;\\n}\\n\\n550→function enterAttract(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.screen = 'attract';\\n  c.clip = 0;\\n  c.clipMs = ATTRACT[0].ms;\\n  c.box = 0;\\n  c.record = false;\\n}\\n\\nfunction leaveAttract(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.screen = 'title';\",\"content_concise\":\"490→  if (!def) {\\n    c.screen = 'credits';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.caseIndex = index;\\n  c.caseId = def.id;\\n  c.leg = leg;\\n  c.storyId = leg === 'before' ? def.storyBefore : def.storyAfter;\\n  c.box = 0;\\n  c.lineMs = 0;\\n500→  c.screen = 'story';\\n}\\n\\nfunction advanceStory(c: Campaign): void {\\n  const scene = sceneById(c.storyId);\\n  if (!scene) return;\\n  if (c.box < scene.boxes.length - 1) {\\n    c.box += 1;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n510→  finishScene(c);\\n}\\n\\nfunction finishScene(c: Campaign): void {\\n  if (c.leg === 'before') {\\n    c.screen = 'brief';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.progress.cleared = Math.max(c.progress.cleared, c.caseIndex + 1);\\n520→  if (c.progress.cleared >= storyCases().length) {\\n    c.progress.free = true;\\n    c.progress.attending = true;\\n    c.screen = 'credits';\\n    c.page = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  openCase(c, c.progress.cleared, 'before');\\n}\\n\\n530→function afterWin(c: Campaign): void {\\n  if (c.caseIndex < 0) {\\n    c.screen = 'board';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.leg = 'after';\\n  const def = storyCases()[c.caseIndex];\\n  c.storyId = def?.storyAfter ?? 'after-1';\\n  c.box = 0;\\n540→  c.screen = 'story';\\n}\\n\\nfunction retryCase(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.boot += 1;\\n  c.keepPhase = false;\\n  c.screen = 'op';\\n  c.won = false;\\n}\\n\\n550→function enterAttract(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.screen = 'attract';\\n  c.clip = 0;\\n  c.clipMs = ATTRACT[0].ms;\\n  c.box = 0;\\n  c.record = false;\\n}\\n\\nfunction leaveAttract(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.screen = 'title';\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts\",\"offset\":490,\"limit\":70,\"raw_output\":\"  if (!def) {\\n    c.screen = 'credits';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.caseIndex = index;\\n  c.caseId = def.id;\\n  c.leg = leg;\\n  c.storyId = leg === 'before' ? def.storyBefore : def.storyAfter;\\n  c.box = 0;\\n  c.lineMs = 0;\\n  c.screen = 'story';\\n}\\n\\nfunction advanceStory(c: Campaign): void {\\n  const scene = sceneById(c.storyId);\\n  if (!scene) return;\\n  if (c.box < scene.boxes.length - 1) {\\n    c.box += 1;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  finishScene(c);\\n}\\n\\nfunction finishScene(c: Campaign): void {\\n  if (c.leg === 'before') {\\n    c.screen = 'brief';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.progress.cleared = Math.max(c.progress.cleared, c.caseIndex + 1);\\n  if (c.progress.cleared >= storyCases().length) {\\n    c.progress.free = true;\\n    c.progress.attending = true;\\n    c.screen = 'credits';\\n    c.page = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  openCase(c, c.progress.cleared, 'before');\\n}\\n\\nfunction afterWin(c: Campaign): void {\\n  if (c.caseIndex < 0) {\\n    c.screen = 'board';\\n    c.focus = 0;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  c.leg = 'after';\\n  const def = storyCases()[c.caseIndex];\\n  c.storyId = def?.storyAfter ?? 'after-1';\\n  c.box = 0;\\n  c.screen = 'story';\\n}\\n\\nfunction retryCase(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.boot += 1;\\n  c.keepPhase = false;\\n  c.screen = 'op';\\n  c.won = false;\\n}\\n\\nfunction enterAttract(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.screen = 'attract';\\n  c.clip = 0;\\n  c.clipMs = ATTRACT[0].ms;\\n  c.box = 0;\\n  c.record = false;\\n}\\n\\nfunction leaveAttract(c: Campaign): void {\\n  c.screen = 'title';\\n\",\"total_lines\":589}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"c4d60329-5edf-4aac-82b3-c7aae13980d2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_340","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"14 boxes are in progress. 13 accept advance. The 14th finishes to brief.\n\nThe 15th box starts operations. The test will walk until brief, then one more to operations. Story length is confirmed at 14 boxes, within the required 12-35 range. Next steps are fixing the campaign test, writing verify.mjs from the skeleton, and creating one-file.mts.\n\nThe HTML deliverable, e2e tests, and hub tools still need to be built. Documentation files must also be written before running verify. The full eight-case end-to-end playthrough will likely take one to two minutes per case at eight timescale, so the timeout should be set to five to ten minutes.\n\nBuilding one-file.mts is the immediate priority. The Vite build will take about a minute and produce roughly seven megabytes. It must preserve session.js as the first script in the output. The inlineBuild step will add the note and module script while keeping externalRefs empty.\n\nThe source test already verifies that session.js is first and byte-identical. Rebuilding the deliverable in Vitest would be too slow, so e2e or verify will check the built HTML directly.\n\nThe deliverable HTML will be written to the work folder root with a timestamped basename, sitting beside the dev directory. The e2e test will assert that the first script in this built file matches vendor session.js.\n\nThe verify.mjs skeleton already includes the required @file comment. I will add a verify script to package.json via npm pkg set. The defineSong runtime is being checked: with steps:1 and beats:4, each bar is exactly four steps, so the title note tokens align correctly. To prevent a silent page boot failure from invalid song data, I will smoke-import the library in Node.\n\nThe import smoke test will run in the package directory via tsx to validate audio and visual modules before building. The campaign test fix and one-file build come next. The hub harness will download harness.html, bridge.js, and round.js to serve the deliverable.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d57f0b7-09f6-4057-bc25-51ddd156983a-157","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.test.ts","old_string":"    expect(campaign.screen).toBe('story');\n    expect(campaign.storyId).toBe('before-1');\n    for (let i = 0; i < 40; i++) accept(campaign);\n    expect(campaign.screen).toBe('brief');\n    accept(campaign);\n    expect(campaign.screen).toBe('op');","new_string":"    expect(campaign.screen).toBe('story');\n    expect(campaign.storyId).toBe('before-1');\n    let steps = 0;\n    while (campaign.screen === 'story' && steps < 40) {\n      accept(campaign);\n      steps += 1;\n    }\n    expect(steps).toBeLessThanOrEqual(40);\n    expect(campaign.screen).toBe('brief');\n    accept(campaign);\n    expect(campaign.screen).toBe('op');"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d57f0b7-09f6-4057-bc25-51ddd156983a-158","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.test.ts","old_string":"    act(campaign, 'new');\n    for (let i = 0; i < 40; i++) accept(campaign);\n    finishOp(campaign, true, 16815, 0, '');","new_string":"    act(campaign, 'new');\n    for (let i = 0; i < 40 && campaign.screen !== 'op'; i++) accept(campaign);\n    expect(campaign.screen).toBe('op');\n    finishOp(campaign, true, 16815, 0, '');"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d57f0b7-09f6-4057-bc25-51ddd156983a-159","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-