{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_346","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The look tags harbor, field, still, pulse, and low are unique.\n\nemitter:rain is taken. It will be renamed to emitter:squall.\n\nsfx collisions need fixing. laser is taken. song:title is also taken.\n\nAll game sfx and songs will be prefixed with compass- to avoid future collisions.\n\nboot.ts and library.ts need updates. boot.ts references alarm, rank, beep, stitch, gel, mercy, or, story, and title. library.ts references sfx: and song: prefixes.\n\nA careful replace_all will handle the changes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3b1584eb-bdf6-45d6-9e20-2fb6c1ade21f-168","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/audio/library.ts","old_string":"defineSfx('sfx:","new_string":"defineSfx('sfx:compass-","replace_all":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3b1584eb-bdf6-45d6-9e20-2fb6c1ade21f-169","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/audio/library.ts","old_string":"defineSong('song:","new_string":"defineSong('song:compass-","replace_all":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3b1584eb-bdf6-45d6-9e20-2fb6c1ade21f-170","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/view/rain.ts","old_string":"defineEmitter('emitter:rain', {","new_string":"defineEmitter('emitter:squall', {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3b1584eb-bdf6-45d6-9e20-2fb6c1ade21f-171","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/