{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_371","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing e2e.mjs now. It will be comprehensive but not infinite.\n\nNow designing hub.mjs. It will download three files into a local serve directory and run a Python HTTP server. The deliverable HTML will be copied there before testing. Considering whether to commit those files or download them on demand.\n\nThe third-party harness files will be downloaded into tools/vendor for reproducibility. Four test runs are planned with varying player counts, latency, jitter, and loss. Each run uses a 20-second limit so the time-up event fires. The host must finish within the grace period; our code already handles this by finishing on time-up with won=false. Opening the game without an active session is covered by the e2e boot.\n\nPotential hub failures include missed ready() calls, missing cards, hash mismatches, double steps, server errors, and stale meta tags. The build must be rebuilt after the meta tag and reset fix changes before running e2e or hub. The plan is to write both scripts, rebuild, run e2e first, then run hub.\n\nCampaign unit tests and eslint will be re-run while writing e2e. The campaign test will wait for ten minutes via waitForFunction instead of polling. If the bot times out, the screen and op status will be inspected via evaluate. The autoplay title accept timing and scene state during the story are being verified to ensure the bot lands on the correct operation scene.\n\nA potential bug was spotted in the autoplay logic: accept runs every frame, which could trigger on settings screens. The exact execution order of finishOp, accept, and syncRun during the brief-to-op transition is being verified to ensure correct timing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-87419162-d73c-4bce-8e62-868e429f0246-207","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","offset":415,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":428,"output_tokens":945,"cache_read_input_tokens":195328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"01d42361-a90b-49ac-b16f-b3a91dcb99fa"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-87419162-d73c-4bce-8e62-868e429f0246-207","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"415→\\n  function onFrame(frame: EngineFrame, bar: Hud): void {\\n    const enginePage = page;\\n    const input = engine?.input;\\n    if (!enginePage || !input || !canvas || !shell) return;\\n420→    const blob = (frame.world.query('chart')[0] as { chart?: { blob?: string } } | undefined)?.chart?.blob ?? '';\\n    if (blob) followChart(blob);\\n    menus(input);\\n    tickFront(campaign, frame.dt * 1000, !!session);\\n    syncRun(enginePage);\\n    const run = session ? 'op:case:gala-shift' : desiredRun(campaign);\\n    const op = liveOp();\\n    if (!session && campaign.screen === 'op' && op && op.status !== 'playing') {\\n      finishOp(campaign, op.status === 'won', op.score, op.slips, op.fail);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, false);\\n430→      audio.play(op.status === 'won' ? 'sfx:compass-rank' : 'sfx:compass-alarm');\\n    }\\n    if (autoplay && !session && campaign.screen !== 'op' && campaign.screen !== 'credits' && campaign.screen !== 'attract') {\\n      accept(campaign);\\n    }\\n    const busy = !session && ['pause', 'debrief', 'settings', 'dev', 'handbook'].includes(campaign.screen);\\n    if (session || busy) enginePage.pause();\\n    else enginePage.resume();\\n    if (!session && autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op') enginePage.timeScale(8);\\n    else if (!session && campaign.screen !== 'dev') enginePage.timeScale(1);\\n440→    layLooks(enginePage, run);\\n    const sites = Math.max(1, op?.sites.length ?? 1);\\n    const seats = op?.seats.length ?? campaign.progress.seats;\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op' && !session && !op?.attract && !autoplay) {\\n      enginePage.input.axis(\",\"content_concise\":\"415→\\n  function onFrame(frame: EngineFrame, bar: Hud): void {\\n    const enginePage = page;\\n    const input = engine?.input;\\n    if (!enginePage || !input || !canvas || !shell) return;\\n420→    const blob = (frame.world.query('chart')[0] as { chart?: { blob?: string } } | undefined)?.chart?.blob ?? '';\\n    if (blob) followChart(blob);\\n    menus(input);\\n    tickFront(campaign, frame.dt * 1000, !!session);\\n    syncRun(enginePage);\\n    const run = session ? 'op:case:gala-shift' : desiredRun(campaign);\\n    const op = liveOp();\\n    if (!session && campaign.screen === 'op' && op && op.status !== 'playing') {\\n      finishOp(campaign, op.status === 'won', op.score, op.slips, op.fail);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, false);\\n430→      audio.play(op.status === 'won' ? 'sfx:compass-rank' : 'sfx:compass-alarm');\\n    }\\n    if (autoplay && !session && campaign.screen !== 'op' && campaign.screen !== 'credits' && campaign.screen !== 'attract') {\\n      accept(campaign);\\n    }\\n    const busy = !session && ['pause', 'debrief', 'settings', 'dev', 'handbook'].includes(campaign.screen);\\n    if (session || busy) enginePage.pause();\\n    else enginePage.resume();\\n    if (!session && autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op') enginePage.timeScale(8);\\n    else if (!session && campaign.screen !== 'dev') enginePage.timeScale(1);\\n440→    layLooks(enginePage, run);\\n    const sites = Math.max(1, op?.sites.length ?? 1);\\n    const seats = op?.seats.length ?? campaign.progress.seats;\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op' && !session && !op?.attract && !autoplay) {\\n      enginePage.input.axis(\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts\",\"offset\":415,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"\\n  function onFrame(frame: EngineFrame, bar: Hud): void {\\n    const enginePage = page;\\n    const input = engine?.input;\\n    if (!enginePage || !input || !canvas || !shell) return;\\n    const blob = (frame.world.query('chart')[0] as { chart?: { blob?: string } } | undefined)?.chart?.blob ?? '';\\n    if (blob) followChart(blob);\\n    menus(input);\\n    tickFront(campaign, frame.dt * 1000, !!session);\\n    syncRun(enginePage);\\n    const run = session ? 'op:case:gala-shift' : desiredRun(campaign);\\n    const op = liveOp();\\n    if (!session && campaign.screen === 'op' && op && op.status !== 'playing') {\\n      finishOp(campaign, op.status === 'won', op.score, op.slips, op.fail);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, false);\\n      audio.play(op.status === 'won' ? 'sfx:compass-rank' : 'sfx:compass-alarm');\\n    }\\n    if (autoplay && !session && campaign.screen !== 'op' && campaign.screen !== 'credits' && campaign.screen !== 'attract') {\\n      accept(campaign);\\n    }\\n    const busy = !session && ['pause', 'debrief', 'settings', 'dev', 'handbook'].includes(campaign.screen);\\n    if (session || busy) enginePage.pause();\\n    else enginePage.resume();\\n    if (!session && autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op') enginePage.timeScale(8);\\n    else if (!session && campaign.screen !== 'dev') enginePage.timeScale(1);\\n    layLooks(enginePage, run);\\n    const sites = Math.max(1, op?.sites.length ?? 1);\\n    const seats = op?.seats.length ?? campaign.progress.seats;\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op' && !session && !op?.attract && !autoplay) {\\n      enginePage.input.axis(\\n\",\"total_lines\":544}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"bb1bbfb8-39f6-4a16-83a5-7c57f8dada70"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_372","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found: accept occurs after syncRun.\n\nAccept routing is correct across all screens. The op transition timing is also sound. Accept is properly disabled during active gameplay.\n\nfinishOp transitions from op to debrief correctly. Story flow after cases is sound.\n\nA new bug was found: when entering op, syncRun has not yet run for that frame. The previous op case may still be active, or the screen may be title with no op.\n\nThe title screen may leave liveOp as null or a leftover operation. finishOp safely no-ops when no operation exists. The execution order is finishOp before accept.\n\nThe winning case transitions correctly from op to debrief to story. The next frame syncRun replaces the finished operation with the title run. timeScale is set after accept.\n\ntimeScale correctly drops to 1 when accept exits op, since accept runs before the timeScale update. autoplay is set on the frame after entering op, so the scene reads it after seeding. Next step is writing end-to-end tests.\n\nPrettier will be run on boot before the format check. The hub will be downloaded into labs/game/tools/hub/. The end-to-end test will stay under 600 lines, ideally around 250. It will use Playwright with a fresh context and the devices import for touch testing. A Firefox browser instance will be added at the end. The attract test will verify the attract screen appears after 11 seconds without autoplay, then press a key to reach the title screen while checking localStorage.\n\nThe attract test will compare localStorage JSON snapshots to verify no unwanted writes occur. The glyphs toggle test will navigate settings and press ArrowRight to reach the second page, then check for console labels like Xbox or PlayStation.\n\nThe glyphs toggle test will click the glyphs button and read the resulting text.\n\nFor the title screen, a pad stub will simulate dpad down and button 0 to select a row. A mouse hover will also be tested by moving focus onto \"The Board\" and clicking it. The pad path will use an init script with a one-frame press on button 13 followed by button 0 for accept, with a frame delay between inputs.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ccdbe6d6-55ba-45ae-925f-583528b4f8c6-208","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function claimSeat","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts","-A":12}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1451,"output_tokens":1320,"cache_read_input_tokens":195712,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"5a937926-31c5-4b59-8240-78d0eef08302"}
