{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_375","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the code flow: readHands calls samplePads under a specific condition.\n\nConfirmed menus() samples pads first, so readHands reuses them without resampling. Next: write e2e.mjs and hub.mjs, run prettier, rebuild, and check boot.ts is under 600 lines.\n\nHub files will be downloaded into labs/game/tools/hub/. The e2e test plan includes an audio verification step that resumes the audio context and checks for sound output.\n\nThe e2e test will verify the page contains no `<audio` tag before opening it in the browser. Firefox will be tested via a Python spawn after Chromium closes. A campaign timeout of 11 minutes is set, with screen details logged on failure. A note about touch media query behavior is also included.\n\nThe campaign test captures a live snapshot of the compass state if it times out. It records the current screen, case ID, box, operation status, tick count, and score. This lets us diagnose exactly where the bot stalled.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3272a905-e5b8-4de0-998c-1a7826f2846d-214","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"uiAccept:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1663,"output_tokens":944,"cache_read_input_tokens":200192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"42ddafd8-41eb-4547-a576-1d32ef691c39"}
