{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_376","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Enter and Space are accepted. Escape pauses and may cancel.\n\nWriting end-to-end tests and hub.mjs. Next steps are prettier boot, line count check, rebuild, campaign test unit, then e2e. The hub server will use a Python HTTP server bound to 127.0.0.1 with port 0, parsing the assigned port from stderr.\n\nThe game URL will use harness.html with the game file and a 25-turn limit. The harness auto-clicks through. Total runtime is long, so end-to-end tests will run first. Campaign failures will be fixed before the hub.\n\nChecking if time-up alone passes the harness. Traffic flows bidirectionally during the 20-second limit. The server scenario hides the canvas and sends ticks from empty hands. Host-leave is handled by the harness.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-288b60fc-458a-421a-a8c1-1418e494c6d3-215","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"max-lines|max-warnings","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731","glob":"*.{js,mjs,cjs,json}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1238,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":201728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"a923c8f8-112a-44f3-ab7d-58328ac1d499"}
