{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_385","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Fix the packedHands reference. Run Prettier. Then run tests and rebuild.\n\nThe packedHands call is redundant. readHands already updated cursors for all four seats earlier in the frame. Calling it again would double-apply dt.\n\nThe `void hands` line confirms the packed array is unused for the session sample. I will delete those two lines entirely. The local glove spot is already current. I should also check if Prettier wraps line 440. The readHands logic is correct: it runs every frame, but local hands are excluded from game:hands during sessions because the host sends samples via the hub.\n\nI will fix cpExists in hub.mjs to use existsSync so missing files fail clearly. The plan is to boot, run Prettier, execute campaign.test.ts and tsc, download hub files in parallel, rebuild the one-file bundle, then run e2e. I can also draft TESTING-LOG, ENGINE-FEEDBACK, PROGRESS, and README while the tests are running.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4360749d-21c2-4893-822b-e6deded063ed-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\- \\[[ x]\\]","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151/goal/plan.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4360749d-21c2-4893-822b-e6deded063ed-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"testingFeedback|ENGINE-FEEDBACK|TESTING-LOG|## Deviations","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work","glob":"*.{md,json,ts}","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4360749d-21c2-4893-822b-e6deded063ed-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/STAGE.md","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7785,"output_tokens":782,"