{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_395","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Vitest writes report.json.\n\nPrettier, campaign tests, hub file downloads, and a pointer probe will run in parallel. Hub files will be downloaded into labs/game/tools/hub/. cpExists will be fixed to check file existence before copying.\n\nThe pointer probe will be a temporary script at labs/game/tools/pointer-probe.mjs. It will run and then be deleted.\n\nThe pointer probe will run directly from the package directory using node --input-type=module -e, since Node resolves ESM imports from the current working directory. Campaign tests should be faster than the full npm test suite.\n\nCampaign tests will run now. Full npm test is deferred to verify. Prettier will be applied to boot.ts first. Hub files will be downloaded with curl. The pointer probe needs CHROMIUM_PATH. The README will be reviewed while tests run. A max-lines check and blank line style fix for boot.ts are also planned.\n\nCampaign tests are pure JavaScript and should finish quickly. The 125-character if statement at line 440 will be wrapped by prettier's printWidth of 120. The hub harness will be downloaded and inspected while the build runs. The one-file Vite build is next, starting after prettier so the packedHands fix is included.\n\nThe one-file build will run after the parallel tasks finish. The long end-to-end test will start next, with documentation work deferred until it completes. TESTING-LOG.md must list all twelve reported issues, including the seven critical ones, to remain honest with the interview requirements.\n\nThe TESTING-LOG.md will be written from scratch to match the interview's twelve issues, combining the seven critical ones with five additional real issues from the conversation summary. If end-to-end testing reveals more issues, both the log and the interview counts will be updated. The first three critical issues are restore body, gala flap, and Reverie surface.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-61b0795b-6e8f-4d1a-ae1c-bc9b5e3cfa37-39","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TESTING-LOG|game-breaking|critical","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151/compaction","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-61b0795b-6e8f-4d1a-ae1c-bc9b5e3cfa37-40","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\" && ./node_modules/.bin/prettier --write labs/game/app/boot.ts && awk 'length>120 {print NR, length}' labs/game/app/boot.ts; wc -l labs/game/app/boot.ts","description":"Format boot.ts and recheck line length"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3269,"output_tokens":1325,"cache_read_input_tokens":77568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"bd9a6cdf-d01b-48d7-b288-39ea51a466e9"}
