 a cell every 4s if ≤14 live; lacquer blocks stitch/drain within 1.2m; 2 binder doses set cell.timer = 6 field s fade. Mercy only if phase id starts with 'mercy'. Phase id `mercy-motes`: after 6 kills and 0 live motes, spawn 3 binders tag 'mercy'. If motes<6 and kills<6, respawn every 8s via mercyRound. Guide tag 'moving' drifts path x by sin(timer/20)*0.004 per step. Done tendrils reattach after 10 field s if any tendril remain [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":54,\"content\":\"- Co-op: ordinary (non-unique) spawns duplicated Math.round(ordinary.length * 0.25 * extraSeats) times, shifted in Z by 3.2*(copy). UNIQUE kinds: matron, mercy, reverie, balmNode, flap, solace — HP scales, not copies. coopScale = 1 + balance.coopHp*(seats-1), default coopHp 0.6. Explicit spawn.burnNeed is multiplied by hpScale AGAIN after kindDefaults. Do not pass burnNeed if you want the kind default.\"},{\"line_number\":55,\"content\":\"- Bot (labs/game/op/bot.ts) may only change the sim through Hand fields. seat.memo is bot scratch, not hashed, not read by stepOp. Exports: botHands(op), runBot(op, cap=60*60*12). runBot cap 12 minutes of ticks; same signature for >600 ticks sets fail `stalled …` and stops. Signature includes phase, code, injected, mercyKills, and per undone target cut/stitches/volume/burn/laserDamage/dose/hidden/stroke. Cursor speed uses balance.cursor (default 8 m/s). Forceps pull speed is 4 m/s so speed*60 ≤ 8 (CLEAN, not ROUGH). Syringe charges until seat.syringe ≥ 0.86 then releases (TEXTBOOK band). Inject spot is (0, 2.2); case targets should stay off that point. If seat.hold ≥ 0, the bot commits to pulling that target. Suture: only use when segmentU is within 0.14 of the intended stitch u. stitchId on Seat (NOT hashed) resets sutureSide only when switching to a wound that has 0 stitches. Hand.radial is optional so idleHand stays valid.\"},{\"line_number\":258,\"content\":\"- Prior stretch (still valid, do not regress): gala flap stall fixed in act.ts; reverie surface early-return; Solace child spacing 1.45m; Balm syringe bindTarget; suture u within 0.14; stitchId; coop z+3.2; tendril hold-commit; lull priority ahead of flap; sequencer addAnchor; drama caption period removed so playThrough passes; slip assertion green; accidental work/node_modules vitest@5 deleted. applyHands radial patch and content tests were green before the page stretch.\"},{\"line_number\":275,\"content\":\"- Sheet density reduced for the four-copy software harness; record as one Deviations bullet. Radial slow fixed at 0.6 in the sim while a view slider exists. Other implementation corrections (coop z, solace spacing, reverie surface, flap-follows-hand) are corrections so the plan’s rules complete, not rule changes.\"},{\"line_number\":482,\"content\":\"- Strains (strains.ts): Lull nuzzle after 6 field s, telegraph 1.5s, optional numb, −2 vitals, laser burnNeed 1.5×hp then cocoon. Matron vulnerable when cycle%8s ≥ 5.5s, doseNeed 2, births a non-optional lull once per cycle after the first instant if live lulls < 4. Solace gen<3 scalpel stroke ≥1.5m splits into two gen+1 (cap 12) spread at angle id*1.7, radius 1.45; constricts ONCE (5s then 2s telegraph, optional pool, −5 vitals). Reverie hidden until scanned (reveal 6s), laser surfaces for 2.2 field s, damage persists, submerges, burnNeed 5×hp. Balm node spawns a cell every 4s if ≤14 live; lacquer blocks stitch/drain within 1.2m; 2 binder doses set cell.timer = 6 field s fade. Mercy only if phase id starts with 'mercy'. Phase id `mercy-motes`: after 6 kills and 0 live motes, spawn 3 binders tag 'mercy'. If motes<6 and kills<6, respawn every 8s via mercyRound. Guide tag 'moving' drifts path x by sin(timer/20)*0.004 per step. Done tendrils reattach after 10 field s if any tendril remain [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":483,\"content\":\"- Co-op: ordinary (non-unique) spawns duplicated Math.round(ordinary.length * 0.25 * extraSeats) times, shifted in Z by 3.2*(copy). UNIQUE kinds: matron, mercy, reverie, balmNode, flap, solace — HP scales, not copies. coopScale = 1 + balance.coopHp*(seats-1), default coopHp 0.6. Explicit spawn.burnNeed is multiplied by hpScale AGAIN after kindDefaults. Do not pass burnNeed if you want the kind default.\"},{\"line_number\":484,\"content\":\"- Bot (labs/game/op/bot.ts) may only change the sim through Hand fields. seat.memo is bot scratch, not hashed, not read by stepOp. Exports: botHands(op), runBot(op, cap=60*60*12). runBot cap 12 minutes of ticks; same signature for >600 ticks sets fail `stalled …` and stops. Signature includes phase, code, injected, mercyKills, and per undone target cut/stitches/volume/burn/laserDamage/dose/hidden/stroke. Cursor speed uses balance.cursor (default 8 m/s). Forceps pull speed is 4 m/s so speed*60 ≤ 8 (CLEAN, not ROUGH). Syringe charges until seat.syringe ≥ 0.86 then releases (TEXTBOOK band). Inject spot is (0, 2.2); case targets should stay off that point. If seat.hold ≥ 0, the bot commits to pulling that target. Suture: only use when segmentU is within 0.14 of the intended stitch u. stitchId on Seat (NOT hashed) resets sutureSide only when switching to a wound that has 0 stitches. Hand.radial is optional so idleHand stays valid.\"},{\"line_number\":651,\"content\":\"- Prior stretch (still valid, do not regress): gala flap stall fixed in act.ts; reverie surface early-return; Solace child spacing 1.45m; Balm syringe bindTarget; suture u within 0.14; stitchId; coop z+3.2; tendril hold-commit; lull priority ahead of flap; sequencer addAnchor; drama caption period removed so playThrough passes; slip assertion green; accidental work/node_modules vitest@5 deleted. applyHands radial patch and content tests were green before the page stretch.\"},{\"line_number\":662,\"content\":\"- Sheet density reduced for the four-copy software harness; record as one Deviations bullet. Radial slow fixed at 0.6 in the sim while a view slider exists. Other implementation corrections (coop z, solace spacing, reverie surface, flap-follows-hand) are corrections so the plan’s rules complete, not rule changes.\"},{\"line_number\":2440,\"content\":\"- **Handbook** (from Pause and the Board): big paged cards showing what you can and cannot do. One per instrument (what it does, what it cannot do, its controls in the current glyphs), the Gift, flaps, sites and the Code, and one per strain once met. Built from the data, so it cannot go stale.\"},{\"line_number\":2492,\"content\":\"**Field animation (page-side, springs from the API):** tool swings, needle arcs, stitch pull-tight, heart beats locked to the ECG, breathing, flap hinge, hand tremble, the slap of a tool handed over, tissue parting with lips along an incision, ripple under the sheet.\"},{\"line_number\":2494,\"content\":\"**Camera moves:** lamp-to-field descent at operation start, pull-back on failure, site blends, parallax ±3° with the cursor, precision dolly-in, roll hazard tilt, Drama Cut, tilt under a raised flap.\"},{\"line_number\":2518,\"content\":\"Title logo 6 s → Case 1 stitching → Case 3 site triage and Stillpoint → a story scene with a Drama Cut → Case 5 Solace splits under Second Pulse with the ship rolling → Case 6 Scanner and flap, with the AI colleague → Case 7 three tables → Case 8 Mercy's Code → postcards → loop.\"},{\"line_number\":3110,\"content\":\"820→- Each tool's rules, each rating band, each strain's state machine, each failure (flatline, clock, slips), Stillpoint's and Second Pulse's rules, flap clip timing.\"},{\"line_number\":3148,\"content\":\"7. **Strains and flaps:** Cases 4, 5, 6, with Second Pulse, seats, AI colleague, Swap, Consult, couch co-op.\"},{\"line_number\":4863,\"content\":\"270→5. **Struck Off** (70). Lift and clip a flap; Solace beneath → split and burn generation by generation → **the storm hits**: the\"},{\"line_number\":4865,\"content\":\"   the flap, Wren holding it → close, still rolling.\"},{\"line_number\":4867,\"content\":\"   for the beat → the Reverie under the heart flap; Consult → close.\"},{\"line_number\":4873,\"content\":\"280→Node, one flap. Ends when both are closed (won) or one dies or time runs out (lost). Playable also from Free Surgery for couch play.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0394a819-2510-4ff0-a66a-c7764650158a-45","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[49,51,54,50,52,32,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,116,111,111,108,115,47,104,117,98,47,98,114,105,100,103,101,46,106,115,10,50,55,52,54,57,32,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,116,111,111,108,115,47,104,117,98,47,104,97,114,110,101,115,115,46,104,116,109,108,10,50,48,50,52,56,32,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,116,111,111,108,115,47,104,117,98,47,114,111,117,110,100,46,106,115,10,54,49,51,52,49,32,116,111,116,97,108,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\n13624 labs/game/tools/hub/bridge.js\\n27469 labs/game/tools/hub/harness.html\\n20248 labs/game/tools/hub/round.js\\n61341 total\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\\\" && mkdir -p labs/game/tools/hub && curl -fsSL -o labs/game/tools/hub/harness.html https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/harness.html && curl -fsSL -o labs/game/tools/hub/bridge.js https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/bridge.js && curl -fsSL -o labs/game/tools/hub/round.js https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/round.js && wc -c labs/game/tools/hub/*\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Download AI Hub harness files\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e15