{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_398","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hub files are downloaded. I will review harness requirements and start the build and campaign tests.\n\nFixing hub.mjs to use existsSync. Reviewing harness.html and hub meta requirements to verify the protocol. Starting the one-file build, campaign test, page test, and pointer probe in parallel.\n\nThe pointer probe will run after the build finishes. The Vite build needs a short temporary directory. I will check for type errors with tsc separately, since Vitest does not typecheck.\n\nFixed the packedHands type error. Prettier ran successfully. I will run the fast vitest campaign, page, and main tests first, then the Vite build, since the full typecheck is CPU-heavy.\n\nVitest does not import boot.ts, so the packedHands fix will not be caught by those tests. Esbuild leaves undefined variables as free identifiers rather than failing at build time, which is why TypeScript or eslint must be run on boot.\n\nTypeScript and Vite will run in parallel. Campaign tests will precede the long e2e suite to catch logic bugs early.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8bf1cb46-9725-4167-b596-1386f24da3dc-46","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__hubCheck|dataset.complete|hub:session|pass","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/hub/harness.html"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8bf1cb46-9725-4167-b596-1386f24da3dc-47","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub:session|session.js","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/index.html"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8bf1cb46-9725-4167-b596-1386f24da3dc-48","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-ma