gh-20261104-224731/engine/app/drawing.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * the camera shake, the damage numbers, the overlay, then the page's own `onFrame`), `settle` (a frame drawn and done\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\" * // const { drawing, frame, settle, warmCameras } = createPageDrawing(parts, { chrome, settings, onFrame });\"},{\"line_number\":82,\"content\":\" * What `onFrame` gets once per drawn frame: the run to read, never to change (presentation only: nothing reaches the\"},{\"line_number\":113,\"content\":\"  onFrame?: (frame: EngineFrame) => void;\"},{\"line_number\":190,\"content\":\"      if (options.onFrame) {\"},{\"line_number\":196,\"content\":\"        options.onFrame({ world, scene, camera: viewNow().camera.pose(), queries, dt, emit, setting });\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"99b93a41-84d2-4ac9-8539-73817bc89a5a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_406","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"pause() halts simulation time while the view and onFrame continue running.\n\nClient input is sent from onFrame. The host ticks from setInterval. Traffic flows both ways if clients actually send. The client send condition requires session.playing to be true and hub.time() to be non-negative.\n\nThe scene must create an op for client input to send. The host's setInterval steps the engine to set liveOp. Clients step when they receive ticks. Before ticks arrive, the client may only have a warmup op that gets rewound by seed.\n\nThe client should have enough time to step and create an op before the play window ends. When the host leaves, the hub client must void the game; this is not the harness's finish() job.\n\nfinish() only runs for the host. The coordinator voids the round when the host leaves, using endReason host-left. The hub client handles this. A server copy with no player runs the world; info.server is true and local hands are suppressed.\n\nThe server still runs startRound and onFrame even with a hidden canvas, which risks WebGPU failure. The AI Hub client patches Math.random before boot imports, so the harness can rely on its seeded flag. Card menus require the hub to emit a 'card' event.\n\nThe official client emits the card event via poke. The engine must see the Enter key, and uiAccept should still work if a modal captures it.\n\nWhen the card menu is active, menus() answers ready and the harness auto-pokes Enter. The client's ready() signals that the copy has loaded, which is separate from answering the card.\n\nI will start the build and tests now. A pointer probe can run after the build in the same browser.\n\nA tiny pointer probe will run in parallel with Vite to test any-pointer device emulation. Only the labs/game tests will be run now via tsx and vitest to confirm the campaign test; the full engine suite will be verified later.\n\nVitest will run labs/game tests with a dot reporter. The pointer probe follows after Vite starts. Vite may take up to three minutes, so it could be backgrounded if needed. All tool scripts already have @file headers and are under the 600-line limit.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bcfc19f-73bb-487a-8d0c-60eb95a622fe-62","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\" && ./node_modules/.bin/prettier --write labs/game/tools/hub.mjs labs/game/app/boot.ts >/dev/null && export TMPDIR=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX) && echo \"TMPDIR=$TMPDIR\" && ./node_modules/.bin/tsx labs/game/tools/one-file.mts; ec=$?; rm -rf \"$TMPDIR\"; echo \"build_exit=$ec\"","description":"Rebuild the one-file HTML deliverable","block_until_ms":180000}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9bcfc19f-73bb-487a-8d0c-60eb95a622fe-63","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\" && ./node_modules/.bin/vitest run labs/game/app/campaign.test.ts labs/game/app/page.test.ts labs/game/scenes/main.test.ts labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts --reporter=dot","description":"Run campaign, page, and scene tests","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1609,"output_tokens":1552,"cache_read_input_tokens":104960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"e7c6823e-ac29-4428-93b4-e5d1b113fb68"}
