{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_414","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Pixel 7 reports fine:false, coarse:true, and hoverNone:true.\n\ntouchOnly() should return true on Pixel 7. The e2e touch check can pass if the page renders the touch div. The test waits 1500ms for [data-game=\"touch\"] to appear. The tap at 640,400 may miss the Settings button on a 412x915 viewport.\n\nThe Settings button already appears on the touch overlay, so the locator count is always positive. The test therefore passes even if the tap at 640,400 misses.\n\nThe e2e test will tap the Settings button via its locator and verify the settings screen opens. Playwright's tap() uses touch input automatically when available. The test also needs to wait for attract mode to run on touch-only devices.\n\nA 12-second wait will be added before tapping Settings so attract mode can run without resetting idle state. The test will also verify there is no virtual joystick element present.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ef0fd9d5-2355-40c3-bc48-af7abf5926bb-73","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/ui/shell.ts","offset":160,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":535,"output_tokens":796,"cache_read_input_tokens":121088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"530058ef-333b-4830-8544-a80ebd1bed9d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ef0fd9d5-2355-40c3-bc48-af7abf5926bb-73","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"160→    c.page,\\n    c.board,\\n    c.box,\\n    c.clip,\\n    c.devTab,\\n    c.tab,\\n    c.caseId,\\n    c.won,\\n    c.lastRank,\\n    c.fail,\\n170→    c.postcard,\\n    c.hideHud,\\n    c.claimed.join(''),\\n    p.glyphs,\\n    p.difficulty,\\n    p.blood,\\n    p.master,\\n    p.music,\\n    p.effects,\\n    p.voice,\\n180→    p.simple,\\n    p.autoText,\\n    p.seats,\\n    extra.touch,\\n    card,\\n  ].join('|');\\n}\\n\\n/** Draw the screens into `root`. Returns the stamp it drew. */\\nexport function renderShell(root: HTMLElement, c: Campaign, extra: ShellExtra): void {\\n190→  const touch = extra.touch\\n    ? `<div class=\\\"touch\\\" data-game=\\\"touch\\\"><p>Controller or keyboard required</p><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"row\\\" data-act=\\\"settings\\\">Settings</button></div>`\\n    : '';\\n  const menu = items(c).length ? `<div class=\\\"menu\\\" data-game=\\\"menu\\\">${rows(c)}</div>` : '';\\n  const prompt = c.screen === 'op' || c.screen === 'pause' ? '' : `<p class=\\\"prompt\\\">${extra.prompt}</p>`;\\n  root.innerHTML = `<div class=\\\"screen\\\" data-game=\\\"screen\\\" data-screen=\\\"${esc(c.screen)}\\\">${body(c, extra)}${menu}${prompt}</div>${touch}<p data-about=\\\"usage\\\" class=\\\"usage\\\">added on import</p>`;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"160→    c.page,\\n    c.board,\\n    c.box,\\n    c.clip,\\n    c.devTab,\\n    c.tab,\\n    c.caseId,\\n    c.won,\\n    c.lastRank,\\n    c.fail,\\n170→    c.postcard,\\n    c.hideHud,\\n    c.claimed.join(''),\\n    p.glyphs,\\n    p.difficulty,\\n    p.blood,\\n    p.master,\\n    p.music,\\n    p.effects,\\n    p.voice,\\n180→    p.simple,\\n    p.autoText,\\n    p.seats,\\n    extra.touch,\\n    card,\\n  ].join('|');\\n}\\n\\n/** Draw the screens into `root`. Returns the stamp it drew. */\\nexport function renderShell(root: HTMLElement, c: Campaign, extra: ShellExtra): void {\\n190→  const touch = extra.touch\\n    ? `<div class=\\\"touch\\\" data-game=\\\"touch\\\"><p>Controller or keyboard required</p><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"row\\\" data-act=\\\"settings\\\">Settings</button></div>`\\n    : '';\\n  const menu = items(c).length ? `<div class=\\\"menu\\\" data-game=\\\"menu\\\">${rows(c)}</div>` : '';\\n  const prompt = c.screen === 'op' || c.screen === 'pause' ? '' : `<p class=\\\"prompt\\\">${extra.prompt}</p>`;\\n  root.innerHTML = `<div class=\\\"screen\\\" data-game=\\\"screen\\\" data-screen=\\\"${esc(c.screen)}\\\">${body(c, extra)}${menu}${prompt}</div>${touch}<p data-about=\\\"usage\\\" class=\\\"usage\\\">added on import</p>`;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/ui/shell.ts\",\"offset\":160,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    c.page,\\n    c.board,\\n    c.box,\\n    c.clip,\\n    c.devTab,\\n    c.tab,\\n    c.caseId,\\n    c.won,\\n    c.lastRank,\\n    c.fail,\\n    c.postcard,\\n    c.hideHud,\\n    c.claimed.join(''),\\n    p.glyphs,\\n    p.difficulty,\\n    p.blood,\\n    p.master,\\n    p.music,\\n    p.effects,\\n    p.voice,\\n    p.simple,\\n    p.autoText,\\n    p.seats,\\n    extra.touch,\\n    card,\\n  ].join('|');\\n}\\n\\n/** Draw the screens into `root`. Returns the stamp it drew. */\\nexport function renderShell(root: HTMLElement, c: Campaign, extra: ShellExtra): void {\\n  const touch = extra.touch\\n    ? `<div class=\\\"touch\\\" data-game=\\\"touch\\\"><p>Controller or keyboard required</p><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"row\\\" data-act=\\\"settings\\\">Settings</button></div>`\\n    : '';\\n  const menu = items(c).length ? `<div class=\\\"menu\\\" data-game=\\\"menu\\\">${rows(c)}</div>` : '';\\n  const prompt = c.screen === 'op' || c.screen === 'pause' ? '' : `<p class=\\\"prompt\\\">${extra.prompt}</p>`;\\n  root.innerHTML = `<div class=\\\"screen\\\" data-game=\\\"screen\\\" data-screen=\\\"${esc(c.screen)}\\\">${body(c, extra)}${menu}${prompt}</div>${touch}<p data-about=\\\"usage\\\" class=\\\"usage\\\">added on import</p>`;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":196}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"715b2513-00ed-481d-9d86-ecf26cd4d5f2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_415","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The touch banner is outside the screen and always shown when extra.\n\nThe e2e tap at 640,400 on Pixel 7 may miss. I'll tap the settings button and confirm screen instead. I'll wait for attract to start within 15 seconds while the message shows. Then I'll tap settings. Playwright tap dispatches touch and click events. The shell click listener will handle it. The idle timer resets. The screen switches to settings.\n\nThe banner hides after opening settings. I'll update the e2e touch block and check for other bugs before the long run. The hover test targets the wrong title row: `nth=2` selects Scrub In, not The Board.\n\nThe hover test will fail because `nth=2` targets Scrub In instead of The Board. It should be changed to `nth=1`. After clicking Back and Enter to start a new shift, focus resets to the title row. The story then runs through 20 enters to reach the op screen.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-aa236070-09ae-4083-96b9-020272473b78-74","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"devTab|Balance|function devItems","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game","glob":"*.{ts,css}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1193,"output_tokens":670,"cache_read_input_tokens":121600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"2f1c4509-3cb0-4b7a-a702-d48748a6e941"}
