{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_421","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Updating menus to skip accept on a fresh claim.\n\nUpdating e2e tests to match the plan. Board is nth=1. Adding wait for reset value. Touch flow covers message, attract, and settings. Glyphs settings needs a new block for keyboard Enter prompt and Xbox selection. Attract exits need key, mouse, pad button, and stick.\n\nAdding key and pad exits to the attract test as separate short checks after the mouse exit. The stick exit requires an addInitScript for pad axes. Thirty seconds extra is acceptable.\n\nThe attract test will sequence mouse, key, and pad stick exits. The current mouse click may not trigger noteInput because the menus attract logic only checks pads and keyboard. Any key press exits attract.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6a06802d-c7ec-4d45-8475-d59804460360-83","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"uiAccept|mouse|pointer","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/input/map.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6a06802d-c7ec-4d45-8475-d59804460360-84","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function watchPointer|pointerDown|clicked","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/input/hands.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2334,"output_tokens":734,"cache_read_input_tokens":131840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"45e21142-bbfb-48a9-8ea7-04588b3cc44a"}
