oteInput(campaign);\",\"content_concise\":\"385→    enginePage.set('game.colleague', false);\\n    enginePage.set('game.autoplay', autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op');\\n    enginePage.seed(1);\\n    placeCamera(enginePage, run);\\n    sig = next;\\n390→  }\\n\\n  function menus(input: Input): void {\\n    const pads = samplePads();\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') {\\n      if (pads.any || input.pressed('pause') || input.pressed('uiAccept')) noteInput(campaign);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    let joined = false;\\n    if (pads.claim >= 0 && campaign.screen === 'scrub') {\\n400→      joined = !campaign.claimed[pads.claim];\\n      claimSeat(campaign, pads.claim);\\n    }\\n    if (session?.card) {\\n      if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) hub?.answer('ready');\\n      if (input.pressed('uiCancel')) hub?.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op') {\\n      if (pads.pause || input.pressed('pause')) {\\n410→        if (session) {\\n          campaign.back = 'op';\\n          campaign.screen = 'settings';\\n        } else cancel(campaign);\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (pads.up || input.pressed('uiUp')) move(campaign, -1);\\n    if (pads.down || input.pressed('uiDown')) move(campaign, 1);\\n    if (pads.left || input.pressed('uiLeft')) browse(campaign, -1);\\n420→    if (pads.right || input.pressed('uiRight')) browse(campaign, 1);\\n    if (!joined && (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept'))) {\\n      accept(campaign);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    }\\n    if (pads.cancel || input.pressed('uiCancel')) {\\n      cancel(campaign);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    }\\n    if (pads.any) noteInput(campaign);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts\",\"offset\":385,\"limit\":45,\"raw_output\":\"    enginePage.set('game.colleague', false);\\n    enginePage.set('game.autoplay', autoplay && campaign.screen === 'op');\\n    enginePage.seed(1);\\n    placeCamera(enginePage, run);\\n    sig = next;\\n  }\\n\\n  function menus(input: Input): void {\\n    const pads = samplePads();\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') {\\n      if (pads.any || input.pressed('pause') || input.pressed('uiAccept')) noteInput(campaign);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    let joined = false;\\n    if (pads.claim >= 0 && campaign.screen === 'scrub') {\\n      joined = !campaign.claimed[pads.claim];\\n      claimSeat(campaign, pads.claim);\\n    }\\n    if (session?.card) {\\n      if (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept')) hub?.answer('ready');\\n      if (input.pressed('uiCancel')) hub?.answer('more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (campaign.screen === 'op') {\\n      if (pads.pause || input.pressed('pause')) {\\n        if (session) {\\n          campaign.back = 'op';\\n          campaign.screen = 'settings';\\n        } else cancel(campaign);\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (pads.up || input.pressed('uiUp')) move(campaign, -1);\\n    if (pads.down || input.pressed('uiDown')) move(campaign, 1);\\n    if (pads.left || input.pressed('uiLeft')) browse(campaign, -1);\\n    if (pads.right || input.pressed('uiRight')) browse(campaign, 1);\\n    if (!joined && (pads.accept || input.pressed('uiAccept'))) {\\n      accept(campaign);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    }\\n    if (pads.cancel || input.pressed('uiCancel')) {\\n      cancel(campaign);\\n      saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    }\\n    if (pads.any) noteInput(campaign);\\n\",\"total_lines\":563}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"74345f90-0baf-40fe-92e9-0347acaa1b7e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_426","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found: the `if (pads.any) noteInput` check runs after accept.\n\nThe noteInput logic is sound. The campaign block should be moved to after touch and before browser.close.\n\nThe attract test will press Escape while the screen is still attract to verify exit. The current test presses Escape after returning to title, which may not trigger the expected behavior.\n\nThe Escape key press will be replaced with a second attract cycle. The pad stub script will be injected via evaluate after the page loads, since the page already captures getGamepads dynamically.\n\nThe stick test will use a pad stub with axes at 0.9 to trigger pads.any and exit attract. Key and stick tests will run in sequence, adding roughly twenty seconds of wait time. A glyph check block is also planned, but the prompt HTML must be inspected first.\n\nThe keyboard glyph check will press ArrowDown to move focus and inspect the `.prompt` HTML for an Enter glyph. The Xbox gamepad test will stub a pad so lastDevice becomes gamepad. It is unclear whether the engine sets lastDevice from getGamepads or only from its action map.\n\nThe stubbed pad will be injected via `page.evaluate` after the page loads. The prompt HTML will be captured before and after the gamepad input to verify whether `lastDevice` updates.\n\nThe glyph test sequence was refined to click Settings, press ArrowRight, and then Glyphs. The prompt is read before the pad input to avoid keyboard interference. The report checks for the PlayStation glyph `M32 8` or the Xbox label `>A<`. A concern was raised that ArrowRight might switch `lastDevice` to keyboard before the after-read capture.\n\nThe glyph test is being simplified to avoid flakiness. Instead of complex pad and keyboard sequences, the new approach will press a key to verify the Enter glyph appears in the prompt HTML, click with the mouse to confirm the mouse path glyph changes, and inspect the Settings page row label for Glyphs and Xbox.\n\nThe Xbox glyph prompt check will be consolidated into a single test that verifies both the last device and the Xbox setting. The campaign block will be relocated to just before browser.close via search-replace. Prettier formatting, a rebuild, and probe deletion are also planned. A minor scoping concern was noted: `joined` is declared inside menus but remains accessible in scrub join paths.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-748bfa65-c825-48a2-aeff-03dad11e2185-96","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","old_string":"{\n  const page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\n  watch(page);\n  await page.goto(`${pageUrl}?game.autoplay=1`);\n  let detail = '';\n  let ok = false;\n  try {\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass && window.__compass.screen === 'credits', null, { timeout: 660000 });\n    ok = true;\n  } catch {\n    detail = await page.evaluate(() => {\n      const op = window.__compass?.live?.();\n      return JSON.stringify({\n        screen: window.__compass?.screen,\n        caseId: window.__compass?.campaign?.caseId,\n        status: op?.status,\n        tick: op?.tick,\n        score: op?.score,\n        fail: op?.fail,\n      });\n    });\n  }\n  report('campaign reaches the credits', ok, detail);\n  await page.close();\n}\n\n{","new_string":"{"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-748bfa65-c825-48a2-aeff-03dad11e2185-97","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","old_string":"  report('attract exits on a click and saves nothing', demo > 0 && before === after, `demo ${demo}`);\n  await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n  await page.close();\n}","new_string":"  report('attract exits on a click and saves nothing', demo > 0 && before === after, `demo ${demo}`);\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass?.screen === 'attract', null, { timeout: 15000 });\n  await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass?.screen === 'title');\n  report('attract exits on a key', true, '');\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass?.screen === 'attract', null, { timeout: 15000 });\n  await page.evaluate(() => {\n    window.__pads = [null, null, null, null];\n    navigator.getGamepads = () => window.__pads;\n    const buttons = Array.from({ length: 16 }, () => ({ pressed: false, value: 0 }));\n    window.__pads[0] = { index: 0, connected: true, mapping: 'standard', axes: [0.95, 0, 0, 0], buttons, id: 'stub-0' };\n  });\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass?.screen === 'title');\n  report('attract exits on a stick', true, '');\n  await page.close();\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-748bfa65-c825-48a2-aeff-03dad11e2185-98","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","old_string":"await browser.close();","new_string":"{\n  const page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 1280, height: 720 } });\n  watch(page);\n  await page.goto(pageUrl);\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass?.screen === 'title');\n  await page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n  const keys = await page.locator('.prompt').innerHTML();\n  await page.mouse.click(200, 200);\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n  const mouse = await page.locator('.prompt').innerHTML();\n  await page.click('text=Settings');\n  await page.keyboard.press('ArrowRight');\n  await page.click('text=Glyphs');\n  const xbox = await page.locator('[data-game=\"menu\"]').innerText();\n  report('prompts follow the last device', keys.includes('Enter') && mouse.includes('M18 16'), `${keys.includes('Enter')} ${mouse.includes('M18 16')}`);\n  report('Xbox glyphs are a setting', xbox.includes('Xbox'), xbox);\n  await page.close();\n}\n\n{\n  const page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\n  watch(page);\n  await page.goto(`${pageUrl}?game.autoplay=1`);\n  let detail = '';\n  let ok = false;\n  try {\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass && window.__compass.screen === 'credits', null, { timeout: 660000 });\n    ok = true;\n  } catch {\n    detail = await page.evaluate(() => {\n      const op = window.__compass?.live?.();\n      return JSON.stringify({\n        screen: window.__compass?.screen,\n        caseId: window.__compass?.campaign?.caseId,\n        status: op?.status,\n        tick: op?.tick,\n        score: op?.score,\n        fail: op?.fail,\n      });\n    });\n  }\n  report('campaign reaches the credits', ok, detail);\n  await page.close();\n}\n\nawait browser.close();"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1503,"output_tokens":2716,"cache_read_input_tokens":140160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"fa74a5be-53b3-468b-9f62-7899bef1454b"}
