{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_438","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The attract mode failed to start within 15 seconds.\n\nThe 15-second timeout matches the attract wait exactly. The idle timer likely resets from input or pointer events before the 10-second threshold is reached.\n\nThe idle timer might not be incrementing because the engine's first frames have a huge delta time. The page might also treat mouse movement as input. The test only triggers pointerdown, so pointermove events from the viewport could be resetting idle.\n\nThe idle timer logic looks correct. The title screen is in MENUS, so dtMs should accumulate normally. The real issue may be that the modal pauses the frame loop on the title screen.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0780e517-e202-4d07-b932-d579cac92d6d-115","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"modal","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine","glob":"**/*.ts","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0780e517-e202-4d07-b932-d579cac92d6d-116","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","offset":85,"limit":25}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0780e517-e202-4d07-b932-d579cac92d6d-117","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"MENUS","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":565,"output_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":163840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151"