arget, stitches landed off the wound, co-op copies shared one point, an outline width the engine rejects, a sound id the engine already owns, and a look and a song that used fields the engine does not have.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"The most helpful tests were the bot, which had to win every required case and seed, and the content walk that plays the whole shift to the credits.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful was the voice-key equality check. It only shows that one line keeps the same syllable list. The starter gem tests had to stay green and do not cover an operation.\\\"\\n  ],\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d72f94db-43fc-4da4-83b0-68bad09e51a8-135","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"14. Not critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded and were removed before the page was shipped.\\n\\nFourteen issues. Eleven of them were game-breaking (1–9, and the two load failures inside 14 counted with the outline and the sound id as boot failures: items 8, 9, and the two fields in 14). The boot failures are 8, 9, and 14. Items 10–13 are not game-breaking. Eleven critical means items 1–9 and 14.\",\"new_string\":\"14. Critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded.\\n\\nFourteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Four were not: 10–13.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"14. Not critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded and were removed before the page was shipped.\\n\\nFourteen issues. Eleven of them were game-breaking (1–9, and the two load failures inside 14 counted with the outline and the sound id as boot failures: items 8, 9, and the two fields in 14). The boot failures are 8, 9, and 14. Items 10–13 are not game-breaking. Eleven critical means items 1–9 and 14.\",\"old_line\":18,\"new_string\":\"14. Critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded.\\n\\nFourteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Four were not: 10–13.\",\"new_line\":18,\"context_before\":\"11. Not critical. `labs/game/app/campaign.test.ts`: a fixed run of accepts walked past the first briefing, because that scene has fourteen boxes. The test now stops when the briefing is up.\\n12. Not critical. Dev Mode reset wrote the setting back and left the on-screen slider on the dragged number, because the shell caches the value. Reset now writes the fallback into that cache.\\n13. Not critical. Scrub In treated a new pad's Cross as Start as well as claim, so the seat list closed on the joining press. A seat that was not claimed yet claims and stays on the screen.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"54eee660-a4b9-4e1f-b1ce-a586f8d4b21e"}
