emory: nothing kept past the page\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/best.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"    const replay = createStore({ prefix: 'my3dge-game:', backend, mode: 'demo' });\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":147,\"content\":\"function saveProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>, c: Campaign, session: boolean): void {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"30cd3b1f-8434-4413-b2f2-f81db8b2ba0c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_461","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"End-to-end tests are still running and reporting failures.\n\nTwo e2e failures are being analyzed. The first shows attract exiting on click without saving anything. The second shows hover highlighting \"The Board\" but the click failing to navigate to the board screen.\n\nThe board click might fail due to pointer-events, a wrong data-act attribute, or an immediate return to the title screen. The rows() rendering structure needs inspection. The attract localStorage failure is caused by the engine store writing during play.\n\nThe engine's 'play' mode persists store keys during attract scenes, which explains the unexpected localStorage changes. I will inspect the code directly rather than launching another browser instance.\n\nThe click handler is being inspected to see if it immediately returns to the title screen. The saveProgress function and engine store writes are also being reviewed.\n\nThe click handler and CSS pointer-events are not the issue. The failure likely stems from multiple `.is-on` elements, causing Playwright to click the wrong button.\n\nThe title screen likely has a default \"New Shift\" button that is already `is-on`. Hovering then shifts focus to \"The Board\", which the test reads correctly. The click handler itself is not the problem, since it properly routes to `pick('board')`. Each e2e test runs in a fresh browser page, so state from earlier tests does not leak into the mouse hover and click test.\n\nThe test waits for the screen to reach 'title', but the engine is not ready yet. The shell only appears after createEngine finishes its warmup and drawShell runs. The hover therefore fires before the buttons are interactive.\n\nThe mouse test waits for the screen to reach title before hovering, but the story test waits for engine readiness first. Since the hover did not time out, the buttons must have existed when the test began.\n\nThe engine is fully ready, so the shell is interactive. The click should work. The rows() function must be inspected to verify the button's data-act attribute and innerText. The go() function updates the screen and resets focus, then pick calls saveProgress and stamps the next frame.\n\nThe click handler updates campaign.screen synchronously, but __compass.screen is only copied from it at the end of onFrame. The test's evaluate call therefore reads the stale title screen before the next frame renders the board.\n\nThe mouse test reads `window.__compass.screen` immediately after the click, but the engine only copies the new screen value into that object at the end of the next frame. The story test avoids this by waiting for the `[data-game=\"screen\"]` attribute to update instead. The fix is to change the mouse test to wait for the screen attribute to become `'board'`.\n\nThe attract localStorage failure is being traced to the engine store and saveProgress. During attract, finishOp does not save because the screen is not op. The pointerdown event only triggers noteInput and does not write to storage. The click might instead hit a menu button that appears after the pointerdown.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bcc8b23-bdeb-4d79-911c-7dec48a41e34-149","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","offset":130,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bcc8b23-bdeb-4d79-911c-7dec48a41e34-150","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"localStorage|setItem|backend\\.set|function createStore","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine","glob":"**/*store*"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bcc8b23-bdeb-4d79-911c-7dec48a41e34-151","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/e2e.log","offset":1,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2844,"output_tokens":2128,"cache_read_input_tokens":189696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"832f801d-ad04-435a-9b4f-19c79f200dc3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3bcc8b23-bdeb-4d79-911c-7dec48a41e34-149","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"130→    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.run', 'op:case:gala-shift');\\n    search.set('game.seats', String(Math.max(1, info.players.length)));\\n    search.set('game.colleague', info.players.length === 1 ? '1' : '0');\\n    search.set('gfx.warmUp', 'asked');\\n  }\\n  if (autoplay) search.set('game.autoplay', '1');\\n  return `?${search}`;\\n}\\n140→\\n/** Saved night, or a fresh one. */\\nfunction loadProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>): Progress {\\n  return store.get('progress', createCampaign().progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Keep a night. Attract and a hub round do not. */\\nfunction saveProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>, c: Campaign, session: boolean): void {\\n  if (session || c.screen === 'attract' || !c.record) return;\\n  store.set('progress', c.progress);\\n150→}\\n\\n/** Overhead on an operation, the harbour shot otherwise. */\\nfunction placeCamera(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const at = FIELD_AT;\\n  const code = run.startsWith('op:')\\n    ? `cam3=fixed,${at.x},${at.y + 9},${at.z + 0.4},0,-80,42`\\n    : `cam3=fixed,${at.x - 1},${at.y + 4},${at.z + 6},20,-18,48`;\\n  engine.camera.set(code, { blend: true });\\n}\\n160→\\n/** Stillpoint, Second Pulse, and a low line, laid over the field. */\\nfunction layLooks(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const op = liveOp();\\n  engine.set('post.look', run.startsWith('op:') ? 'look:field' : 'look:harbor');\\n  const layers: { look: string; amount: number }[] = [];\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'still'))\\n    layers.push({ look: 'look:still', amount: 0.8 });\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'pulse'))\\n    layers.push({ look: 'look:pulse', amount: 0.7 });\",\"content_concise\":\"130→    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.run', 'op:case:gala-shift');\\n    search.set('game.seats', String(Math.max(1, info.players.length)));\\n    search.set('game.colleague', info.players.length === 1 ? '1' : '0');\\n    search.set('gfx.warmUp', 'asked');\\n  }\\n  if (autoplay) search.set('game.autoplay', '1');\\n  return `?${search}`;\\n}\\n140→\\n/** Saved night, or a fresh one. */\\nfunction loadProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>): Progress {\\n  return store.get('progress', createCampaign().progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Keep a night. Attract and a hub round do not. */\\nfunction saveProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>, c: Campaign, session: boolean): void {\\n  if (session || c.screen === 'attract' || !c.record) return;\\n  store.set('progress', c.progress);\\n150→}\\n\\n/** Overhead on an operation, the harbour shot otherwise. */\\nfunction placeCamera(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const at = FIELD_AT;\\n  const code = run.startsWith('op:')\\n    ? `cam3=fixed,${at.x},${at.y + 9},${at.z + 0.4},0,-80,42`\\n    : `cam3=fixed,${at.x - 1},${at.y + 4},${at.z + 6},20,-18,48`;\\n  engine.camera.set(code, { blend: true });\\n}\\n160→\\n/** Stillpoint, Second Pulse, and a low line, laid over the field. */\\nfunction layLooks(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const op = liveOp();\\n  engine.set('post.look', run.startsWith('op:') ? 'look:field' : 'look:harbor');\\n  const layers: { look: string; amount: number }[] = [];\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'still'))\\n    layers.push({ look: 'look:still', amount: 0.8 });\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'pulse'))\\n    layers.push({ look: 'look:pulse', amount: 0.7 });\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts\",\"offset\":130,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.seed', String(info.seed));\\n    search.set('game.run', 'op:case:gala-shift');\\n    search.set('game.seats', String(Math.max(1, info.players.length)));\\n    search.set('game.colleague', info.players.length === 1 ? '1' : '0');\\n    search.set('gfx.warmUp', 'asked');\\n  }\\n  if (autoplay) search.set('game.autoplay', '1');\\n  return `?${search}`;\\n}\\n\\n/** Saved night, or a fresh one. */\\nfunction loadProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>): Progress {\\n  return store.get('progress', createCampaign().progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Keep a night. Attract and a hub round do not. */\\nfunction saveProgress(store: ReturnType<typeof createStore>, c: Campaign, session: boolean): void {\\n  if (session || c.screen === 'attract' || !c.record) return;\\n  store.set('progress', c.progress);\\n}\\n\\n/** Overhead on an operation, the harbour shot otherwise. */\\nfunction placeCamera(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const at = FIELD_AT;\\n  const code = run.startsWith('op:')\\n    ? `cam3=fixed,${at.x},${at.y + 9},${at.z + 0.4},0,-80,42`\\n    : `cam3=fixed,${at.x - 1},${at.y + 4},${at.z + 6},20,-18,48`;\\n  engine.camera.set(code, { blend: true });\\n}\\n\\n/** Stillpoint, Second Pulse, and a low line, laid over the field. */\\nfunction layLooks(engine: PageEngine, run: string): void {\\n  const op = liveOp();\\n  engine.set('post.look', run.startsWith('op:') ? 'look:field' : 'look:harbor');\\n  const layers: { look: string; amount: number }[] = [];\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'still'))\\n    layers.push({ look: 'look:still', amount: 0.8 });\\n  if (op?.seats.some((seat) => seat.giftLeft > 0 && seat.giftKind === 'pulse'))\\n    layers.push({ look: 'look:pulse', amount: 0.7 });\\n\",\"total_lines\":563}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3bcc8b23-bdeb-4d79-911c-7dec48a41e34-150","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,54,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,111,109,112,97,115,115,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,101,110,116,101,114,45,83,101,99,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,47,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,103,102,120,47,115,116,111,114,101,121,67,117,116,46,116,115,10,56,57,58,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,99,114,101,97,116,101,83,116,111,114,101,121,67,117,116,40,109,101,115,104,101,115,58,32,76,101,118,101,108,77,101,115,104,101,115,41,58,32,83,116,111,114,101,121,67,117,116,32,123,10,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,111,109,112,97,115,115,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,101,110,116,101,114,45,83,101,99,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,