{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_462","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The end-to-end test failed. I will read the full log and stderr to identify all failures.\n\nThe mouse hover failed because the screen was still on the title. Compass updates likely happen asynchronously. The attract mode also wrote to localStorage. I need to check the full e2e log and stderr, and understand how the engine store persists settings during attract.\n\nThe board click likely failed to navigate because `__compass.screen` updates only in `onFrame`, not immediately. The hover detected \"Board\" but the screen remained \"title\", suggesting the click either did not trigger navigation or the compass state was stale.\n\nThe test should wait for the screen to become 'board' after the click. The localStorage write during attract likely came from the engine store persisting settings.\n\nThe engine likely persists settings automatically because its store is passed to createEngine. I will inspect the engine and best.ts for localStorage writes. The record flag is set to false on enterAttract and true on leaveAttract, but saveProgress skips saving when the screen is attract.\n\nThe attract click sequence is now clear. pointerdown triggers leaveAttract, which switches the screen to title and sets record to true without saving. The subsequent mouseup may then hit a title button and call pick(), which would trigger saveProgress.\n\nThe click likely missed the title button because Playwright's mouse events fire in the same frame. The attract-mode localStorage write probably came from the engine itself, not saveProgress. I will search the engine code for store set calls during scene execution.\n\nThe story test runs before the attract test in the same browser context. It presses Enter and triggers saveProgress, writing to localStorage before the attract test's `before` snapshot is taken. The attract page therefore inherits that progress from the story test. This explains why the attract test sees unexpected localStorage data.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80f68dc-c0c7-4c21-a70a-bb9a75ab2e39-152","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/e2e.err"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80f68dc-c0c7-4c21-a70a-bb9a75ab2e39-153","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","offset":108,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80f68dc-c0c7-4c21-a70a-bb9a75ab2e39-154","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"store\\.set|\\.set\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine","glob":"**/*.{ts,js}","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3553,"output_tokens":1256,"cache_read_input_tokens":192512,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"304622f6-bcda-472d-8c3e-b16432c7ae32"}
