d-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":130,\"content\":\"    storyId: 'before-1',\"},{\"line_number\":434,\"content\":\"  const box = scene.boxes[Math.min(c.box, scene.boxes.length - 1)];\"},{\"line_number\":506,\"content\":\"  if (c.box < scene.boxes.length - 1) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"    expect(campaign.storyId).toBe('before-1');\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file The campaign's scenes. Each one is a run of short boxes, twelve to thirty-five, said out loud over captions.\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"  boxes: Box[];\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"function boxes(lines: readonly string[]): Box[] {\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"    id: 'before-1',\"},{\"line_number\":38,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":78,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":98,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":118,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":138,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":158,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":178,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":198,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":218,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":238,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":258,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":278,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":298,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":318,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":338,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":358,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"},{\"line_number\":376,\"content\":\"    boxes: boxes([\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/content.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"  it('gives every scene between 12 and 35 boxes', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"      expect(scene.boxes.length).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(12);\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\"      expect(scene.boxes.length).toBeLessThanOrEqual(35);\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"406e9ae4-5d27-49f5-a7d2-65ff70b2897e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_476","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"advanceStory increments the box index if it is not at the final position. Otherwise it finishes the scene to the brief.\n\nFourteen accepts are enough to finish a 14-box scene. Story mode routes Space and Enter through accept. A mouse click at 200,200 during glyph tests might hit a menu button.\n\nTitle menu buttons are likely centered, so 200,200 may be empty canvas. The engine input system listens on the canvas, so pointer events still register even if the shell has pointer-events disabled. After an arrow key press, lastDevice becomes keyboard and Enter is used; after a mouse click, glyph M18 16 is used. The prompt shell redraws each frame when the stamp changes, so lastDevice updates should appear automatically. A 200ms wait should suffice once onFrame is running.\n\nPad tests must wait for the engine to be ready before injecting gamepads, or pad events will fire before onFrame and fail. The PAD_SCRIPT is addInitScript in e2e.mjs. Clicking Scrub In before the engine is ready may also fail if that button does not exist yet.\n\nThe mouse test reached hover because Playwright auto-waited for the button selector to appear after warmup and shell drawing. The screen title check returned immediately during engine creation, before the shell existed.\n\nThe title screen read failed because onFrame had not yet copied the frame during warmup. Hover auto-wait prevented this, but a click still requires an explicit wait for the screen to update. Pad injection must also wait for __engine.ready before any input that depends on the frame loop. Every page.goto path that interacts will be updated with a ready check.\n\nThe mouse test must wait for both ready and the button row selector. The pad test waits for ready, and the scrub test waits for ready plus the Scrub In text. Glyph and audio tests also wait for ready. Campaign autoplay needs no immediate ready check because its credits wait handles it.\n\nFor the pad edge test, the first evaluate sets pads[0] to null and then presses button 13. Since padWas starts false, that press registers as a down edge. Releasing the button after 150 ms and pressing button 0 means the edge fires once during warmup.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e72b85d-afef-4df6-9b60-2f9effe61b91-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Seat |scrub","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/ui/shell.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e72b85d-afef-4df6-9b60-2f9effe61b91-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e72b85d-afef-4df6-9b60-2f9effe61b91-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function claimSeat|claimed","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3055,"output_tokens":1215,"cache_read_input_tokens":62208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"9a709103-9a1a-4399-a95a-852214553cbc"}
