108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,98,101,115,116,46,116,115,10,51,49,58,32,32,115,116,111,114,101,46,115,101,116,40,66,69,83,84,95,75,69,89,44,32,115,101,99,111,110,100,115,41,59,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":2,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":149,\"content\":\"  store.set('progress', c.progress);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/best.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"  store.set(BEST_KEY, seconds);\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"b7e72ce6-e2d7-4173-80d4-a33894671388"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_485","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"best.ts is not used by the page.\n\nOmitting store from createEngine fixes the saveProgress issue. I will wrap e2e waits in try/catch so one timeout does not abort the entire campaign.\n\nA generic block wrapper risks double-counting failures because inner reports already exist. A guard function that catches errors without duplicating existing reports is preferable.\n\nThe guard helper will catch throws and report them as failed checks. Extra failures from already-reported errors are acceptable for diagnosis. The mouse block will catch waitForFunction timeouts internally, report the current screen, and return without throwing.\n\nThe `until` helper will catch `waitForFunction` timeouts, report the current screen, and return false. This prevents throws during the operation wait, which would otherwise break dependent checks like the dev slider. The mouse block will use this helper directly, while other blocks remain wrapped in try/catch to protect later tests.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Attract was writing the engine’s quality tier into storage, and menu Enter presses were landing in one frame. I’ll stop the engine from sharing the save store and pace those checks."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-48","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","old_string":"  (window as unknown as { __compass: Compass }).__compass = compass;\n\n  engine = await createEngine({\n    canvas,\n    scenes: [main.id, play.id],\n    levels: {\n      'level:or': { text: OR_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/room.ts' },\n      'level:arena': { text: ARENA_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts' },\n    },\n    search: searchFrom(info, autoplay),\n    store,\n    actionMap: SURGEON_MAP,","new_string":"  (window as unknown as { __compass: Compass }).__compass = compass;\n\n  // The night is saved only by saveProgress. The engine's own store would write a quality tier during attract.\n  engine = await createEngine({\n    canvas,\n    scenes: [main.id, play.id],\n    levels: {\n      'level:or': { text: OR_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/room.ts' },\n      'level:arena': { text: ARENA_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts' },\n    },\n    search: searchFrom(info, autoplay),\n    actionMap: SURGEON_MAP,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-49","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md","old_string":"14. Critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded.\n\nFourteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Four were not: 10–13.","new_string":"14. Critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded.\n15. Not critical. Attract wrote `trauma-compass:gfx.governor` because the page store was also passed to `createEngine`. The night is still saved by the page. The engine is given no store, so a demo changes nothing.\n\nFifteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Five were not: 10–13 and 15."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-50","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts","old_string":"    'Fourteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',","new_string":"    'Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-51","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"Fourteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\",","new_string":"    \"Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\","}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-52","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md","old_string":"- `createEngine` steps during warmup before the page can pause. A hub round has to `pause`, `seed`, `pause`, then `ready`, or the two copies do not both start at tick 0.","new_string":"- `createEngine` steps during warmup before the page can pause. A hub round has to `pause`, `seed`, `pause`, then `ready`, or the two copies do not both start at tick 0.\n- Giving `createEngine` the page store makes the quality governor write `gfx.governor` when a heavier scene starts. A hands-off demo then changes `localStorage`. The page keeps progress in its own store and does not pass that store in."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-53","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","old_string":"/** One result the verify command counts. */\nfunction report(name, ok, detail = '') {\n  if (!ok) failed += 1;\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({ name, ok, detail: String(detail).slice(0, 400) }));\n}","new_string":"/** One result the verify command counts. */\nfunction report(name, ok, detail = '') {\n  if (!ok) failed += 1;\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({ name, ok, detail: String(detail).slice(0, 400) }));\n}\n\n/** Keys whose stored text changed. Empty when the two snapshots match. */\nfunction storageDelta(before, after) {\n  if (before === after) return '';\n  let left;\n  let right;\n  try {\n    left = JSON.parse(before);\n    right = JSON.parse(after);\n  } catch {\n    return 'unparsed';\n  }\n  const keys = new Set([...Object.keys(left), ...Object.keys(right)]);\n  const changed = [];\n  for (const key of keys) if (left[key] !== right[key]) changed.push(key);\n  return changed.join(',') || 'order';\n}\n\n/** Run one page. A timeout is a failed check, and the later checks still run. */\nasync function block(name, fn) {\n  try {\n    await fn();\n  } catch (error) {\n    report(name, false, error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error));\n  }\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":652,"output_tokens":2246,"cache_read_input_tokens":77696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"df552a7f-2324-41b4-8526-3d4e3c837050"}
