ene has fourteen boxes. The test now stops when the briefing is up.\\n12. Not critical. Dev Mode reset wrote the setting back and left the on-screen slider on the dragged number, because the shell caches the value. Reset now writes the fallback into that cache.\\n13. Not critical. Scrub In treated a new pad's Cross as Start as well as claim, so the seat list closed on the joining press. A seat that was not claimed yet claims and stays on the screen.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-50","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    'Fourteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_string\":\"    'Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    'Fourteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"old_line\":37,\"new_string\":\"    'Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_line\":37,\"context_before\":\"    usage: 'added on import',\\n  },\\n  testingFeedback: [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    'Ten were game-breaking: a restore stepped the wrong body, the gala flap never finished, Reverie left the surface early, Solace children stacked, the syringe bound the wrong target, stitches landed off the wound, co-op copies shared one point, an outline width the engine rejects, a sound id the engine already owns, and a look and a song that used fields the engine does not have.',\\n    'The most helpful tests were the bot, which had to win every required case and seed, and the content walk that plays the whole shift to the credits.',\\n    'The least helpful was the voice-key equality check. It only shows that one line keeps the same syllable list. The starter gem tests had to stay green and do not cover an operation.',\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-51","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Fourteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Fourteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"Ten were game-breaking: a restore stepped the wrong body, the gala flap never finished, Reverie left the surface early, Solace children stacked, the syringe bound the wrong target, stitches landed off the wound, co-op copies shared one point, an outline width the engine rejects, a sound id the engine already owns, and a look and a song that used fields the engine does not have.\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful tests were the bot, which had to win every required case and seed, and the content walk that plays the whole shift to the credits.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful was the voice-key equality check. It only shows that one line keeps the same syllable list. The starter gem tests had to stay green and do not cover an operation.\\\"\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-52","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- `createEngine` steps during warmup before the page can pause. A hub round has to `pause`, `seed`, `pause`, then `ready`, or the two copies do not both start at tick 0.\",\"new_string\":\"- `createEngine` steps during warmup before the page can pause. A hub round has to `pause`, `seed`, `pause`, then `ready`, or the two copies do not both start at tick 0.\\n- Giving `createEngine` the page store makes the quality governor write `gfx.governor` when a heavier scene starts. A hands-off demo then changes `localStorage`. The page keeps progress in its own store and does not pass that store in.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- `createEngine` steps during warmup before the page can pause. A hub round has to `pause`, `seed`, `pause`, then `ready`, or the two copies do not both start at tick 0.\",\"old_line\":19,\"new_string\":\"- `createEngine` steps during warmup before the page can pause. A hub round has to `pause`, `seed`, `pause`, then `ready`, or the two copies do not both start at tick 0.\\n- Giving `createEngine` the page store makes the quality governor write `gfx.governor` when a heavier scene starts. A hands-off demo then changes `localStorage`. The page keeps progress in its own store and does not pass that store in.\",\"new_line\":19,\"context_before\":\"- Preset ids are global. `defineSfx('sfx:laser')` and `defineEmitter` of `emitter:rain` fail with `CORE_DUPLICATE_ID` because the engine already registered those. `song:title` is taken the same way. The game prefixes its own ids.\\n- `SongSpec` has no `description`. Passing one throws when the song is defined. `speedlines` takes `density`, not `strength`.\\n- Boolean settings accept `1` and `0` as well as `true` and `false`. `?game.autoplay=1` is a real setting. Stripping unknown keys is still required; `aihub*` keys are not engine settings.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n## Local engine patches\\n\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-de92e80d-29af-4287-a2e1-0d0e40759486-53","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"/** One result the verify command counts. */\\nfunction report(name, ok, detail = '') {\\n  if (!ok) failed += 1;\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({ name, ok, detail: String(detail).slice(0, 400) }));\\n}\",\"new_string\":\"/** One result the verify command counts. */\\nfunction report(name, ok, detail = '') {\\n  if (!ok) failed += 1;\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({ name, ok, detail: String(detail).slice(0, 400) }));\\n}\\n\\n/** Keys whose stored text changed. Empty when the two snapshots match. */\\nfunction storageDelta(before, after) {\\n  if (before === after) return '';\\n  let left;\\n  let right;\\n  try {\\n    left = JSON.parse(before);\\n    right = JSON.parse(after);\\n  } catch {\\n    return 'unparsed';\\n  }\\n  const keys = new Set([...Object.keys(left), ...Object.keys(right)]);\\n  const changed = [];\\n  for (const key of keys) if (left[key] !== right[key]) changed.push(key);\\n  return changed.join(',') || 'order';\\n}\\n\\n/** Run one page. A timeout is a failed check, and the later checks still run. */\\nasync function block(name, fn) {\\n  try {\\n    await fn();\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    report(name, false, error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error));\\n  }\\n}\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"/** One result the verify command counts. */\\nfunction report(name, ok, detail = '') {\\n  if (!ok) failed += 1;\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({ name, ok, detail: String(detail).slice(0, 400) }));\\n}\",\"old_line\":24,\"new_string\":\"/** One result the verify command counts. */\\nfunction report(name, ok, detail = '') {\\n  if (!ok) failed += 1;\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({ name, ok, detail: String(detail).slice(0, 400) }));\\n}\\n\\n/** Keys whose stored text changed. Empty when the two snapshots match. */\\nfunction storageDelta(before, after) {\\n  if (before === after) return '';\\n  let left;\\n  let right;\\n  try {\\n    left = JSON.parse(before);\\n    right = JSON.parse(after);\\n  } catch {\\n    return 'unparsed';\\n  }\\n  const keys = new Set([...Object.keys(left), ...Object.keys(right)]);\\n  const changed = [];\\n  for (const key of keys) if (left[key] !== right[key]) changed.push(key);\\n  return changed.join(',') || 'order';\\n}\\n\\n/** Run one page. A timeout is a failed check, and the later checks still run. */\\nasync function block(name, fn) {\\n  try {\\n    await fn();\\n  } catch (error) {\\n    report(name, false, error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error));\\n  }\\n}\",\"new_line\":24,\"context_before\":\"];\\nlet failed = 0;\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n/** Launch flags for the software WebGPU adapter. */\\nfunction launch() {\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"92d46fe7-daa4-425c-9149-a28e5c46ceb3"}
