mand\":\"[monitor] Watch e2e for a failure or exit\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"exit_code\":1,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T08:27:20Z\",\"ended\":\"2026-11-05T08:29:27Z\",\"duration_secs\":126.727076975,\"output\":\"\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151/terminal/monitor-call-5e680a16-fabf-4483-9f6b-5c5395d0e05b-90.log\",\"truncated\":true,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":104}],\"summary\":\"1/2 tasks completed (wait_all)\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"84f68d03-5180-437a-9544-f727389ddf18"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_515","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The mouse and dev block timed out waiting for the op screen.\n\nThe rest of the e2e suite continues while I diagnose the mouse and dev timeout. The 15-second wait for the op screen suggests the board loaded but the Enter loop failed to reach it.\n\nThe \"mouse and dev\" label indicates an exception was thrown, not a report failure. I'm tracing the 14-box story path to find why Enter never reached the op screen.\n\nThe 14-box path needs 16 Enter presses. I am checking why the 40 attempts with 80ms gaps still failed. Possible causes include Enter not registering as a uiAccept edge, the title screen not being focused after Back, autoText interference, or Enter being consumed by another action.\n\nI am checking whether the before-1 story actually has 14 boxes, since the content test allows 12 to 35. I am also considering that Enter might not fire uiAccept if the page lacks focus during the story loop.\n\nThe board and title screens loaded successfully, so the failure is isolated to the Enter loop. I am now investigating whether Playwright's rapid key presses register as distinct uiAccept edges in the game's per-frame sampling.\n\nThe root cause is likely frame timing. If WebGPU title rendering takes longer than 80 milliseconds, the engine samples input at the start of each frame. Rapid key presses can collapse into a single edge, so the Enter loop never registers enough uiAccept events to reach the op screen.\n\nI need to verify whether the engine samples keyboard state directly or queues keydown events. If it polls key state, rapid presses between frames are lost. If it uses an event queue, both keydown and keyup are recorded.\n\nThe campaign e2e is still running, so I will diagnose the timeout from code without launching another browser. I am now reading the engine's input key handling to verify whether it queues keydown events or polls keyboard state directly. The prior 21-press loop collapsed because presses were too rapid; adding 80ms gaps should prevent that, but if the failure persists, the story may be longer than 14 boxes, the Enter presses may not register at all, or focus may remain on the wrong element after Back.\n\nFocus is confirmed on New Shift after Back. Enter should trigger accept during story, and the engine consumes each uiAccept press exactly once. The failure is not caused by focus loss or duplicate key consumption.\n\nThe 40 Enter presses are not advancing the story. The modal state is active during the story screen, which may be blocking input or blanking intents. I am checking whether the engine's input.pressed implementation drops rapid key events.\n\nModal state does not block uiAccept, because a single Enter already reached the story screen. The failure is therefore not caused by modal blocking input.\n\nIf the engine coalesces rapid key presses into a single boolean edge, the 40 Enter attempts could collapse to roughly 8 valid presses. That would be insufficient for the 16 advances needed to reach the op screen.\n\nThe 80-millisecond gap is likely too short if frames take 30 to 100 milliseconds. I will rewrite the Enter loop to wait for an actual screen change after each press instead of pressing blindly.\n\nThe Enter loop will now wait for an actual state change after each press instead of pressing blindly. I will not rebuild or rerun the e2e suite while it is still running.\n\nEditing source files will not affect the running test process, so I will let it finish to catch other failures. I also need to restart a monitor that watches for process exit.\n\nI will add the stuck screen to the timeout report so future runs show exactly where they halted. I am also reading advanceStory and input.pressed to confirm the Enter loop fix.\n\nI suspect the Enter key press is hitting a focused button rather than the story screen. After clicking Back, the Back button may retain focus, so Playwright's keyboard.press('Enter') could fire a click on that button alongside uiAccept. This would double-advance or misdirect the input.\n\nThe Back button likely loses focus when the shell re-renders after returning to the title screen. If it remains focused, the browser synthesizes a click on that button alongside the Enter keypress, which would double-advance or misdirect the input.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dbd9443-81c1-4cc9-9162-5738ea565773-104","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/e2e-r3.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dbd9443-81c1-4cc9-9162-5738ea565773-105","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function pressed|pressed\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input","glob":"**/*.ts","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dbd9443-81c1-4cc9-9162-5738ea565773-106","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/story.ts","offset":30,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3dbd9443-81c1-4cc9-9162-5738ea565773-107","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts","offset":490,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1428,"output_tokens":2989,"cache_read_input_tokens":126336,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"9d0ba410-b38d-4f04-ba34-eda01b6670a5"}
