,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":9,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input/input.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":203,\"content\":\"      last = device;\"},{\"line_number\":232,\"content\":\"      last = device;\"},{\"line_number\":299,\"content\":\"      if (virtual.touched) last = 'virtual';\"},{\"line_number\":372,\"content\":\"      const device = last === 'gamepad' || last === 'mouse' ? last : 'keyboard';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input/devices/touch.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":192,\"content\":\"    if (e.pointerType === 'mouse') return void (last = pos);\"},{\"line_number\":193,\"content\":\"    last = pos;\"},{\"line_number\":223,\"content\":\"      last = pos;\"},{\"line_number\":226,\"content\":\"    last = pos;\"},{\"line_number\":247,\"content\":\"    last = at(e);\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"cc551940-91a2-4255-8cec-195c7ba81023"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_519","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Taps are stored as a Set of codes. Multiple Enter keydowns between samples count as a single tap.\n\nA tap is consumed by the next sample, so presses must be separated by at least one frame. At 80 ms intervals, 40 presses over 3.2 seconds span roughly 16 to 32 frames if each frame takes 100–200 ms.\n\nAt 200 ms frames, 16 presses yield only 16 accepts in 3.2 seconds, which is borderline. At 250 ms frames, the count drops to about 12 and the story stalls. Waiting for the screen or box to change after each Enter guarantees one advance per press. The pad buttons use navigator.getGamepads rather than the engine's gamepad device.\n\nA 150 ms press and release can be missed if a frame occurs between samples. The button should be held until the screen or focus changes are observed. If the pad is completely ignored, no frame may have fired during the 500 ms window. The attract stick worked because waitForFunction waited for a frame to detect it.\n\nFixed timeouts in the menu test can miss frames. The pad stub may be invisible because addInitScript runs in a different realm, or Chrome's navigator.getGamepads is a prototype method that the init-script assignment cannot shadow.\n\nThe test did not crash, so `window.__pads` must exist and the init script assignment likely succeeded. This suggests `navigator.getGamepads` was shadowed or the pad stub was created.\n\nIf the init script assignment throws, `__pads` is never created. The game then falls back to native `getGamepads`, which returns empty or real pads and ignores the stub. This matches the observed behavior: the screen stays on title and gloves remain at zero. The attract test succeeded because it assigned both values in a single evaluate that did not throw.\n\nThe game calls navigator.getGamepads directly each frame, so it cannot be using a stale closure. addInitScript and evaluate both run in the main world, meaning window.__pads should be visible to the game. The source code confirms the engine reads navigator.getGamepads dynamically.\n\nThe engine polls getGamepads directly, so it should see the stub if the override is active. The pad object has the required fields: buttons[13].pressed is true and down() checks them correctly. Plain arrays for axes are sufficient.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b5432b0-1fa6-4936-b266-03e094bf3a4f-116","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"getGamepads","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1527,"output_tokens":1303,"cache_read_input_tokens":142336,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"c20780be-d28b-4735-a415-2678ef35a54d"}
