5. Not critical. Attract wrote `trauma-compass:gfx.governor` because the page store was also passed to `createEngine`. The night is still saved by the page. The engine is given no store, so a demo changes nothing.\\n16. Not critical. The use prompt kept the previous device, because the shell redrew only when the menu changed. The stamp now includes the prompt.\\n\\nSixteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Six were not: 10–13, 15, and 16.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"15. Not critical. Attract wrote `trauma-compass:gfx.governor` because the page store was also passed to `createEngine`. The night is still saved by the page. The engine is given no store, so a demo changes nothing.\\n\\nFifteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Five were not: 10–13 and 15.\",\"old_line\":19,\"new_string\":\"15. Not critical. Attract wrote `trauma-compass:gfx.governor` because the page store was also passed to `createEngine`. The night is still saved by the page. The engine is given no store, so a demo changes nothing.\\n16. Not critical. The use prompt kept the previous device, because the shell redrew only when the menu changed. The stamp now includes the prompt.\\n\\nSixteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Six were not: 10–13, 15, and 16.\",\"new_line\":19,\"context_before\":\"12. Not critical. Dev Mode reset wrote the setting back and left the on-screen slider on the dragged number, because the shell caches the value. Reset now writes the fallback into that cache.\\n13. Not critical. Scrub In treated a new pad's Cross as Start as well as claim, so the seat list closed on the joining press. A seat that was not claimed yet claims and stays on the screen.\\n14. Critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d02be1b9-a6c7-4175-882d-73390064a4f5-126","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    'Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_string\":\"    'Sixteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    'Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"old_line\":37,\"new_string\":\"    'Sixteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_line\":37,\"context_before\":\"    usage: 'added on import',\\n  },\\n  testingFeedback: [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    'Ten were game-breaking: a restore stepped the wrong body, the gala flap never finished, Reverie left the surface early, Solace children stacked, the syringe bound the wrong target, stitches landed off the wound, co-op copies shared one point, an outline width the engine rejects, a sound id the engine already owns, and a look and a song that used fields the engine does not have.',\\n    'The most helpful tests were the bot, which had to win every required case and seed, and the content walk that plays the whole shift to the credits.',\\n    'The least helpful was the voice-key equality check. It only shows that one line keeps the same syllable list. The starter gem tests had to stay green and do not cover an operation.',\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d02be1b9-a6c7-4175-882d-73390064a4f5-127","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Sixteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Fifteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Sixteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"u