{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_535","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed that showNeed runs in the head before #msg exists.\n\nThe initial call is a no-op. The deferred module throws on Firefox because !navigator.gpu, triggering the error handler to show the need message.\n\nThe bundled module still evaluates engine code at top level because Vite inlines everything into one file. A dynamic import thenable for the boot chunk also executes immediately when called.\n\nFirefox likely throws on top-level WebGPU access before the body element exists, so showNeed only appears once the error handler fires. WebKit may instead hang on Loading or leave the message blank depending on navigator.gpu.\n\nThe fix is to move the classic script to the end of the body after #msg, ensuring showNeed runs when the element exists without relying on an error.\n\nThe deferred module runs after body scripts, so placing the detection script at the end of the body ensures #msg exists before showNeed executes. The one-file builder must preserve this order, though Vite may move scripts during bundling.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d93f82a4-554c-4881-a189-302df9caa704-145","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/one-file.mts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d93f82a4-554c-4881-a189-302df9caa704-146","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function inlineBuild|script","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/tools/lib/oneFile.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1755,"output_tokens":788,"cache_read_input_tokens":166656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":n