{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_554","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Story walk works with blur.\n\nThe Reset button is outside the viewport on the balance tab. Playwright cannot click it. I will fix this by scrolling the dev menu into view or using keyboard navigation. The game should also make the dev screen scrollable.\n\nThe off-screen reset is a real layout bug. The 1280x720 viewport is TV-sized, and the balance tab's many sliders overflow the fixed-height shell. I need to check whether the shell or screen container actually scrolls.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-74561b5a-47b1-4459-a7f8-b8b95efe640c-173","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"overflow|shell|screen","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/index.html","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-74561b5a-47b1-4459-a7f8-b8b95efe640c-174","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function sliders|TUNE\\.length|export const TUNE","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1247,"output_tokens":518,"cache_read_input_tokens":193920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"657e1cac-f72a-43f6-bf5e-c339de7f63cc"}
