ere game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Seven were not: 10–13 and 15–17.\",\"new_string\":\"17. Not critical. The WebGPU sentence ran before `#msg` existed, so a browser that did not throw stayed on \\\"Loading…\\\". It is shown again on `DOMContentLoaded`, when the line is in the page.\\n18. Not critical. Balance reset sat past the bottom of a 720p screen and the page did not scroll, so a click could not reach it. The dev screen scrolls, and Reset is the first row.\\n\\nEighteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Eight were not: 10–13 and 15–18.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"17. Not critical. The WebGPU sentence ran before `#msg` existed, so a browser that did not throw stayed on \\\"Loading…\\\". It is shown again on `DOMContentLoaded`, when the line is in the page.\\n\\nSeventeen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Seven were not: 10–13 and 15–17.\",\"old_line\":21,\"new_string\":\"17. Not critical. The WebGPU sentence ran before `#msg` existed, so a browser that did not throw stayed on \\\"Loading…\\\". It is shown again on `DOMContentLoaded`, when the line is in the page.\\n18. Not critical. Balance reset sat past the bottom of a 720p screen and the page did not scroll, so a click could not reach it. The dev screen scrolls, and Reset is the first row.\\n\\nEighteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Eight were not: 10–13 and 15–18.\",\"new_line\":21,\"context_before\":\"14. Critical. `labs/game/view/looks.ts` and `labs/game/audio/library.ts`: speed lines took `strength` where the engine wants `density`, and a song carried `description`, which `SongSpec` does not have. Both threw while the module loaded.\\n15. Not critical. Attract wrote `trauma-compass:gfx.governor` because the page store was also passed to `createEngine`. The night is still saved by the page. The engine is given no store, so a demo changes nothing.\\n16. Not critical. The use prompt kept the previous device, because the shell redrew only when the menu changed. The stamp now includes the prompt.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c2bdf5ac-85cc-4b3c-b497-67912e8a36f6-181","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    'Seventeen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_string\":\"    'Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    'Seventeen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"old_line\":37,\"new_string\":\"    'Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_line\":37,\"context_before\":\"    usage: 'added on import',\\n  },\\n  testingFeedback: [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    'Ten were game-breaking: a restore stepped the wrong body, the gala flap never finished, Reverie left the surface early, Solace children stacked, the syringe bound the wrong target, stitches landed off the wound, co-op copies shared one point, an outline width the engine rejects, a sound id the engine already owns, and a look and a song that used fields the engine does not have.',\\n    'The most helpful tests were the bot, which had to win every required case and seed, and the content walk that plays the whole shift to the credits.',\\n    'The least helpful was the voice-key equality check. It only shows that one line keeps the same syllable list. The starter gem tests had to stay green and do not cover an operation.',\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c2bdf5ac-85cc-4b3c-b497-67912e8a36f6-182","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Seventeen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Seventeen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"old_line\":20,\"new_string\":\"    \\\"Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\",\"new_line\":20,\"context_before\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    \\\"Ten were game-breaking: a restore stepped the wrong body, the gala flap never finished, Reverie left the surface early, Solace children stacked, the syringe bound the wrong target, stitches landed off the wound, co-op copies shared one point, an outline width the engine rejects, a sound id the engine already owns, and a look and a song that used fields the engine does not have.\\\",\\n    \\\"The most helpful tests were the bot, which had to win every required case and seed, and the content walk that plays the whole shift to the credits.\\\",\\n    \\\"The least helpful was the voice-key equality check. It only shows that one line keeps the same syllable list. The starter gem tests had to stay green and do not cover an operation.\\\"\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c2bdf5ac-85cc-4b3c-b497-67912e8a36f6-183","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"  console.log(i, moved, place);\\n  if (!moved && !place.startsWith('op')) break;\\n}\",\"new_string\":\"  console.log(i, moved, place);\\n  if (!moved || place.startsWith('op')) break;\\n}\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/dev-probe.mjs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/dev-probe.mjs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion