e in Stillpoint and holds vitals in Second Pulse', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":146,\"content\":\"  it('starts a Consult when two gifts land inside a second', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":159,\"content\":\"  it('telegraphs a Lull before the numb patch', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":170,\"content\":\"  it('splits Solace, then lets the laser finish a third generation', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":184,\"content\":\"  it('surfaces Reverie under the laser and sinks it again', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":199,\"content\":\"  it('lacquers a wound beside a Balm cell and fades the film after the node dies', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":212,\"content\":\"  it('walks Mercy from motes to the exposed binders', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":228,\"content\":\"  it('scales the clock and the slip cap with difficulty', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":238,\"content\":\"  it('clamps a slider and puts it back on reset', () => {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/content.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"describe('content', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"  it('accepts every case and every scene', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"  it('gives every scene between 12 and 35 boxes', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":27,\"content\":\"  it('barks the same line the same way', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"  it('covers every tool and kind', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":38,\"content\":\"  it('walks the story to credits', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":48,\"content\":\"  it('keeps four peers on one hash through loss and a leaver', () => {\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1288b2fa-42f2-4849-8a32-66a329d113a2-18","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,1