{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_574","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Reviewing the harness requirements.\n\nThe harness must run in shared-world mode with session 1 and 1–4 players. Every copy says hello and seats cover the player count. Ready fires automatically once loaded. Card capability is enabled so answers are submitted. The round starts when the card ends. Random is seeded. A host leaving voids the round. Otherwise it ends with status played. All copies receive the end signal.\n\nThe harness must avoid errors, dialogs, popups, and sockets. It dispatches Enter on the document to trigger Ready. The engine listens on window for keydown events. Bubbling should reach it, but isTyping or an untrusted event may block it.\n\nThe synthetic Enter event is untrusted. The engine may require isTrusted to accept it as uiAccept. I will check keyboard.ts for this filter. If it blocks untrusted events, I need a different path.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1901e318-420e-4562-8778-bb06028d905d-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"isTrusted|keydown|addEventListener","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/input/devices/keyboard.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1901e318-420e-4562-8778-bb06028d905d-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"SELF_REPORTED|seedsRandom|shared-world|progress","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/hub/harness.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3538,"output_tokens":710,"cache_read_input_tokens":68096,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"a93af60e-14f5-4cab-b140-d544bf64