{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_576","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Noted that shared-world is not self-reported.\n\nThe harness checks bidirectional traffic, host voiding on leave, and clean round endings. For shared-world, the host must call finish() with standings when time-up occurs. The payload shape is correct. Potential issues are being reviewed.\n\nEnter key events bubble from focused buttons to the window. The engine receives them as uiAccept and menus() answers ready. The harness waits three seconds for this response after pokes. Software WebGPU frames are slow, so warmup may delay the first frame.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-baa47cd4-7b9e-4e85-bd13-858e8c357ca9-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"game.run|gala-shift|session","glob":"**/*.{ts,tsx}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-baa47cd4-7b9e-4e85-bd13-858e8c357ca9-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/main.ts","limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1494,"output_tokens":945,"cache_read_input_tokens":73088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"aec580f9-0941-4945-acf7-0e2e699e3749"}
