{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_584","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The end-to-end test has been running for three minutes and has passed the audio stage.\n\nMultiple renderers indicate touch and glyphs are active. Campaign autoplay is next and will take most of the remaining time. Progress is healthy.\n\nNo new browser should be launched. Launch and evidence capture scripts can be prepared but left idle. The log shows 14 lines, suggesting Node.js stdout is flushing despite shell redirection.\n\nStarting the hub would overlap browsers and risk earlyoom, so I will wait. I will write launch.mjs in scratch for later use, review exit-interview.json against TASK questions, and check ENGINE-FEEDBACK and TESTING-LOG consistency.\n\nSheet density and radial slow deviations need verification against the text. Goal plan checkboxes must stay unmarked until confirmed. The exit interview, TESTING-LOG footer, and interview.ts will be cross-checked for consistency; a rebuild may be needed after the end-to-end test if they diverge from the shipped HTML. Simulation tests should log required assertions for capture, but bot tests are CPU-heavy and could slow campaign frames, so they will be prepared without execution during the run.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4377f054-0fb1-4cc1-a513-d26d83f773d3-44","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__engine","glob":"**/*.{ts,js}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/app","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4377f054-0fb1-4cc1-a513-d26d83f773d3-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4377f054-0fb1-4cc1-a513-d26d83f773d3-46","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4468,"output_tokens":883,"cache_read_input_tokens":86656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"ef169e15-6176-4e89-bbec-27163aec4d03"}
