{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_589","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"touchHold starts as true. pointerdown sets it to false.\n\nThe pointerdown listener sets touchHold to false before the settings button click completes. This may remove the touch overlay and prevent the click from registering.\n\nOn the attract screen, pointerdown triggers noteInput and exits attract. The settings button is destroyed before the tap can register, so the test never reaches the settings screen.\n\nThe test passed on r4. The shell change likely broke it. CSS changes to .screen or .touch pointer-events may have affected the overlay.\n\nThe button might be destroyed by a shell redraw during pointerdown. The r4 log should reveal why the same code path passed before.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-68cf34da-940f-4187-af5d-e606ab6b65a1-54","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"touch|settings|Controller","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/e2e-r4.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-68cf34da-940f-4187-af5d-e606ab6b65a1-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/ui/shell.ts","offset":160,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-68cf34da-940f-4187-af5d-e606ab6b65a1-56","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.touch|pointer-events|data-act","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/index.html"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1709,"output_tokens":967,"cache_read_input_tokens":100992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e15