{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_590","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"r4 passed the same tap. Something changed.\n\nThe HTML was rebuilt after r4. The touch path now includes extra.prompt in shellStamp. On pointerdown, the screen switches from attract to title and the button innerHTML is replaced mid-tap. This behavior existed in r4 too if the prompt stamp was already present. The actual difference now is `.screen.can-scroll` and menu order.\n\nThe scroll class only affects dev screens, so it does not explain the attract failure. The HTML size increased by over a thousand bytes, suggesting more than expected was rebuilt. The tap likely fails because Playwright's click dispatches pointer events that trigger a shell redraw, detaching the button before the click can complete. Frame timing may have slowed enough to let the click finish before the redraw in r4.\n\nThe 30-second timeout is a waitForFunction failure, not a tap timeout. This means the tap event fired but the screen never changed to settings. The pointerdown on the window likely fires first and triggers the attract-to-title switch before the button click can complete.\n\nThe window listener fires during the bubble phase after pointerdown. It sets touchHold to false and noteInput, which switches the screen to title before the button click can complete. This explains why the tap never reaches settings.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fcd19c53-8702-496a-8d21-7438db04a08f-57","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","offset":240,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fcd19c53-8702-496a-8d21-7438db04a08f-58","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function noteInput|function accept|screen === 'attract'|settings","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/campaign.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2034,"output_tokens":792,"cache_read_input_tokens":102656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"aa725022-749f-450b-8dd9-5ef971b138d4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fcd19c53-8702-496a-8d21-7438db04a08f-57","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"240→    touch: touchOnly() && touchHold && !session,\\n    card: session?.card ?? null,\\n  });\\n\\n  const drawShell = (): void => {\\n    const next = shellStamp(campaign, extra());\\n    if (next === stamp) return;\\n    stamp = next;\\n    renderShell(shell, campaign, extra());\\n  };\\n250→\\n  const pick = (id: string): void => {\\n    if (session && (id === 'hub-ready' || id === 'hub-more')) {\\n      hub?.answer(id === 'hub-ready' ? 'ready' : 'more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session && id !== 'settings') return;\\n    noteInput(campaign);\\n    touchHold = false;\\n    const dev = DEV[id];\\n260→    act(campaign, id);\\n    if (id === 'reset') TUNE.forEach((row, index) => (sliderValues[index] = row.fallback));\\n    if (dev && page) dev(page);\\n    saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    stamp = '';\\n  };\\n\\n  shell.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target?.dataset.act) return;\\n270→    pick(target.dataset.act);\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('pointerover', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target) return;\\n    const rows = [...shell.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-game=\\\"row\\\"]')];\\n    const index = rows.indexOf(target);\\n    if (index >= 0) campaign.focus = index;\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('input', (event) => {\\n280→    const target = event.target as HTMLInputElement | null;\\n    const setting = target?.dataset.set;\\n    if (!setting || !page || session) return;\\n    const value = Number(target.value);\\n    page.set(setting, value);\\n    const index = TUNE.findIndex((row) => row.setting === setting);\\n    if (index >= 0) sliderValues[index] = value;\\n    const name = TUNE[index]?.label ?? setting;\\n    if (target.parentElement?.firstChild) target.parentElement.firstChild.textContent = `${name} ${value}`;\\n  });\",\"content_concise\":\"240→    touch: touchOnly() && touchHold && !session,\\n    card: session?.card ?? null,\\n  });\\n\\n  const drawShell = (): void => {\\n    const next = shellStamp(campaign, extra());\\n    if (next === stamp) return;\\n    stamp = next;\\n    renderShell(shell, campaign, extra());\\n  };\\n250→\\n  const pick = (id: string): void => {\\n    if (session && (id === 'hub-ready' || id === 'hub-more')) {\\n      hub?.answer(id === 'hub-ready' ? 'ready' : 'more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session && id !== 'settings') return;\\n    noteInput(campaign);\\n    touchHold = false;\\n    const dev = DEV[id];\\n260→    act(campaign, id);\\n    if (id === 'reset') TUNE.forEach((row, index) => (sliderValues[index] = row.fallback));\\n    if (dev && page) dev(page);\\n    saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    stamp = '';\\n  };\\n\\n  shell.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target?.dataset.act) return;\\n270→    pick(target.dataset.act);\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('pointerover', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target) return;\\n    const rows = [...shell.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-game=\\\"row\\\"]')];\\n    const index = rows.indexOf(target);\\n    if (index >= 0) campaign.focus = index;\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('input', (event) => {\\n280→    const target = event.target as HTMLInputElement | null;\\n    const setting = target?.dataset.set;\\n    if (!setting || !page || session) return;\\n    const value = Number(target.value);\\n    page.set(setting, value);\\n    const index = TUNE.findIndex((row) => row.setting === setting);\\n    if (index >= 0) sliderValues[index] = value;\\n    const name = TUNE[index]?.label ?? setting;\\n    if (target.parentElement?.firstChild) target.parentElement.firstChild.textContent = `${name} ${value}`;\\n  });\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts\",\"offset\":240,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    touch: touchOnly() && touchHold && !session,\\n    card: session?.card ?? null,\\n  });\\n\\n  const drawShell = (): void => {\\n    const next = shellStamp(campaign, extra());\\n    if (next === stamp) return;\\n    stamp = next;\\n    renderShell(shell, campaign, extra());\\n  };\\n\\n  const pick = (id: string): void => {\\n    if (session && (id === 'hub-ready' || id === 'hub-more')) {\\n      hub?.answer(id === 'hub-ready' ? 'ready' : 'more');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session && id !== 'settings') return;\\n    noteInput(campaign);\\n    touchHold = false;\\n    const dev = DEV[id];\\n    act(campaign, id);\\n    if (id === 'reset') TUNE.forEach((row, index) => (sliderValues[index] = row.fallback));\\n    if (dev && page) dev(page);\\n    saveProgress(store, campaign, !!session);\\n    stamp = '';\\n  };\\n\\n  shell.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target?.dataset.act) return;\\n    pick(target.dataset.act);\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('pointerover', (event) => {\\n    const target = (event.target as HTMLElement | null)?.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-act]');\\n    if (!target) return;\\n    const rows = [...shell.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-game=\\\"row\\\"]')];\\n    const index = rows.indexOf(target);\\n    if (index >= 0) campaign.focus = index;\\n  });\\n  shell.addEventListener('input', (event) => {\\n    const target = event.target as HTMLInputElement | null;\\n    const setting = target?.dataset.set;\\n    if (!setting || !page || session) return;\\n    const value = Number(target.value);\\n    page.set(setting, value);\\n    const index = TUNE.findIndex((row) => row.setting === setting);\\n    if (index >= 0) sliderValues[index] = value;\\n    const name = TUNE[index]?.label ?? setting;\\n    if (target.parentElement?.firstChild) target.parentElement.firstChild.textContent = `${name} ${value}`;\\n  });\\n\",\"total_lines\":563}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fcd19c53-8702-496a-8d21-7438db04a08f-58","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,56,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,111,109,112,97,115,115,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,101,110,116,101,114,45,83,101,99,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,47,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,97,112,112,47,99,97,109,112,97,105,103,110,46,116,115,10,49,57,58,32,32,124,32,39,115,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,39,10,57,57,58,99,111,110,115,116,32,77,69,78,85,83,58,32,114,101,97,100,111,110,108,121,32,83,99,114,101,101,110,91,93,32,61,32,91,39,116,105,116,108,101