{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_593","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Applying the boot.ts fix and updating the log and interview.\n\nWaiting for e2e tests to finish before rebuilding. Patching the pointerdown code to return early on data-act. Updating interview strings from \"Eighteen\" to \"Nineteen\".","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bc183f7b-e198-4101-b530-25ae7bfca90f-62","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","old_string":"  addEventListener('pointerdown', () => {\n    touchHold = false;\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') noteInput(campaign);\n  });","new_string":"  addEventListener('pointerdown', (event) => {\n    const node = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target : null;\n    // A control's click is still coming. Hiding the gate here replaces the button before that click lands.\n    if (node?.closest('[data-act], input, label.slider')) return;\n    touchHold = false;\n    if (campaign.screen === 'attract') noteInput(campaign);\n  });"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bc183f7b-e198-4101-b530-25ae7bfca90f-63","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md","old_string":"18. Not critical. Balance reset sat past the bottom of a 720p screen and the page did not scroll, so a click could not reach it. The dev screen scrolls, and Reset is the first row.\n\nEighteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Eight were not: 10–13 and 15–18.","new_string":"18. Not critical. Balance reset sat past the bottom of a 720p screen and the page did not scroll, so a click could not reach it. The dev screen scrolls, and Reset is the first row.\n19. Not critical. A tap on Settings in the touch gate also counted as a pointerdown, which hid the gate and left the kiosk. The shell then replaced the button before the click arrived, so Settings never opened. A pointerdown that starts on a control is left for that control.\n\nNineteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Nine were not: 10–13 and 15–19."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bc183f7b-e198-4101-b530-25ae7bfca90f-64","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts","old_string":"    'Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',","new_string":"    'Nineteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bc183f7b-e198-4101-b530-25ae7bfca90f-65","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json","old_string":"    \"Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\",","new_string":"    \"Nineteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\","}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4510,"output_tokens":1027,"cache_read_input_tokens":108800,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"1e4067d0-a4e2-45e9-8426-335f804dac5a"}
