enter-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"18. Not critical. Balance reset sat past the bottom of a 720p screen and the page did not scroll, so a click could not reach it. The dev screen scrolls, and Reset is the first row.\\n\\nEighteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Eight were not: 10–13 and 15–18.\",\"old_line\":22,\"new_string\":\"18. Not critical. Balance reset sat past the bottom of a 720p screen and the page did not scroll, so a click could not reach it. The dev screen scrolls, and Reset is the first row.\\n19. Not critical. A tap on Settings in the touch gate also counted as a pointerdown, which hid the gate and left the kiosk. The shell then replaced the button before the click arrived, so Settings never opened. A pointerdown that starts on a control is left for that control.\\n\\nNineteen issues. Ten were game-breaking: 1–9 and 14. Nine were not: 10–13 and 15–19.\",\"new_line\":22,\"context_before\":\"15. Not critical. Attract wrote `trauma-compass:gfx.governor` because the page store was also passed to `createEngine`. The night is still saved by the page. The engine is given no store, so a demo changes nothing.\\n16. Not critical. The use prompt kept the previous device, because the shell redrew only when the menu changed. The stamp now includes the prompt.\\n17. Not critical. The WebGPU sentence ran before `#msg` existed, so a browser that did not throw stayed on \\\"Loading…\\\". It is shown again on `DOMContentLoaded`, when the line is in the page.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bc183f7b-e198-4101-b530-25ae7bfca90f-64","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    'Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_string\":\"    'Nineteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    'Eighteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"old_line\":37,\"new_string\":\"    'Nineteen issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\",\"new_line\":37,\"context_before\":\"    usage: 'added on import',\\n  },\\n  testingFeedback: [\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    'Ten were game-breaking: a restore stepped the wrong body, the gala flap never finished, Reverie left the surface early, Solace children stacked, the syringe bound the wrong target, stitches landed off the wound, co-op copies shared one point, an outline width the engine rejects, a sound id the engine already owns, and a look and a song that used fields the engine does not have.',\\n    'The most helpful tests were the bot, which had to win every required case and seed, and the content walk that plays the whole shift to the credits.',\\n    'The least helpful was the voice-key equality check. It only shows that one line keeps the same syllable list. The starter gem tests had to stay green and do not cover an operation.',\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bc183f7b-e198-4101-b530-25ae7bfca90f-65","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    \\\"Ei