{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_624","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Running vitest with verbose reporter on the three files and logging the output.\n\nThe committed tests are what the verifier audits. The verbose reporter will be used so each test name appears as a line. op.test.ts will go to sim.log. Three sequential vitest commands will run in one shell, with a high timeout for the slow bot test.\n\nChecking if playThrough logs wins. ux and nowebgpu logs will be written first in the same shell command before vitest runs. Engine-lock and local patches must remain empty before verify. The test run will block for eight minutes, then background if the bot is slow.\n\nThe test run will block for ten minutes. The hub will start after the tests finish so CPU is free, or overlap them if they use different cores. Hub is GPU-bound and has 120-second timeouts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9933657b-a6ad-425b-bbc5-eb7f5c5d668c-108","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\"\nLOG=\"$SCRATCH/e2e-r6.log\"\npython3 - <<PY\nimport json\nlines=open(\"$LOG\").read().splitlines()\nrows=[]\nfor line in lines:\n    line=line.strip()\n    if not line.startswith(\"{\"):\n        continue\n    try:\n        obj=json.loads(line)\n    except Exception:\n        continue\n    rows.append(obj)\nux_names={\n \"attract exits on a click and saves nothing\",\n \"attract exits on a key\",\n \"attract exits on a stick\",\n \"prompts follow the last device\",\n \"Xbox glyphs are a setting\",\n \"dev slider and reset\",\n \"two pads claim seats and move\",\n \"music bus is quiet and a tone is audible\",\n \"touch asks for a controller\",\n \"no audio element\",\n}\nux=[r for r in rows if r.get(\"name\") in ux_names]\nweb=[r for r in rows if \"WebGPU\" in r.get(\"name\",\"\")]\nopen(\"$SCRATCH/ux.log\",\"w\").write(\"\\n\".join(json.dumps(r) for r in ux)+\"\\n\")\nopen(\"$SCRATCH/nowebgpu.log\",\"w\").write(\"\\n\".join(json.dumps(r) for r in web)+\"\\n\")\nprint(\"ux\", len(ux), \"web\", len(web), \"all_ok\", all(r.get(\"ok\") for r in rows if \"name\" in r))\nPY\nPKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\ncd \"$PKG\"\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nTMP=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\nexport TMPDIR=\"$TMP\"\nset -o pipefail\n./node_modules/.bin/vitest run labs/game/op/op.test.ts --reporter=verbose > \"$SCRATCH/sim.log\" 2>&1\necho SIM:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/sim.log\"\n./node_modules/.bin/vitest run labs/game/op/bot.test.ts --reporter=verbose > \"$SCRATCH/bot.log\" 2>&1\necho BOT:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/bot.log\"\n./node_modules/.bin/vitest run labs/game/op/content.test.ts --reporter=verbose > \"$SCRATCH/content.log\" 2>&1\necho CONTENT:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/content.log\"\nrm -rf \"$TMP\"\necho DONE\ntail -3 \"$SCRATCH/sim.log\" \"$SCRATCH/bot.log\" \"$SCRATCH/content.log\"","description":"Save UX evidence and run sim, bot, content tests","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1611,"output_tokens":1176,"cache_read_input_tokens":144384,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"b725583c-177f-447a-a65c-5277c18cbe91"}
