0953ba3c19a-121","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Trauma Compass\\n\\nSurgical simulation at Harbor Light General. The one-file page is `Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731.html` beside this note. The dev project is the folder of the same name.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Title chosen with a real RNG: Trauma Compass.\\n- Operation sim, bot, strains, campaign, and lockstep tests are green, including the bot on every required case and seed.\\n- The page boots from `file://` in Chromium with WebGPU. Session client is the first script and matches the vendor file. Usage reads `added on import`.\\n10→- Couch seats, dev sliders, attract, glyphs, and the hub metas are in the page.\\n- `exit-interview.json` matches the About cards. `labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md` has fourteen issues, ten of them game-breaking. `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` asks for a post-restore scene hook and a public way to rewrite a kept mesh. No engine files were patched.\\n\\n## Still running\\n\\n- Browser e2e against the one-file page, then the four AI Hub harness runs, then `npm run verify`.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n\\n- The sheet is 96 by 60, not 320 by 192. Four software-rendered copies of the denser grid were killed for memory.\\n20→- Radial slow is fixed at 0.6 in the sim. The view slider cannot be read from the operation, so it does not enter the hash.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Trauma Compass\\n\\nSurgical simulation at Harbor Light General. The one-file page is `Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731.html` beside this note. The dev project is the folder of the same name.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Title chosen with a real RNG: Trauma Compass.\\n- Operation sim, bot, strains, campaign, and lockstep tests are green, including the bot on every required case and seed.\\n- The page boots from `file://` in Chromium with WebGPU. Session client is the first script and matches the vendor file. Usage reads `added on import`.\\n10→- Couch seats, dev sliders, attract, glyphs, and the hub metas are in the page.\\n- `exit-interview.json` matches the About cards. `labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md` has fourteen issues, ten of them game-breaking. `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` asks for a post-restore scene hook and a public way to rewrite a kept mesh. No engine files were patched.\\n\\n## Still running\\n\\n- Browser e2e against the one-file page, then the four AI Hub harness runs, then `npm run verify`.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n\\n- The sheet is 96 by 60, not 320 by 192. Four software-rendered copies of the denser grid were killed for memory.\\n20→- Radial slow is fixed at 0.6 in the sim. The view slider cannot be read from the operation, so it does not enter the hash.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"# Trauma Compass\\n\\nSurgical simulation at Harbor Light General. The one-file page is `Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731.html` beside this note. The dev project is the folder of the same name.\\n\\n## Done\\n\\n- Title chosen with a real RNG: Trauma Compass.\\n- Operation sim, bot, strains, campaign, and lockstep tests are green, including the bot on every required case and seed.\\n- The page boots from `file://` in Chromium with WebGPU. Session client is the first script and matches the vendor file. Usage reads `added on import`.\\n- Couch seats, dev sliders, attract, glyphs, and the hub metas are in the page.\\n- `exit-interview.json` matches the About cards. `labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md` has fourteen issues, ten of them game-breaking. `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` asks for a post-restore scene hook and a public way to rewrite a kept mesh. No engine files were patched.\\n\\n## Still running\\n\\n- Browser e2e against the one-file page, then the four AI Hub harness runs, then `npm run verify`.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n\\n- The sheet is 96 by 60, not 320 by 192. Four software-rendered copies of the denser grid were killed for memory.\\n- Radial slow is fixed at 0.6 in the sim. The view slider cannot be read from the operation, so it does not enter the hash.\\n\",\"total_lines\":20}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"83909799-7ec2-4f93-86f2-e6e12328208f"}
