{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_637","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A race condition exists where the server exit event might fire after resolution. Rejecting a settled promise is ignored.\n\nRestarting the hub. Prettier and node --check are fine. The exit handler might reject after resolve is queued in the same tick, so event order matters.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a1a241b9-0093-480c-916c-d1717c2d0a2b-129","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"PKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\"\nLOG=\"$SCRATCH/hub.log\"\nERR=\"$SCRATCH/hub.err\"\n: > \"$LOG\"\n: > \"$ERR\"\nTMP=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\necho \"$TMP\" > \"$SCRATCH/hub.tmp\"\ncd \"$PKG\"\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=/home/micha/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium-1243/chrome-linux64/chrome\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport TMPDIR=\"$TMP\"\nexport PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1\necho \"START $(date -Is) tmp=$TMP\" >> \"$LOG\"\nnode labs/game/tools/hub.mjs >> \"$LOG\" 2>> \"$ERR\"\ncode=$?\necho \"EXIT:$code\" >> \"$LOG\"\nrm -rf \"$TMP\"\n# if the script left a server, it kills its own child; nothing else to stop\nexit $code","description":"Re-run the hub harness after the port fix","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1443,"output_tokens":636,"cache_read_input_tokens":159360,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"e0423929-3dd8-4804-8753-5919eaaf541c"}
