{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9049d90e-3a06-4d61-a720-96d934a29125-134","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"20→- Giving `createEngine` the page store makes the quality governor write `gfx.governor` when a heavier scene starts. A hands-off demo then changes `localStorage`. The page keeps progress in its own store and does not pass that store in.\\n\\n## Local engine patches\\n\\n<!--\\n`npm run check` accepts an edited engine file only when it is listed here, one line each, its path in backticks:\\n- `engine/path/to/file.ts`: why no workaround in the game would do, and what the engine should change instead.\\n-->\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"20→- Giving `createEngine` the page store makes the quality governor write `gfx.governor` when a heavier scene starts. A hands-off demo then changes `localStorage`. The page keeps progress in its own store and does not pass that store in.\\n\\n## Local engine patches\\n\\n<!--\\n`npm run check` accepts an edited engine file only when it is listed here, one line each, its path in backticks:\\n- `engine/path/to/file.ts`: why no workaround in the game would do, and what the engine should change instead.\\n-->\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md\",\"offset\":20,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"- Giving `createEngine` the page store makes the quality governor write `gfx.governor` when a heavier scene starts. A hands-off demo then changes `localStorage`. The page keeps progress in its own store and does not pass that store in.\\n\\n## Local engine patches\\n\\n<!--\\n`npm run check` accepts an edited engine file only when it is listed here, one line each, its path in backticks:\\n- `engine/path/to/file.ts`: why no workaround in the game would do, and what the engine should change instead.