{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_642","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The patches section contains only comments, not real patch paths.\n\nThe HTML comment in the patches section contains backtick paths. The checker might flag this as a real patch path.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The hub harness is running again. The first attempt never opened a browser: Python 3.14 prints the server port on stdout, and the harness was only reading stderr. It now accepts the port from either stream. Sim, bot, and content tests already passed: 18, 31, and 6. The page check before that passed every item, including the Settings tap, glyphs, the campaign, Firefox, and WebKit."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":295,"output_tokens":374,"cache_read_input_tokens":163200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"19f930cc-66fb-46cb-b1ab-77e6f25b754d"}
