{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_652","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The max-lines ESLint warning is a warning, not an error.\n\nThe file is 573 lines, under the 600-line cap. ESLint reported no issues for hub.mjs. The command exited with code 0 despite the max-lines warning. I will split the file only if the check fails on warnings.\n\nI will rebuild the HTML and start the hub. I will run node --check on hub.mjs after prettier. The audio mute call is safe because audio exists. I am tracing the ready() and card event flow to verify the harness timing.\n\nI spotted a real race condition. If software WebGPU initialization blocks the main thread during createEngine, keydown events from the harness will queue and process too late. The card check could fail if the 3-second window expires.\n\nWebGPU initialization likely yields to the event loop, so keydown events should process during warmup. The race condition is probably not a real issue.\n\nready() now fires before the engine warmup begins. The harness can answer the card while the GPU initializes in parallel. Earlier warmup took roughly 10–12 seconds, and the browser remained responsive enough for the test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d0825c7b-4ab8-47fc-9c11-665d223723ac-155","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"PKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\ncd \"$PKG\"\nnode --check labs/game/tools/hub.mjs\nTMP=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\nexport TMPDIR=\"$TMP\"\n./node_modules/.bin/tsx labs/game/tools/one-file.mts\ncode=$?\nrm -rf \"$TMP\"\npython3 - <<'PY'\nhtml=open(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731.html\",encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\nfor s in [\"Twenty issues\",\"hub.ready\",\"The card key can arrive\",\"added on import\"]:\n    print(s, html.find(s)>=0)\nprint(\"chars\", len(html))\nPY\nexit $code","description":"Rebuild the one-file page with early hub ready"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1845,"output_tokens":1054,"cache_read_input_tokens":184448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"e3e9a3f4-603c-4537-b05b-d8ebbe234be2"}
