{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_661","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding a send operation to the start handler.\n\nUpdating hub.mjs queries and pass checks for mismatches. Increasing the timeout. The send will fire immediately on the start event since the bridge only requires a welcome state.\n\nThe send timing is safe because the bridge sets its started flag before posting to the game. HTML needs rebuilding after the boot.ts change. The issue 20 text about GPU waiting may also need updating.\n\nThe new failure is caused by the simulation not being up during the short test play. The ping fix ensures the harness sees traffic immediately, and extending the play time lets finish() occur after the simulation starts. This is the same GPU warming bug, so issue 20 can be updated rather than creating a new issue. The test script's play duration is not a game bug.\n\nThe testing log line will be updated to mention the presence message. The interview summary and issue count will remain unchanged.\n\nThe mismatch report will show detail when the check fails, or list mismatches if the check passes but issues remain. The presence message is not a protocol issue. Standings are still valid even if time-up occurs before any operations finish. One extra line in boot.ts is acceptable. A 120-second play timeout could exhaust memory during a four-player run.\n\nThe play timeout will be set to 90 seconds, giving each player a 45-second wait. This should cover the engine warmup for four players and prevent a void no-result if finish is missed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-36cf68d4-ebf0-4e38-8cd2-3a37f69a4b51-169","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","old_string":"    hub.on('start', () => {\n      session.card = null;\n      session.playing = false;\n      stamp = '';\n    });","new_string":"    hub.on('start', () => {\n      session.card = null;\n      session.playing = false;\n      stamp = '';\n      // The field may still be warming. One presence message puts traffic on the table before the first tick.\n      hub.send({ t: 'here' }, { reliable: true });\n    });"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-36cf68d4-ebf0-4e38-8cd2-3a37f69a4b51-170","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/hub.mjs","old_string":"const runs = [\n  ['hub 2 players', 'players=2&auto=1&limit=25'],\n  ['hub 4 players lossy', 'players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&limit=25'],\n  ['hub host leaves', 'players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave&auto=1&limit=25'],\n  ['hub server copy', 'players=2&scenario=server&auto=1&limit=25'],\n];","new_string":"const runs = [\n  ['hub 2 players', 'players=2&auto=1&play=90'],\n  ['hub 4 players lossy', 'players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&play=90'],\n  ['hub host leaves', 'players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave&auto=1&play=90'],\n  ['hub server copy', 'players=2&scenario=server&auto=1&play=90'],\n];"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-36cf68d4-ebf0-4e38-8cd2-3a37f69a4b51-171","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/hub.mjs","old_string":"    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.dataset.complete === 'true', null, { timeout: 120000 });\n    ok = await page.evaluate(() => window.__hubCheck?.pass === true);\n  } catch {\n    ok = false;\n  }\n  const detail = ok\n    ? ''\n    : await page\n        .evaluate(() => {\n          const bad = (window.__hubCheck?.checks ?? [])\n            .filter((item) => !item.pass)\n            .map((item) => `${item.name}: ${item.detail}`);\n          return bad.join(' | ') || document.body.innerText;\n        })\n        .catch(() => errors.join(' | '));\n  report(name, ok, detail.slice(0, 400));","new_string":"    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.dataset.complete === 'true', null, { timeout: 180000 });\n    const read = await page.evaluate(() => {\n      const bad = (window.__hubCheck?.checks ?? [])\n        .filter((item) => !item.pass)\n        .map((item) => `${item.name}: ${item.detail}`);\n      const mismatches = [];\n      for (const frame of document.querySelectorAll('iframe')) {\n        const list = frame.contentWindow?.__compass?.mismatches;\n        if (Array.isArray(list)) mismatches.push(...list);\n      }\n      return { pass: window.__hubCheck?.pass === true, bad, mismatches };\n    });\n    ok = read.pass && read.mismatches.length === 0;\n    var detailText = ok ? '' : [...read.bad, read.mismatches.length ? `mismatches ${read.mismatches.join(';')}` : ''].filter(Boolean).join(' | ');\n  } catch {\n    ok = false;\n  }\n  const detail = ok ? '' : (detailText ?? errors.join(' | '));\n  report(name, ok, detail.slice(0, 400));"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1719,"output_tokens":2229,"cache_read_input_tokens":201344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"a8a06078-e274-4fd5-a44b-5a3cc21869c0"}
