{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_663","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking hub.mjs for a scope issue: `var detailText` is declared inside a try block but used outside it.\n\nVerifying hub.mjs syntax with node --check before rebuilding HTML. Tracing the game timing: play=90 means 46.5 seconds total, but four WebGPU contexts may need more than 12 seconds for warmup.\n\nThe presence message arrives at countdown start, roughly 4.5 seconds before the host-leave timeout, so traffic should already be nonzero when the host is removed.\n\nHowever, `startRound` only runs after `createEngine`, which may exceed 46 seconds with four software WebGPU contexts. If the finish test fails, I will increase `play` to 150.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95de9988-5d15-4e1d-ad66-2dab28f1afe2-3","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/hub.mjs","offset":50,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95de9988-5d15-4e1d-ad66-2dab28f1afe2-4","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/app/boot.ts","offset":300,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-95de9988-5d15-4e1d-ad66-2dab28f1afe2-5","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function startRound|time-up|timeUp|finish\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/net"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4392,"output_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":32128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba5