{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_674","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking earlyoom's memory and swap thresholds for killing browsers.\n\nEarlyoom thresholds are 6% memory and 90% swap. Available memory is roughly 50%, so no kill is imminent. Other WebGPU processes are small and likely starting up. The machine is busy with other agents launching browsers. I will not wait indefinitely; the overlap rule applies to my own work.\n\nLaunching the hub now. Four iframes and four WebGPU contexts should fit within available memory. If earlyoom kills the process, I will capture the log and retry once. The expected runtime is 90 to 180 seconds.\n\nThe hub command will run with an infinite timeout. A watcher script will poll the hub log every 15 to 30 seconds and report ACTION_REQUIRED on the first \"ok\":false, DONE on exit 0, or FAILED on exit 1. The hub command's PID will be logged.\n\nThe hub command will set PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE to ubuntu24.04-x64 and CHROMIUM_PATH to the cached Playwright binary. It will also create a temporary directory with mktemp because hub.mjs does not set TMPDIR itself, and the default workspace path is too long for Playwright.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e207e4bc-c74f-4605-9965-451d97e1f6a6-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub.mjs|START","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer","glob":"*.{sh,mjs,md,log}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e207e4bc-c74f-4605-9965-451d97e1f6a6-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/verify.mjs","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1234,"output_tokens":930,"cache_read_input_tokens":66304,"cache_creation_