{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_706","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hub passed all five tests. Now copying hub-r5.log to hub.log as evidence.\n\nNext I will run launch.mjs from a copy inside the package to generate launch-1 and launch-2. Then I will run npm run verify into verify.log, which covers check, vitest, replay, e2e, and hub.\n\nI will update PROGRESS.md and the goal plan deviations and checkboxes. I also need to align PROGRESS.md, exit-interview.json, About, and README with the actual outcomes. The evaluator requires these documents to match the real results. I will check the README for stale counts before launch. The monitor process has exited.\n\nThe launch script will be copied to `labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs` inside the package. It will run with a short `TMPDIR`, `CHROMIUM_PATH`, and a `PLAYWRIGHT` override. The script writes to an absolute scratch path, so the copy is deleted after execution. Node ESM resolution from that directory correctly locates the package's `node_modules`.\n\nTwo sequential launches will each wait up to 40 seconds for the engine. Total runtime is estimated at 60–90 seconds. I will check for other running webgpu browsers before starting to avoid earlyoom risk. The launch uses one Chromium instance, which is lighter than hub’s four iframes. I will monitor verify closely because it is the longest step. I will also update the task list to mark hub complete and verify in progress.\n\nI confirmed that hub.log should contain only the harness output, not the node sequencer content. I also need to verify that headless Chromium uses DPR 1 so the canvas width check passes. I will kill any lingering monitor process if it did not stop automatically.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9d95e61d-0e90-4f49-aa91-8842e3ae036d-83","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"hub","content":"hub: AI Hub harness passed (2p, 4p lossy, host-leave, server, no session)","status":"completed"},{"id":"verify","content":"verify: file:// launches, npm run verify, and hand-ins","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9d95e61d-0e90-4f49-aa91-8842e3ae036d-84","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\"\ncp \"$SCRATCH/hub-r5.log\" \"$SCRATCH/hub.log\"\nPKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\ncp \"$SCRATCH/launch.mjs\" \"$PKG/labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs\"\nTMP=\"$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\"\necho \"PID:$$ TMP:$TMP\"\n{\n  echo \"START $(date -Iseconds) tmp=$TMP\"\n  export TMPDIR=\"$TMP\"\n  export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\n  export CHROMIUM_PATH=/home/micha/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium-1243/chrome-linux64/chrome\n  cd \"$PKG\"\n  node labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs\n  status=$?\n  echo \"EXIT:$status\"\n  rm -rf \"$TMP\"\n  rm -f \"$PKG/labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs\"\n  exit $status\n} > \"$SCRATCH/launch.log\" 2>&1\necho WRAPPER_EXIT:$?","description":"Two sequential file:// launches into scratch","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9d95e61d-0e90-4f49-aa91-8842e3ae036d-85","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"fourteen|Nineteen|Twenty|issues","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/README.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":626,"output_tokens":1308,"cache_read_input_tokens":118528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"6271fce7-31b5-43fc-afd5-835734f4b6b5"}
