{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_720","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The end-to-end run took about 13 minutes.\n\nChrome CPU is near zero after 15 minutes. The page appears hung rather than animating. The GPU process may be a child of a zygote.\n\nThe campaign may still be running or stuck after its timeout. Low CPU is unexpected for a WebGPU game. I will check all Chrome descendants and renderer state. The browser process might be idle because the page closed but the process has not exited.\n\nI will read e2e.mjs to check the browser lifecycle. Chromium might stay open for Firefox checks. The 15-minute runtime could be the campaign timeout plus earlier checks. I will also verify whether the campaign block is last and if the game loop is paused.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b51a7f23-6e6e-448d-8f65-a438a22b104b-107","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","offset":400,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b51a7f23-6e6e-448d-8f65-a438a22b104b-108","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"echo \"=== descendants of e2e node ===\"\nps -eo pid,ppid,etime,pcpu,rss,cmd | awk 'BEGIN{ORS=\"\"} {pid=$1; ppid=$2; rec[pid]=ppid; line[pid]=$0} END{}'\n# walk\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport os\nroot=430469\nchildren={}\nfor pid in os.listdir('/proc'):\n    if not pid.isdigit(): continue\n    try:\n        data=open(f'/proc/{pid}/stat').read()\n    except: continue\n    # pid (comm) state ppid\n    rpar=data.rfind(')')\n    parts=data[rpar+2:].split()\n    ppid=int(parts[1])\n    children.setdefault(ppid, []).append(int(pid))\n\ndef walk(p, depth=0):\n    for c in children.get(p, []):\n        try:\n            cmd=open(f'/proc/{c}/cmdline','rb').read().replace(b'\\0',b' ').decode()[:160]\n            stat=open(f'/proc/{c}/stat').read()\n            rpar=stat.rfind(')')\n            parts=stat[rpar+2:].split()\n            utime=int(parts[11]); stime=int(parts[12])\n        except: \n            continue\n        print(f\"{'  '*depth}{c} cpuTicks={utime+stime} {cmd}\")\n        if depth<3:\n            walk(c, depth+1)\nwalk(root)\nPY","description":"See if the e2e browser is working or idle"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1740,"output_tokens":1014,"cache_read_input_tokens":133504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"f86eca28-625b-4ac2-bf84-f884221e776f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b51a7f23-6e6e-448d-8f65-a438a22b104b-107","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"400→    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.querySelector('.prompt')?.innerHTML.includes('M18 16'));\\n    const mouse = await page.locator('.prompt').innerHTML();\\n    await page.click('text=Settings');\\n    await page.keyboard.press('ArrowRight');\\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.innerText.includes('Glyphs'));\\n    await page.click('text=Glyphs');\\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.innerText.includes('Xbox'));\\n    const xbox = await page.locator('[data-game=\\\"menu\\\"]').innerText();\\n    report(\\n      'prompts follow the last device',\\n410→      keys.includes('Enter') && mouse.includes('M18 16'),\\n      `${keys.includes('Enter')} ${mouse.includes('M18 16')}`,\\n    );\\n    report('Xbox glyphs are a setting', xbox.includes('Xbox'), xbox);\\n  } finally {\\n    await page.close();\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nawait block('campaign', async () => {\\n420→  const page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\\n  try {\\n    watch(page);\\n    await page.goto(`${pageUrl}?game.autoplay=1`);\\n    let detail = '';\\n    let ok = false;\\n    try {\\n      await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass && window.__compass.screen === 'credits', null, {\\n        timeout: 660000,\\n      });\\n430→      ok = true;\\n    } catch {\\n      detail = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n        const op = window.__compass?.live?.();\\n        return JSON.stringify({\\n          screen: window.__compass?.screen,\\n          caseId: window.__compass?.campaign?.caseId,\\n          status: op?.status,\\n          tick: op?.tick,\\n          score: op?.score,\\n440→          fail: op?.fail,\\n        });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    report('campaign reaches the credits', ok, detail);\\n  } finally {\\n    await page.close();\\n  }\\n});\\n\\n450→await browser.close();\\n\\nconst py = `\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\nurl = ${JSON.stringify(pageUrl)}\\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\\n    for name, browser_type, kwargs in (\\n        ('firefox', p.firefox, {}),\\n        ('webkit', p.webkit, {'device_scale_factor': 3, 'viewport': {'width': 390, 'height': 844}, 'is_mobile': True, 'has_touch': True, 'user_agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 17_0 like Mac OS X)'}),\\n    ):\\n460→        browser = browser_type.launch(headless=True)\\n        page = browser.new_page(**kwargs) if name == 'webkit' else browser.new_page()\\n        page.goto(url, wait_until='load', timeout=90000)\\n        try:\\n            page.wait_for_function(\\\"() => (document.querySelector('#msg')?.innerText || '').includes('WebGPU')\\\", timeout=20000)\\n        except Exception:\\n            pass\\n        msg = page.locator('#msg').inner_text()\\n        print(name + '|' + msg.replace('\\\\\\\\n', ' '))\\n        browser.close()\\n470→`;\\nconst python = spawnSync('python3', ['-c', py], { encoding: 'utf8' });\\nconst lines = `${python.stdout}\\\\n${python.stderr}`;\\nfor (const name of ['firefox', 'webkit']) {\\n  const row = lines.split('\\\\n').find((line) => line.startsWith(`${name}|`)) ?? '';\\n  report(`${name} WebGPU message`, row.includes('This game needs a browser with WebGPU.'), row || lines.slice(0, 300));\\n}\\n\\nprocess.exit(failed ? 1 : 0);\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"400→    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.querySelector('.prompt')?.innerHTML.includes('M18 16'));\\n    const mouse = await page.locator('.prompt').innerHTML();\\n    await page.click('text=Settings');\\n    await page.keyboard.press('ArrowRight');\\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.innerText.includes('Glyphs'));\\n    await page.click('text=Glyphs');\\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => document.body.innerText.includes('Xbox'));\\n    const xbox = await page.locator('[data-game=\\\"menu\\\"]').innerText();\\n    report(\\n      'prompts follow the last device',\\n410→      keys.includes('Enter') && mouse.includes('M18 16'),\\n      `${keys.includes('Enter')} ${mouse.includes('M18 16')}`,\\n    );\\n    report('Xbox glyphs are a setting', xbox.includes('Xbox'), xbox);\\n  } finally {\\n    await page.close();\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nawait block('campaign', async () => {\\n420→  const page = await browser.newPage({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\\n  try {\\n    watch(page);\\n    await page.goto(`${pageUrl}?game.autoplay=1`);\\n    let detail = '';\\n    let ok = false;\\n    try {\\n      await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass && window.__compass.screen === 'credits', null, {\\n        timeout: 660000,\\n      });\\n430→      ok = true;\\n    } catch {\\n      detail = await page.evaluate(() => {\\n        const op = window.__compass?.live?.();\\n        return JSON.stringify({\\n          screen: window.__compass?.screen,\\n          caseId: window.__compass?.campaign?.caseId,\\n          status: op?.status,\\n          tick: op?.tick,\\n          score: op?.score,\\n440→          fail: op?.fail,\\n        });\\n      });\\n    }\\n    report('campaign reaches the credits', ok, detail);\\n  } finally {\\n    await page.close();\\n  }\\n});\\n\\n450→await browser.close();\\n\\nconst py = `\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\nurl = ${JSON.stringify(pageUrl)}\\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\\n    for name, browser_type, kwargs in (\\n        ('firefox', p.firefox, {}),\\n        ('webkit', p.webkit, {'device_scale_factor': 3, 'viewport': {'width': 390, 'height': 844}, 'is_mobile': True, 'has_touch': True, 'user_agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 17_0 like Mac OS X)'}),\\n    ):\\n460→        browser = browser_type.launch(headless=True)\\n        page = browser.new_page(**kwargs) if name == 'webkit' else browser.new_page()\\n        page.goto(url, wait_until='load', timeout=90000)\\n        try:\\n          