{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_722","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user-data directory is only 18 seconds old, not the expected 15-minute Chrome process.\n\nThe old Chrome process may have exited and been replaced by a new one. Playwright might have relaunched the browser after a page crash. Alternatively, verify could have moved from e2e to hub and launched fresh Chrome.\n\nThe new Chrome under the same temporary directory suggests verify launched hub.mjs as a replacement for e2e. Multiple renderers seven seconds old indicate the hub harness is starting.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2a5cc963-7d55-4c9b-a3ab-ec2e078a261d-110","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"ps --ppid 424982 -o pid,etime,cmd --no-headers | cut -c1-180\necho \"---\"\nps -p 430469 -o pid,etime,cmd --no-headers || echo e2e-gone\ndate -Iseconds","description":"See if verify has moved from e2e to hub"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1165,"output_tokens":500,"cache_read_input_tokens":137088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"7015a2bd-7f4b-4380-b89a-67811a4dc8aa"}
