n's dev actions: the scene's own, then the engine's (god, freeze, spawn, travel, timeScale).\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/dev/inspector.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" * recorded); `errors` and `advice` → the log; `pause`, `resume`, `step` and `timeScale` → the clock (steps recorded\"},{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"  timeScale(k?: number): number;\"},{\"line_number\":213,\"content\":\"  timeScale: {\"},{\"line_number\":217,\"content\":\"      if (k !== undefined) h.clock.timeScale = k;\"},{\"line_number\":218,\"content\":\"      return h.clock.timeScale;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/dev/members.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":121,\"content\":\"  /** The frame clock over the run's settings: `pause`, `resume`, `step` and `timeScale` go through it. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/sim/devActions.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\" * - `timeScale { scale }`: the setting `time.scale`, the frame clock's speed (engine/core/time.ts): a view setting,\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\" * listDevActions(registry).map((action) => action.id); // ['freeze', 'god', 'spawn', 'timeScale', 'travel']\"},{\"line_number\":107,\"content\":\"  const problems = NAME.test(entry.id) ? [] : [`the name ${show(entry.id)} must be a word in camelCase (timeScale)`];\"},{\"line_number\":204,\"content\":\"  timeScale: {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/app/headless.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":12,\"content\":\" * as a replay. `pause`, `resume` and `timeScale` set the clock's settings as in a page (no real time passes headless,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/core/time.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":162,\"content\":\"  timeScale: number;\"},{\"line_number\":184,\"content\":\"  /** Sim seconds per real second now: `timeScale` × the slowest slowdown, 0 while paused or in a hit-stop. */\"},{\"line_number\":187,\"content\":\"  timeScale: number;\"},{\"line_number\":289,\"content\":\"    get timeScale() {\"},{\"line_number\":292,\"content\":\"    set timeScale(k) {\"},{\"line_number\":352,\"content\":\"      timeScale: get('time.scale'),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"c42fa785-571d-468e-ac8c-423c36267ee1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_727","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"timeScale is a clock multiplier rather than a direct step count per frame.\n\nThe operation only speeds up if the scene advances it by dt * timeScale. If the scene steps it once per frame regardless of dt, timeScale only affects animations.\n\nThe 11-minute runtime means roughly one tick per second. Seven cases finished and the current operation reached mercy tick 594 within 660 seconds. That is good progress. The timeout was only slightly short under load. r6 completed the entire campaign.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3b227632-7ac3-4be9-a818-e66d4a258aaa-118","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"stepOp|timeScale|frame\\.dt","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3038,"output_tokens":460,"cache_read_input_tokens":144000,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"14205558-127e-4926-858d-fcbf387c4f99"}
