{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_730","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`time.maxSteps` caps the number of steps per frame.\n\nAt timeScale 8, a slow frame still yields only about 8–10 simulation ticks per second. The mercy case’s 594 ticks likely reflect a brief window.\n\nThe simulation is running at a reasonable pace. Mercy is the longest boss and the 660-second campaign timeout was exceeded. The previous success took about 13 minutes, but this run reached roughly 15 minutes before mercy still did not finish. The end-to-end timeout should be raised to 900000 or 1200000 milliseconds.\n\nEarlier runs finished inside the 660-second budget, but this one did not. The load difference caused the timeout. Raising `time.maxSteps` during autoplay could let slow frames catch up, though it risks render stalls.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-04cbd283-dabf-4ea4-9f7d-001806890e3b-124","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"maxSteps","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine","glob":"*.ts","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1621,"output_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":151936,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"056fe0db-98e4-4838-a274-230b1b719dfd"}
