{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_749","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The first verification run failed only on ASSET_DATA_URI for hub-serve. The engine check passed.\n\nThe second verify run failed tsc, eslint, and prettier. The first verify passed those checks. The first run started before maxSteps was added.\n\nThe second check's tsc failure is TS5097 in one-file.mts. That file was not changed this session. It was only in the prettier fail list. The first check may not have actually passed tsc.\n\nThe first verify's output was truncated to the last six lines. Those lines only showed the ASSET_DATA_URI failure, so tsc, eslint, and prettier failures in that run were hidden.\n\nThe second run's output confirms tsc, eslint, and prettier all failed. The tsc error in one-file.mts comes from an import that uses a `.ts` extension. That file was written earlier for tsx but is rejected by `tsc -b`. The import needs to be fixed.\n\nThe `.ts` extension in one-file.mts can be dropped if tsx and tsc both resolve the module without it. The other files in tools/lib should reveal the correct import pattern.\n\nTwo eslint errors remain: labs/game/tools/hub/bridge.js and labs/game/tools/hub/round.js are missing the `@file` header.\n\nvendor/session.js cannot be edited because it must remain unmodified. It is missing the `@file` header and contains an unused catch variable. The hub harness files are copies of the hub code. Both session.js and the hub files need to be added to eslint ignore rules.\n\nPrettier wants to reformat twenty game files including session.js, bridge.js, round.js, and harness.html. The source files should be cleaned with prettier --write. Session.js must stay byte-identical to the vendor copy and cannot be reformatted.\n\nThe first verify likely never passed tsc; the truncated output simply hid those failures. The plan is to add vendor/session.js, the hub harness files, and harness.html to both eslint and prettier ignore rules, fix the .ts import in one-file.mts, and run prettier --write only on our own source files. I will check the existing eslint config, prettierignore, and tsconfig for current ignore patterns.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a072c54-8b27-4c94-87c0-f8d0de4d677e-151","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ignore|session.js|labs/game","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731","glob":"*.{json,mjs,cjs,js,yml}","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a072c54-8b27-4c94-87c0-f8d0de4d677e-152","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/one-file.mts","limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7a072c54-8b27-4c94-87c0-f8d0de4d677e-153","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"one-file|labs/game","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/tsconfig.check.json"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3137,"output_tokens":1620,"cache_read_input_tokens":168960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"ad048e6f-ad32-4252-9f6d-c2541fe3bc33"}
