{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_756","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Prettier rewrites the session script inside index.html with different indentation.\n\nPrettier would break the test by modifying the client. I will keep index.html unprettied to avoid changing vendor/session.js. I need a way to skip this file without editing .prettierignore.\n\nPrettier cannot skip index.html without a .prettierignore line. The engine's .prettierignore is locked. Patching it violates the unmodified source rule. Moving the inline script to an external file would let Prettier only change quotes.\n\nThe session script must remain inline in index.html. Prettier will still reformat it. The protocol requires the client to be unmodified. I need to skip both index.html and vendor/session.js from Prettier and ESLint.\n\nPrettier's `prettier-ignore` comments could skip the inline script without engine changes. The checkAll command cannot pass a custom ignore path.\n\nI will try `<!-- prettier-ignore -->` before the inline script. Prettier may still reformat the rest of the HTML, so I need to check whether only the script changed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7e2a26cc-c682-4785-8318-51d3b6d315a6-168","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/index.html","limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1619,"output_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":188416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"24ca2a9f-2706-4403-98d7-4f59238691fb"}
