{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_768","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand max-lines counting.\n\nESLint max-lines counts physical lines by default. The config allows 600 lines, so blank lines and comments count. round.js is currently 603 lines. Collapsing the getters into one-liners should bring it under the limit.\n\nThe four one-line getters save twelve lines. Prettier printWidth is 120, so the collapsed getters fit comfortably. The later() call can also be unwrapped to save more space.\n\nPrettier will collapse the later() calls since they fit within the 120-character width. I will run prettier --check after collapsing both the getters and the function calls. The file is already 603 lines after prettier formatting, so the formatter is enforcing those wraps.\n\nChecking whether a trailing newline pushes the file to 603 lines while the actual content is only 602. Also verifying if ESLint counts the final empty line under max-lines.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff5a6673-69dc-4b66-9f3f-3a54e78522e4-8","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"printWidth|prettier","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731","glob":"*.{json,js,mjs,cjs,yml}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff5a6673-69dc-4b66-9f3f-3a54e78522e4-9","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts","offset":380,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff5a6673-69dc-4b66-9f3f-3a54e78522e4-10","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/cases.ts","offset