tent\":\"## Still running\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"    \\\"Twenty issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":741,\"content\":\"**One command: `npm run verify`** (`labs/game/tools/verify.mjs`; add it with `npm pkg set scripts.verify=\\\"node labs/game/tools/verify.mjs\\\"`). It prints only failures and one final line (`verify: 212 passed, 0 failed`). Rerun it only after changing the code it covers; `--fast` skips browsers. Use one or two browsers at a time. No subagents or workflows to debate, review, judge or audit. Make it the first thing you write, from this skeleton.\"},{\"line_number\":743,\"content\":\"Tested on the starter, under the run's real long `TMPDIR`, with no setup: `verify: 8 passed, 0 failed` in 28 s (14 s with `--fast`). With a broken test, a lint error and a failing browser check, it printed exactly those three `FAIL` lines and `verify: 9 passed, 3 failed`, and exited 1. It passes `npm run check` itself. For a lint failure it prints the summary; run `npm run check` for the details.\"},{\"line_number\":810,\"content\":\"console.log(`verify: ${passed} passed, ${failed.length} failed`);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/engine/anim/proc/reach.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"  /** Steps across the window (10: eleven moments). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/scenes/room.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"/** Twenty by nine metres inside a wall, the surgeon's mark near the middle. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/codec.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\"/** One seat's hands as eleven numbers. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/data/interview.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":37,\"content\":\"    'Twenty issues were caught and written in labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/box/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"| `box:ragdoll` (`labs/box/scenes/ragdoll.ts`) | Ragdolls (WP 10.2): the room as a physics level, the hero at its spawn and four sparring partners on `build:adult` across its south half, each where it falls on open floor in view, facing him. Every 8 s a blow lands on each in turn: the first from the front (it falls onto its back), the second from behind (onto its face), the third a launch, up and to the south-east, the fourth a killing one; each falls as a ragdoll (engine/sim/ragdolls.ts: eleven capsules held by balls with a body's limits and hinges at the elbows and knees, faded onto the puppet) and gets up the way it lies once its trunk lies still, the dead one when the cycle stands it up at 6 s; at each cycle's start a partner standing is put back on its spot. His attack (J) knocks down the partner nearest in front of him, within 2.5 m. | `labs/box/scenes/ragdoll.test.ts`, `tests/replays/ragdoll-falls.replay.json`, `tests/replays/ragdoll-strike.replay.json`, `engine/sim/ragdolls.tes [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\"11. Not critical. `labs/game/app/campaign.test.ts`: a fixed run of accepts walked past the first briefing, because that scene has fourteen boxes. The test now stops when the briefing is up.\"},{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"Twenty issues. Eleven were game-breaking: 1–9, 14, and 20. Nine were not: 10–13 and 15–19.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-663f5f24-df13-402d-8f6b-2432624e4842-56","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→START 2026-11-05T02:48:28-07:00 tmp=/tmp/g.QBXUdu wrapper=408196\\n(node:408202) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub 2 players\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub 4 players lossy\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub host leaves\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub server copy\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"game with no session\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\nEXIT:0\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→START 2026-11-05T02:48:28-07:00 tmp=/tmp/g.QBXUdu wrapper=408196\\n(node:408202) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub 2 players\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub 4 players lossy\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub host leaves\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hub server copy\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"detail\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n{\\\"name\\\":\\\"game with no session\\\",\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"deta