{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_803","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll copy the script into the package tools folder as a temporary file, run it, and delete it.\n\nThe script would fail the check if left in labs/game because eslint includes it. I'll place it in scratch and run it with a small wrapper inside the package.\n\nNode ESM resolves bare imports relative to the imported module's own location, so a wrapper inside the package won't fix the path. I'll copy launch.mjs directly into labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs instead. I'll delete it immediately after execution, even if the run fails.\n\nI'll use a temporary directory and run the script from inside the package. The script writes launch-1/ and launch-2/ itself, so I don't need to do that manually.\n\nI'll set the block timeout to 180 seconds. I'll wait for launch to finish before marking step 5 complete. If it fails, I'll fix and retry. I'll also verify interview.ts matches exit-interview and clean up any leftover /tmp/g directories.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c31cd68c-8c1b-44b3-8723-9acbc118c84a-86","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\nPKG=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\ncp \"$SCRATCH/launch.mjs\" \"$PKG/labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs\"\ntd=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\necho \"TMP=$td\" > \"$SCRATCH/launch-tmp.txt\"\ncd \"$PKG\"\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=/home/micha/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium-1243/chrome-linux64/chrome\nexport TMPDIR=\"$td\"\nset +e\nnode labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs > \"$SCRATCH/launch.log\" 2>&1\nec=$?\nset -e\necho EXIT:$ec >> \"$SCRATCH/launch.log\"\nrm -f \"$PKG/labs/game/too