{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_805","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Launch succeeded. Verifying launch.log contains both ok true and launch-once.\n\nState files exist. I will write PROGRESS, check the final box, clean up leftover processes and temporary files, confirm the interview match, and draft the four feedback blocks. I will also delete launch-tmp.txt and read launch.log for accurate quotes.\n\nI will diff interview.ts against exit-interview to confirm they match. I am checking that hub-serve and launch-once are fully gone, and scanning for any remaining processes in our working directory. The PROGRESS file will be written as a finished game summary with the title Trauma Compass, twenty issues, eleven game-breaking, deviations at 96x60 and radial 0.6, both launches passing on current HTML, and ninety-three verify passes. I will copy the four feedback blocks from interview.ts into the chat reply.\n\nData-about usage is confirmed in the rebuilt HTML. I will leave verify.pid as scratch and avoid deleting other agents' /tmp/g.* files. The README prettier status is fine. I am writing PROGRESS.md now.\n\nThe exit-interview test passed earlier and remains unchanged. The shots folder is evidence-only, so I will skip generating screenshots unless required. I will read launch.log first to ensure accuracy before writing PROGRESS.md.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37d3f872-69c5-4ae3-8dcd-d4cdfc4dee88-88","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/launch.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-37d3f872-69c5-4ae3-8dcd-d4cdfc4dee88-89","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"PKG=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\nSCRATCH=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\necho \"launch-once $(test -e \"$PKG/labs/game/tools/launch-once.mjs\" && echo PRESENT || echo gone)\"\necho \"hub-serve $(test -d \"$PKG/labs/game/tools/hub-serve\" && echo PRESENT || echo gone)\"\npython3 - << PY\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot = Path(\"$PKG\").resolve()\nhits = []\nfor p in Path(\"/proc\").iterdir():\n    if not p.name.isdigit():\n        continue\n    try:\n        cwd = Path(os.readlink(p/\"cwd\")).resolve()\n        cmd = (p/\"cmdline\").read_bytes().replace(b\"\\0\", b\" \").decode()[:180]\n    except OSError:\n        continue\n    if cwd == root or str(root) in cmd:\n        if any(s in cmd for s in (\"chrome\", \"verify\", \"http.server\", \"launch-once\", \"hub.mjs\", \"e2e\")):\n            hits.append(f\"{p.name} {cmd}\")\nprint(\"PROCS\", len(hits))\nfor h in hits:\n    print(h)\nPY\n# our tmp from launch-tmp.txt\nif [ -f \"$SCRATCH/launch-tmp.txt\" ]; then cat \"$SCRATCH/launch-tmp.txt\"; rm -f \"$SCRATCH/launch-tmp.txt\"; fi\nls \"$SCRATCH/launch-1/state.json\" \"$SCRATCH/launch-2/state.json\"\npython3 - << 'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\na = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/exit-interview.json\").read_text()\n# interview.ts is TS not JSON; compare by extracting the object is harder. Just confirm usage and Twenty.\ndata = json.loads(a)\nassert data[\"sourceInformation\"][\"usage\"] == \"added on import\"\nassert data[\"testingFeedback\"][0].startswith(\"Twenty issues\")\nassert \"Eleven were game-breaking\" in data[\"testingFeedback\"][1]\nprint(\"interview json ok\", data[\"aiHub\"][\"name\"], data[\"aiHub\"][\"players\"])\nPY","description":"Confirm launches, cleanup, and interview JSON"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":763,"output_tokens":1321,"cache_read_input_tokens":128384,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool