9,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,47,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,111,112,47,99,97,115,101,115,76,97,116,101,46,116,115,10,53,53,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,123,32,107,105,110,100,58,32,39,102,108,97,112,39,44,32,120,58,32,45,48,46,50,44,32,122,58,32,48,46,49,44,32,116,97,103,58,32,39,104,101,97,114,116,39,32,125,44,10,53,54,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,123,32,107,105,110,100,58,32,39,114,101,118,101,114,105,101,39,44,32,120,58,32,48,46,49,53,44,32,122,58,32,48,46,48,53,44,32,116,97,103,58,32,39,117,110,100,101,114,58,104,101,97,114,116,39,32,125,44,10,50,54,49,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,91,45,48,46,55,44,32,48,44,32,48,46,55,93,46,109,97,112,40,40,120,41,32,61,62,32,40,123,32,107,105,110,100,58,32,39,98,105,110,100,101,114,39,32,97,115,32,99,111,110,115,116,44,32,120,44,32,122,58,32,45,48,46,51,44,32,100,111,115,101,78,101,101,100,58,32,49,44,32,116,97,103,58,32,39,103,105,102,116,39,32,125,41,41,44,10,51,49,57,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,123,32,107,105,110,100,58,32,39,102,108,97,112,39,44,32,120,58,32,45,48,46,51,44,32,122,58,32,48,46,50,44,32,115,105,116,101,58,32,48,44,32,112,97,116,105,101,110,116,58,32,48,44,32,116,97,103,58,32,39,99,108,111,116,104,39,32,125,44,10,51,50,48,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,123,32,107,105,110,100,58,32,39,115,104,97,114,100,39,44,32,120,58,32,48,44,32,122,58,32,48,46,49,53,44,32,115,105,116,101,58,32,48,44,32,112,97,116,105,101,110,116,58,32,48,44,32,116,97,103,58,32,39,117,110,100,101,114,58,99,108,111,116,104,39,32,125,44,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":11,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/casesEarly.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":128,\"content\":\"          { kind: 'mass', x: 0, z: -0.2, hidden: true, locked: true, tag: 'lump' },\"},{\"line_number\":323,\"content\":\"          { kind: 'flap', x: 0, z: -0.2, tag: 'lid' },\"},{\"line_number\":324,\"content\":\"          { kind: 'solace', x: 0.1, z: -0.15, gen: 1, tag: 'under:lid' },\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/caseBuild.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":29,\"content\":\"export function wound(x: number, z: number, site = 0, patient = 0): Spawn {\"},{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"export function curve(x0: number, z0: number, x1: number, z1: number, bow: number, unlock = '', tag = ''): Spawn {\"},{\"line_number\":56,\"content\":\"export function motes(): Spawn[] {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/casesLate.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":55,\"content\":\"          { kind: 'flap', x: -0.2, z: 0.1, tag: 'heart' },\"},{\"line_number\":56,\"content\":\"          { kind: 'reverie', x: 0.15, z: 0.05, tag: 'under:heart' },\"},{\"line_number\":261,\"content\":\"        [-0.7, 0, 0.7].map((x) => ({ kind: 'binder' as const, x, z: -0.3, doseNeed: 1, tag: 'gift' })),\"},{\"line_number\":319,\"content\":\"          { kind: 'flap', x: -0.3, z: 0.2, site: 0, patient: 0, tag: 'cloth' },\"},{\"line_number\":320,\"content\":\"          { kind: 'shard', x: 0, z: 0.15, site: 0, patient: 0, tag: 'under:cloth' },\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"78208e4a-67ee-489c-be96-502049cf4780"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_827","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A potential bug was noticed in botHand.\n\nbotHand returns an idle hand when the phase is 'code' but op.code is still null. This happens because botHand runs before stepVitals starts the code. The paddle never fires.\n\nThe one-step delay is acceptable. The earlier `if (op.code)` check handles the paddle once code exists. The phase advance after code clears is also fine. No bug was found.\n\nLocked targets are ignored unless hidden. Masses may remain locked until cut. The scalpel cut completion logic needs review to confirm mass unlocking.\n\nUnused UI controls were spotted: strainSpeed, railAssist, sewAssist, and radialSlow. The radialSlow slider is hardcoded in its effect.\n\nThe strainSpeed slider is a no-op. It does not affect strain behavior, so it fails the \"live sliders\" acceptance criterion. This seems too weak to be a valid bug. I am now searching for a real gameplay bug.\n\nThe code-phase flatline logic is sound. Vitals stay at zero during code execution, and the bot correctly exits once shock succeeds.\n\nA potential timing bug was found in miss-shock logic. The bot checks `codeBand` at the start of `botHand`, but `stepOp` later applies hands using a `codeBand` value derived from `op.tick`. If that band changes between those two points, the bot may miss its paddle.\n\nThe suspected timing bug in miss-shock logic is not a real bug. The code band is stable during the step because tick increments only at the end. The bot sets its paddle from the current band and pressPaddle checks the same band again, so the hit occurs reliably when the band is active.\n\nA real gameplay bug was found in the miss-shock logic. When the player holds both triggers outside the green band, the bot registers a miss every frame. This burns both tries in just two frames and causes an immediate failure. The plan requires pressing both triggers during the green band, but holding them outside it is treated as a miss each frame.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-59290088-6a74-4992-b1e5-bdfa47d60fff-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/input/hands.ts","offset":150,"limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-59290088-6a74-4992-b1e5-bdfa47d60fff-52","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/codec.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-59290088-6a74-4992-b1e5-bdfa47d60fff-53","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"paddle|pressed\\('gift'\\)|edge","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4639,"output_tokens":1315,"cache_read_input_tokens":119040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"13bd44cf-7f94-4161-9c06-ad0c56537666"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-59290088-6a74-4992-b1e5-bdfa47d60fff-51","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"150→\\n/** Hands for the seats in this operation. */\\nexport function readHands(\\n  input: Input,\\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\\n  camera: CameraPose,\\n  dt: number,\\n  seats: number,\\n  sites: number,\\n  feel: Feel,\\n160→): Hand[] {\\n  if (!sampled) samplePads();\\n  const list = pads();\\n  aimMouse(camera, canvas);\\n  if (!list.length) aimKeys(input, dt, feel, sites);\\n  const hands: Hand[] = [];\\n  for (let seat = 0; seat < seats; seat++) {\\n    const pad = list[seat];\\n    const cursor = cursors[seat];\\n    if (pad) aimPad(seat, pad, dt, feel);\\n170→    const use = (seat === 0 && input.held('use')) || down(pad, 7) || down(pad, 0);\\n    const gift = (seat === 0 && input.held('gift')) || down(pad, 3);\\n    const drop = (seat === 0 && input.held('drop')) || down(pad, 1);\\n    const swap = (seat === 0 && input.held('swap')) || down(pad, 11);\\n    const hint = (seat === 0 && input.held('hint')) || down(pad, 12);\\n    const paddle = down(pad, 6) && down(pad, 7);\\n    const syringe = (seat === 0 && input.pressed('syringe')) || tapped(seat, 2);\\n    if (syringe) cursor.tool = 5;\\n    if (pad && tapped(seat, 14)) cursor.site = (cursor.site + sites - 1) % sites;\\n    if (pad && tapped(seat, 15)) cursor.site = (cursor.site + 1) % sites;\\n180→    hands.push({\\n      x: cursor.x,\\n      z: cursor.z,\\n      tool: cursor.radial ? cursor.radialTool : cursor.tool,\\n      use,\\n      drop,\\n      gift,\\n      paddle: paddle || (seat === 0 && input.held('use') && input.held('radial')),\\n      site: cursor.site,\\n      swap,\\n190→      hint,\\n      radial: cursor.radial,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return hands;\\n}\\n\\n/** The packed list the scene reads. */\\nexport function packedHands(\\n  input: Input,\\n200→  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\\n  camera: CameraPose,\\n  dt: number,\\n  seats: number,\\n  sites: number,\\n  feel: Feel,\\n): number[] {\\n  return packHands(readHands(input, canvas, camera, dt, seats, sites, feel));\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"150→\\n/** Hands for the seats in this operation. */\\nexport function readHands(\\n  input: Input,\\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\\n  camera: CameraPose,\\n  dt: number,\\n  seats: number,\\n  sites: number,\\n  feel: Feel,\\n160→): Hand[] {\\n  if (!sampled) samplePads();\\n  const list = pads();\\n  aimMouse(camera, canvas);\\n  if (!list.length) aimKeys(input, dt, feel, sites);\\n  const hands: Hand[] = [];\\n  for (let seat = 0; seat < seats; seat++) {\\n    const pad = list[seat];\\n    const cursor = cursors[seat];\\n    if (pad) aimPad(seat, pad, dt, feel);\\n170→    const use = (seat === 0 && input.held('use')) || down(pad, 7) || down(pad, 0);\\n    const gift = (seat === 0 && input.held('gift')) || down(pad, 3);\\n    const drop = (seat === 0 && input.held('drop')) || down(pad, 1);\\n    const swap = (seat === 0 && input.held('swap')) || down(pad, 11);\\n    const hint = (seat === 0 && input.held('hint')) || down(pad, 12);\\n    const paddle = down(pad, 6) && down(pad, 7);\\n    const syringe = (seat === 0 && input.pressed('syringe')) || tapped(seat, 2);\\n    if (syringe) cursor.tool = 5;\\n    if (pad && tapped(seat, 14)) cursor.site = (cursor.site + sites - 1) % sites;\\n    if (pad && tapped(seat, 15)) cursor.site = (cursor.site + 1) % sites;\\n180→    hands.push({\\n      x: cursor.x,\\n      z: cursor.z,\\n      tool: cursor.radial ? cursor.radialTool : cursor.tool,\\n      use,\\n      drop,\\n      gift,\\n      paddle: paddle || (seat === 0 && input.held('use') && input.held('radial')),\\n      site: cursor.site,\\n      swap,\\n190→      hint,\\n      radial: cursor.radial,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return hands;\\n}\\n\\n/** The packed list the scene reads. */\\nexport function packedHands(\\n  input: Input,\\n200→  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\\n  camera: CameraPose,\\n  dt: number,\\n  seats: number,\\n  sites: number,\\n  feel: Feel,\\n): number[] {\\n  return packHands(readHands(input, canvas, camera, dt, seats, sites, feel));\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/input/hands.ts\",\"offset\":150,\"limit\":60,\"raw_output\":\"\\n/** Hands for the seats in this operation. */\\nexport function readHands(\\n  input: Input,\\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\\n  camera: CameraPose,\\n  dt: number,\\n  seats: number,\\n  sites: number,\\n  feel: Feel,\\n): Hand[] {\\n  if (!sampled) samplePads();\\n  const list = pads();\\n  aimMouse(camera, canvas);\\n  if (!list.length) aimKeys(input, dt, feel, sites);\\n  const hands: Hand[] = [];\\n  for (let seat = 0; seat < seats; seat++) {\\n    const pad = list[seat];\\n    const cursor = cursors[seat];\\n    if (pad) aimPad(seat, pad, dt, feel);\\n    const use = (seat === 0 && input.held('use')) || down(pad, 7) || down(pad, 0);\\n    const gift = (seat === 0 && input.held('gift')) || down(pad, 3);\\n    const drop = (seat === 0 && input.held('drop')) || down(pad, 1);\\n    const swap = (seat === 0 && input.held('swap')) || down(pad, 11);\\n    const hint = (seat === 0 && input.held('hint')) || down(pad, 12);\\n    const paddle = down(pad, 6) && down(pad, 7);\\n    const syringe = (seat === 0 && input.pressed('syringe')) || tapped(seat, 2);\\n    if (syringe) cursor.tool = 5;\\n    if (pad && tapped(seat, 14)) cursor.site = (cursor.site + sites - 1) % sites;\\n    if (pad && tapped(seat, 15)) cursor.site = (cursor.site + 1) % sites;\\n    hands.push({\\n      x: cursor.x,\\n      z: cursor.z,\\n      tool: cursor.radial ? cursor.radialTool : cursor.tool,\\n      use,\\n      drop,\\n      gift,\\n      paddle: paddle || (seat === 0 && input.held('use') && input.held('radial')),\\n      site: cursor.site,\\n      swap,\\n      hint,\\n      radial: cursor.radial,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return hands;\\n}\\n\\n/** The packed list the scene reads. */\\nexport function packedHands(\\n  input: Input,\\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement,\\n  camera: CameraPose,\\n  dt: number,\\n  seats: number,\\n  sites: number,\\n  feel: Feel,\\n): number[] {\\n  return packHands(readHands(input, canvas, camera, dt, seats, sites, feel));\\n}\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":264}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-59290088-6a74-4992-b1e5-bdfa47d60fff-52","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Hands as a flat list of numbers, the only shape `game:hands` carries. Ten fields, then the radial flag.\\n * Positions are quantised to 1/256 m so a replay of the same gesture is the same list.\\n */\\nimport type { Hand } from './types';\\n\\n/** Numbers per seat in a packed hand list. */\\nexport const HAND_STRIDE = 11;\\n\\n10→/** One seat's hands as eleven numbers. */\\nexport function packHand(hand: Hand): number[] {\\n  return [\\n    Math.round(hand.x * 256) / 256,\\n    Math.round(hand.z * 256) / 256,\\n    hand.tool,\\n    hand.use ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.drop ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.gift ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.paddle ? 1 : 0,\\n20→    hand.site,\\n    hand.swap ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.hint ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.radial ? 1 : 0,\\n  ];\\n}\\n\\n/** Every seat, concatenated. */\\nexport function packHands(hands: readonly Hand[]): number[] {\\n  return hands.flatMap(packHand);\\n30→}\\n\\n/** The list back into hands. A short list returns null so the sim holds still. */\\nexport function unpackHands(raw: unknown, seats: number): Hand[] | null {\\n  if (!Array.isArray(raw) || raw.length < HAND_STRIDE) return null;\\n  const hands: Hand[] = [];\\n  const count = Math.min(seats, Math.floor(raw.length / HAND_STRIDE));\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    const at = i * HAND_STRIDE;\\n    const n = (offset: number): number => {\\n40→      const value = raw[at + offset];\\n      return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : 0;\\n    };\\n    hands.push({\\n      x: n(0),\\n      z: n(1),\\n      tool: Math.round(n(2)),\\n      use: n(3) > 0,\\n      drop: n(4) > 0,\\n      gift: n(5) > 0,\\n50→      paddle: n(6) > 0,\\n      site: Math.round(n(7)),\\n      swap: n(8) > 0,\\n      hint: n(9) > 0,\\n      radial: n(10) > 0,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return hands;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Hands as a flat list of numbers, the only shape `game:hands` carries. Ten fields, then the radial flag.\\n * Positions are quantised to 1/256 m so a replay of the same gesture is the same list.\\n */\\nimport type { Hand } from './types';\\n\\n/** Numbers per seat in a packed hand list. */\\nexport const HAND_STRIDE = 11;\\n\\n10→/** One seat's hands as eleven numbers. */\\nexport function packHand(hand: Hand): number[] {\\n  return [\\n    Math.round(hand.x * 256) / 256,\\n    Math.round(hand.z * 256) / 256,\\n    hand.tool,\\n    hand.use ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.drop ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.gift ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.paddle ? 1 : 0,\\n20→    hand.site,\\n    hand.swap ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.hint ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.radial ? 1 : 0,\\n  ];\\n}\\n\\n/** Every seat, concatenated. */\\nexport function packHands(hands: readonly Hand[]): number[] {\\n  return hands.flatMap(packHand);\\n30→}\\n\\n/** The list back into hands. A short list returns null so the sim holds still. */\\nexport function unpackHands(raw: unknown, seats: number): Hand[] | null {\\n  if (!Array.isArray(raw) || raw.length < HAND_STRIDE) return null;\\n  const hands: Hand[] = [];\\n  const count = Math.min(seats, Math.floor(raw.length / HAND_STRIDE));\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    const at = i * HAND_STRIDE;\\n    const n = (offset: number): number => {\\n40→      const value = raw[at + offset];\\n      return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : 0;\\n    };\\n    hands.push({\\n      x: n(0),\\n      z: n(1),\\n      tool: Math.round(n(2)),\\n      use: n(3) > 0,\\n      drop: n(4) > 0,\\n      gift: n(5) > 0,\\n50→      paddle: n(6) > 0,\\n      site: Math.round(n(7)),\\n      swap: n(8) > 0,\\n      hint: n(9) > 0,\\n      radial: n(10) > 0,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return hands;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/codec.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file Hands as a flat list of numbers, the only shape `game:hands` carries. Ten fields, then the radial flag.\\n * Positions are quantised to 1/256 m so a replay of the same gesture is the same list.\\n */\\nimport type { Hand } from './types';\\n\\n/** Numbers per seat in a packed hand list. */\\nexport const HAND_STRIDE = 11;\\n\\n/** One seat's hands as eleven numbers. */\\nexport function packHand(hand: Hand): number[] {\\n  return [\\n    Math.round(hand.x * 256) / 256,\\n    Math.round(hand.z * 256) / 256,\\n    hand.tool,\\n    hand.use ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.drop ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.gift ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.paddle ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.site,\\n    hand.swap ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.hint ? 1 : 0,\\n    hand.radial ? 1 : 0,\\n  ];\\n}\\n\\n/** Every seat, concatenated. */\\nexport function packHands(hands: readonly Hand[]): number[] {\\n  return hands.flatMap(packHand);\\n}\\n\\n/** The list back into hands. A short list returns null so the sim holds still. */\\nexport function unpackHands(raw: unknown, seats: number): Hand[] | null {\\n  if (!Array.isArray(raw) || raw.length < HAND_STRIDE) return null;\\n  const hands: Hand[] = [];\\n  const count = Math.min(seats, Math.floor(raw.length / HAND_STRIDE));\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    const at = i * HAND_STRIDE;\\n    const n = (offset: number): number => {\\n      const value = raw[at + offset];\\n      return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : 0;\\n    };\\n    hands.push({\\n      x: n(0),\\n      z: n(1),\\n      tool: Math.round(n(2)),\\n      use: n(3) > 0,\\n      drop: n(4) > 0,\\n      gift: n(5) > 0,\\n      paddle: n(6) > 0,\\n      site: Math.round(n(7)),\\n      swap: n(8) > 0,\\n      hint: n(9) > 0,\\n      radial: n(10) > 0,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return hands;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":58}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-59290088-6a74-4992-b1e5-bdfa47d60fff-53","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,53,54,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,95,95,120,53,57,99,49,100,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,111,109,112,97,115,115,45,84,114,97,117,109,97,45,67,101,110,116,101,114,45,83,101,99,111,110,100,45,79,112,105,110,105,111,110,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,52,55,51,49,47,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,105,110,112,117,116,47,104,97,110,100,115,46,116,115,10,49,55,53,58,32,32,32,32,99,111,110,115,116,32,112,97,100,100,108,101,32,61,32,100,111,119,110,40,112,97,100,44,32,54,41,32,38,38,32,100,111,119,110,40,112,97,100,44,32,55,41,59,10,49,56,55,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,112,97,100,100,108,101,58,32,112,97,100,100,108,101,32,124,124,32,40,115,101,97,116,32,61,61,61,32,48,32,38,38,32,105,110,112,117,116,46,104,101,108,100,40,39,117,115,