4,32,96,97,115,115,101,116,115,73,110,108,105,110,101,76,105,109,105,116,58,32,40,41,32,61,62,32,116,114,117,101,96,44,32,96,114,111,108,108,117,112,79,112,116,105,111,110,115,58,32,123,32,105,110,112,117,116,58,32,60,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,105,110,100,101,120,46,104,116,109,108,62,44,32,111,117,116,112,117,116,58,32,123,32,105,110,108,105,110,101,68,121,110,97,109,105,99,73,109,112,111,114,116,115,58,32,116,114,117,101,32,125,32,125,96,46,32,84,101,115,116,101,100,32,111,110,32,116,104,101,32,115,116,97,114,116,101,114,58,32,54,46,55,32,77,66,44,32,110,111,32,101,120,116,101,114,110,97,108,32,114,101,102,101,114,101,110,99,101,115,44,32,98,111,111,116,115,32,102,114,111,109,32,96,102,105,108,101,58,47,47,96,32,119,105,116,104,111,117,116,32,101,114,114,111,114,115,46,10,56,53,54,58,53,46,32,42,42,67,97,115,101,32,50,32,97,110,100,32,51,58,42,42,32,83,99,97,108,112,101,108,44,32,83,99,97,110,110,101,114,44,32,76,97,115,101,114,44,32,115,105,116,101,115,44,32,67,111,100,101,44,32,83,116,105,108,108,112,111,105,110,116,32,97,110,100,32,116,104,101,32,112,117,108,115,101,45,108,111,99,107,46,10,57,49,55,58,65,108,108,32,97,114,101,32,96,100,101,102,105,110,101,83,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,96,32,101,110,116,114,105,101,115,32,119,105,116,104,32,96,119,104,101,110,58,32,39,110,111,119,39,96,44,32,114,101,97,100,32,101,97,99,104,32,115,116,101,112,44,32,105,110,32,96,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,100,97,116,97,47,98,97,108,97,110,99,101,46,116,115,96,46,32,83,104,111,119,110,32,105,110,32,68,101,118,32,77,111,100,101,32,226,134,146,32,66,97,108,97,110,99,101,46,32,68,105,102,102,105,99,117,108,116,121,32,109,117,108,116,105,112,108,105,101,115,32,115,111,109,101,32,111,102,32,116,104,101,109,32,97,116,32,114,117,110,32,115,116,97,114,116,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":16,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":117,\"content\":\"**Flatline.** Vitals at 0 starts a Code: 8 s of field time, paddles in frame, a charge ring. Press both triggers (LMB + RMB)\"},{\"line_number\":118,\"content\":\"when the ring is in its green band. Two tries per Code. Success: vitals 25. Failure, or a Code a case does not allow:\"},{\"line_number\":153,\"content\":\"- **Paddles:** a Code (§3), and the finale's heart stops.\"},{\"line_number\":235,\"content\":\"  2. **The Kindness.** She stops the heart: a Code that does not cost a try if you land one of two shocks in 8 s. Then three arc\"},{\"line_number\":239,\"content\":\"     final Code restarts the heart, with every surgeon's paddles.\"},{\"line_number\":252,\"content\":\"| 3 | Crosstalk | Wren | Hal Minsky, 58, bus driver; crash on Breakwater Road | Liver, Lung, Arm | 5:00 | Sites, Code, Stillpoint |\"},{\"line_number\":266,\"content\":\"   closes: teach the Code → 3 arterial bleeds at once, no time left: time slows, teach the pulse-lock, Wren discovers\"},{\"line_number\":275,\"content\":\"7. **Gala Night** (each table 80). Three bleeding patients while Balm spreads; a Code allowed once per patient; losing any patient fails\"},{\"line_number\":368,\"content\":\"| L2 + R2 | Paddles, in a Code | triggers |\"},{\"line_number\":377,\"content\":\"  Gift. F: quick Syringe. R: drop. Q/E: sites. H: hint. Tab: swap. Esc: pause. LMB + RMB: paddles.\"},{\"line_number\":405,\"content\":\"- **Handbook** (from Pause and the Board): big paged cards showing what you can and cannot do. One per instrument (what it does, what it cannot do, its controls in the current glyphs), the Gift, flaps, sites and the Code, and one per strain once met. Built from the data, so it cannot go stale.\"},{\"line_number\":483,\"content\":\"Title logo 6 s → Case 1 stitching → Case 3 site triage and Stillpoint → a story scene with a Drama Cut → Case 5 Solace splits under Second Pulse with the ship rolling → Case 6 Scanner and flap, with the AI colleague → Case 7 three tables → Case 8 Mercy's Code → postcards → loop.\"},{\"line_number\":689,\"content\":\"- New target kinds, tools and strains are registry entries (`defineKind`), never `if`s on ids.\"},{\"line_number\":728,\"content\":\"The deliverable is one self-contained HTML file: no CDN needed. Write `labs/game/tools/one-file.mts`, modelled on `tools/lib/oneFile.ts`, reusing its exported `inlineBuild` and `externalRefs`: Vite `build` with `configFile: false`, `base: './'`, the alias of `three` to `three/webgpu`, `write: false`, `modulePreload: false`, `cssCodeSplit: false`, `assetsInlineLimit: () => true`, `rollupOptions: { input: <labs/game/index.html>, output: { inlineDynamicImports: true } }`. Tested on the starter: 6.7 MB, no external references, boots from `file://` without errors.\"},{\"line_number\":856,\"content\":\"5. **Case 2 and 3:** Scalpel, Scanner, Laser, sites, Code, Stillpoint and the pulse-lock.\"},{\"line_number\":917,\"content\":\"All are `defineSettings` entries with `when: 'now'`, read each step, in `labs/game/data/balance.ts`. Shown in Dev Mode → Balance. Difficulty multiplies some of them at run start.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"bcbc467a-6c2a-46d9-a430-cc7cb56b62c9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_842","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether adding prevPaddle to Seat affects the state hash.\n\nprevPaddle is safe to include in the state hash since it derives from hands and all clients compute it identically. The bot's hand.paddle stays true for many ticks, but edge-detecting at the start of the green band correctly triggers a single shock.\n\nEdge detection preserves the bot's success path. The first green tick triggers a shock and clears the code, so later ticks do nothing. For players holding paddles from off-band, only the first step counts as a miss; held steps afterward do not add extra tries.\n\nA hold started before the band opens counts as one miss. The same press cannot become a hit when the band later opens; the player must release and press again inside the band to try again.\n\nPressing exactly when the band opens counts as a hit and clears the code. Releasing and pressing again off-band counts as a second miss. The existing test already handles consecutive off-band presses correctly.\n\nThe test loop counts off-band steps as misses but not as spent tries. A two-step off-band streak therefore consumes only one try and leaves the player still playing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35eb3273-a657-48f6-a0d0-b1f643c46ae0-105","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/op.test.ts","limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35eb3273-a657-48f6-a0d0-b1f643c46ae0-106","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function hash|prevUse|JSON.stringify\\(op|seat\\.","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35eb3273-a657-48f6-a0d0-b1f643c46ae0-107","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/body.ts","offset":160,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-35eb3273-a657-48f6-a0d0-b1f643c46ae0-108","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/world.ts","offset":210,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3009,"output_tokens":1182,"cache_read_input_tokens":142720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"9ce8930d-cbeb-4133-990d-b76356edc3bd"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-35eb3273-a657-48f6-a0d0-b1f643c46ae0-105","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The operation sim, driven through `stepOp` the way the page drives it. Tools, refusals, vitals, gifts,\\n * strains, difficulty, and the sliders. Nothing here re-implements a rule to make the assertion true.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { setSlider, resetSliders } from './balance';\\nimport { codeBand } from './body';\\nimport { rankFor, rateCut, rateInject } from './ratings';\\nimport { stepOp } from './step';\\n10→import { tableComplete, refusalLine } from './table';\\nimport type { Hand, Op } from './types';\\nimport { addTarget, createBare, createFromCase, idleHand } from './world';\\n\\n/** Step seat 0. Other seats, if any, stay idle. */\\nfunction play(op: Op, over: Partial<Hand> = {}, n = 1): void {\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const hands = op.seats.map((seat, index) => (index === 0 ? { ...idleHand(seat), ...over } : idleHand(seat)));\\n    stepOp(op, hands);\\n  }\\n20→}\\n\\ndescribe('operation sim', () => {\\n  it('names a tool or a refusal for every pair', () => {\\n    expect(tableComplete()).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('drains a pool and refuses the scalpel without a slip', () => {\\n    const op = createBare();\\n    const pool = addTarget(op, { kind: 'pool', x: 0, z: 0, volume: 0.4, bleed: 0.5 }, 0);\\n30→    play(op, { x: 0, z: 0, tool: 0, use: true });\\n    expect(op.events.some((event) => event.type === 'refusal')).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.events.find((event) => event.type === 'refusal')?.text).toBe(refusalLine('scalpel', 'pool'));\\n    expect(op.slips).toBe(0);\\n    expect(pool.volume).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 0, tool: 3, use: true }, 20);\\n    expect(pool.done).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.score).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n  });\\n\\n40→  it('injects on release inside the band and refuses a syringe on a shard', () => {\\n    const op = createBare({ vitals: 40 });\\n    addTarget(op, { kind: 'mass', x: 6, z: 4, hidden: false, locked: true }, 0);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 2.2, tool: 5, use: true }, 52);\\n    expect(op.injected).toBe(false);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 2.2, tool: 5, use: false });\\n    expect(op.injected).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.patients[0].vitals).toBeGreaterThan(40);\\n    const shard = addTarget(op, { kind: 'shard', x: 1, z: 1 }, 0);\\n    const slips = op.slips;\\n50→    play(op, { x: 1, z: 1, tool: 5, use: true });\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The operation sim, driven through `stepOp` the way the page drives it. Tools, refusals, vitals, gifts,\\n * strains, difficulty, and the sliders. Nothing here re-implements a rule to make the assertion true.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { setSlider, resetSliders } from './balance';\\nimport { codeBand } from './body';\\nimport { rankFor, rateCut, rateInject } from './ratings';\\nimport { stepOp } from './step';\\n10→import { tableComplete, refusalLine } from './table';\\nimport type { Hand, Op } from './types';\\nimport { addTarget, createBare, createFromCase, idleHand } from './world';\\n\\n/** Step seat 0. Other seats, if any, stay idle. */\\nfunction play(op: Op, over: Partial<Hand> = {}, n = 1): void {\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const hands = op.seats.map((seat, index) => (index === 0 ? { ...idleHand(seat), ...over } : idleHand(seat)));\\n    stepOp(op, hands);\\n  }\\n20→}\\n\\ndescribe('operation sim', () => {\\n  it('names a tool or a refusal for every pair', () => {\\n    expect(tableComplete()).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('drains a pool and refuses the scalpel without a slip', () => {\\n    const op = createBare();\\n    const pool = addTarget(op, { kind: 'pool', x: 0, z: 0, volume: 0.4, bleed: 0.5 }, 0);\\n30→    play(op, { x: 0, z: 0, tool: 0, use: true });\\n    expect(op.events.some((event) => event.type === 'refusal')).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.events.find((event) => event.type === 'refusal')?.text).toBe(refusalLine('scalpel', 'pool'));\\n    expect(op.slips).toBe(0);\\n    expect(pool.volume).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 0, tool: 3, use: true }, 20);\\n    expect(pool.done).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.score).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n  });\\n\\n40→  it('injects on release inside the band and refuses a syringe on a shard', () => {\\n    const op = createBare({ vitals: 40 });\\n    addTarget(op, { kind: 'mass', x: 6, z: 4, hidden: false, locked: true }, 0);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 2.2, tool: 5, use: true }, 52);\\n    expect(op.injected).toBe(false);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 2.2, tool: 5, use: false });\\n    expect(op.injected).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.patients[0].vitals).toBeGreaterThan(40);\\n    const shard = addTarget(op, { kind: 'shard', x: 1, z: 1 }, 0);\\n    const slips = op.slips;\\n50→    play(op, { x: 1, z: 1, tool: 5, use: true });\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/op.test.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The operation sim, driven through `stepOp` the way the page drives it. Tools, refusals, vitals, gifts,\\n * strains, difficulty, and the sliders. Nothing here re-implements a rule to make the assertion true.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { setSlider, resetSliders } from './balance';\\nimport { codeBand } from './body';\\nimport { rankFor, rateCut, rateInject } from './ratings';\\nimport { stepOp } from './step';\\nimport { tableComplete, refusalLine } from './table';\\nimport type { Hand, Op } from './types';\\nimport { addTarget, createBare, createFromCase, idleHand } from './world';\\n\\n/** Step seat 0. Other seats, if any, stay idle. */\\nfunction play(op: Op, over: Partial<Hand> = {}, n = 1): void {\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const hands = op.seats.map((seat, index) => (index === 0 ? { ...idleHand(seat), ...over } : idleHand(seat)));\\n    stepOp(op, hands);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('operation sim', () => {\\n  it('names a tool or a refusal for every pair', () => {\\n    expect(tableComplete()).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('drains a pool and refuses the scalpel without a slip', () => {\\n    const op = createBare();\\n    const pool = addTarget(op, { kind: 'pool', x: 0, z: 0, volume: 0.4, bleed: 0.5 }, 0);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 0, tool: 0, use: true });\\n    expect(op.events.some((event) => event.type === 'refusal')).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.events.find((event) => event.type === 'refusal')?.text).toBe(refusalLine('scalpel', 'pool'));\\n    expect(op.slips).toBe(0);\\n    expect(pool.volume).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 0, tool: 3, use: true }, 20);\\n    expect(pool.done).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.score).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('injects on release inside the band and refuses a syringe on a shard', () => {\\n    const op = createBare({ vitals: 40 });\\n    addTarget(op, { kind: 'mass', x: 6, z: 4, hidden: false, locked: true }, 0);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 2.2, tool: 5, use: true }, 52);\\n    expect(op.injected).toBe(false);\\n    play(op, { x: 0, z: 2.2, tool: 5, use: false });\\n    expect(op.injected).toBe(true);\\n    expect(op.patients[0].vitals).toBeGreaterThan(40);\\n    const shard = addTarget(op, { kind: 'shard', x: 1, z: 1 }, 0);\\n    const slips = op.slips;\\n    play(op, { x: 1, z: 1, tool: 5, use: true });\\n\",\"total_lines\":248}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-35eb3273-a657-48f6-a0d0-b1f643c46ae0-106","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,