{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_844","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hash includes `op.code`.\n\nEdge detection changes when tries decrement, so held paddles hash differently. Lockstep clients stay synchronized. Replays and bot tests use live simulation, so they remain unaffected. The hub increments the paddle counter every step a button is held.\n\nThe host receives a paddle increment every frame the button is held. `take()` fires each time. All copies see the same `prevPaddle` state and only the first try is spent. Hashes stay identical.\n\nThe paddle edge will live in the simulation's `applyHands`. Scene-level edge would not fix direct `stepOp` tests. Simulation-only edge keeps bot, couch, and lockstep clients on one rule.\n\nThe scene will remain level-held. The simulation handles the edge. When hands are null, prevPaddle should clear so a menu does not stick the latch. If prevPaddle stays true while hands are absent, resuming play with the button still held produces no new edge. The physical button may still be down.\n\nWhen hands are null, prevPaddle will be set to false without firing. This prevents the pause menu from spending an extra try on a held paddle. The next resume with the button still down counts as a fresh press.\n\nMissing seat hands will also clear `prevPaddle` to false. The `prevPaddle` flag is added to the `Seat` type and initialized in `makeSeat`.\n\n`applyHands` now clears `prevPaddle` to false for every seat when hands are absent. It also resets `prevPaddle` to false for any seat missing a hand, then continues. The paddle edge is detected by checking if the current frame holds the button while the previous frame did not, and only then does it update `prevPaddle` and fire the press. I still need to verify that `prevPaddle` is not included in the world chart snapshot, since the live Op is a module singleton.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8f6686e-93f7-4156-b918-032789c5db94-113","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"prevUse|structuredClone|seats:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8f6686e-93f7-4156-b918-032789c5db94-114","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/op.test.ts","offset":80,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2957,"output_tokens":1239,"cache_read_input_tokens":153600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"ff2d4e15-adda-457c-9be4-21cde2775683"}
