 `npm run verify` finished `verify: 94 passed, 0 failed`. A held pair of paddles spends one Code try.\",\"new_line\":12,\"context_before\":\"- The page boots from `file://` in Chromium with WebGPU. Two launches both reached the title, a filled 1280×720 view, and a key moved the menu. The session client is the first script and matches the vendor file. Usage reads `added on import`.\\n- Couch seats, dev sliders, attract, glyphs, and the hub metas are in the page.\\n- The AI Hub harness passed: two players, four players with loss, host leave, a server copy, and the title with no session.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- `exit-interview.json` matches the About cards. `labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md` has twenty issues, eleven of them game-breaking. `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` asks for a post-restore scene hook and a public way to rewrite a kept mesh. No engine files were patched.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-863609d2-6d81-4d72-bcc0-b52b40931e16-136","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] title: Pick title with RNG and create the dev workspace\\n- [completed] engine: Clone my-3dge, npm ci, read API, add verify skeleton\\n- [completed] sim: sim: Finish sim tests (slip, story, voice, director, sequencer)\\n- [completed] bot: bot: Bot that wins every required case and seed\\n- [completed] field: field: Living sheet, hands, HUD, campaign screens\\n- [completed] front: front: Title, story, board, pause, settings, glyphs, attract, dev mode\\n- [completed] hub: hub: AI Hub harness passed (2p, 4p lossy, host-leave, server, no session)\\n- [completed] verify: Rebuild the page and re-run verify after the paddle fix\\n- [completed] cap: Split campaign.ts, cases.ts, and round.js under the 600-line cap\\n- [completed] paddle: Edge-detect paddles so one hold is one Code try\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Pick title with RNG and create the dev workspace\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Clone my-3dge, npm ci, read API, add verify skeleton\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"sim: Finish sim tests (slip, story, voice, director, sequencer)\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"bot: Bot that wins every required case and seed\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"field: Living sheet, hands, HUD, campaign screens\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"front: Title, story, board, pause, settings, glyphs, attract, dev mode\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"hub: AI Hub harness passed (2p, 4p lossy, host-leave, server, no session)\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Rebuild the page and re-run verify after the paddle fix\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Split campaign.ts, cases.ts, and round.js under the 600-line cap\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Edge-detect paddles so one hold is one Code try\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"title\":{\"content\":\"Pick title with RNG and create the dev workspace\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"engine\":{\"content\":\"Clone my-3dge, npm ci, read API, add verify skeleton\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"sim\":{\"content\":\"sim: Finish sim tests (slip, story, voice, director, sequencer)\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"bot\":{\"content\":\"bot: Bot that wins every required case and seed\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"field\":{\"content\":\"field: Living sheet, hands, HUD, campaign screens\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"front\":{\"content\":\"front: Title, story, board, pause, settings, glyphs, attract, dev mode\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"hub\":{\"content\":\"