,\"context_before\":\"- The shipped page boots from `file://` in Chromium with WebGPU. Two launches both reached the title, a filled 1280×720 view, and a key moved the menu. The session client is the first script and matches the vendor file. Usage reads `added on import`, and the Usage card is marked `data-about=\\\"usage\\\"`.\\n- Couch seats, dev sliders, attract, glyphs, and the hub metas are in the page.\\n- The AI Hub harness passed: two players, four players with loss, host leave, a server copy, and the title with no session.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- `exit-interview.json` matches the About cards. `labs/game/TESTING-LOG.md` has twenty issues, eleven of them game-breaking. `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` asks for a post-restore scene hook and a public way to rewrite a kept mesh. No engine files were patched.\\n\\n## Deviations\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6edcce88-5056-4b79-a544-b568e7a08bd3-23","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] title: Pick title with RNG and create the dev workspace\\n- [completed] engine: Clone my-3dge, npm ci, read API, add verify skeleton\\n- [completed] sim: sim: Finish sim tests (slip, story, voice, director, sequencer)\\n- [completed] bot: bot: Bot that wins every required case and seed\\n- [completed] field: field: Living sheet, hands, HUD, campaign screens\\n- [completed] front: front: Title, story, board, pause, settings, glyphs, attract, dev mode\\n- [completed] hub: hub: AI Hub harness passed (2p, 4p lossy, host-leave, server, no session)\\n- [completed] verify: Rebuild the page and re-run verify after the paddle fix\\n- [completed] cap: Split campaign.ts, cases.ts, and round.js under the 600-line cap\\n- [completed] paddle: Confirm one paddle hold is one Code try from flatline\\n- [completed] about: Match About/Credits text to exit-interview.json\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Pick title with RNG and create the dev workspace\",