{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_893","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is being killed. If an error occurs before this step, the server could leak again.\n\nA try/finally block will be added to ensure the browser closes, the server is killed, and temporary files are removed even if an error occurs.\n\nThe port promise can reject before the browser launches, so the browser variable would be undefined in the finally block. Restructuring to handle this safely risks breaking the hub. The -u fix is the essential bug fix; extra cleanup is unnecessary.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-43f9d6f4-9e8b-472c-9f00-a78467498706-46","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"PKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\"\ncd \"$PKG\"\ntd=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\nexport TMPDIR=\"$td\"\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=/home/micha/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium-1243/chrome-linux64/chrome\nset +e\nnode labs/game/tools/hub.mjs > \"$SCRATCH/hub.log\" 2>&1\nec=$?\nset -e\necho EXIT:$ec >> \"$SCRATCH/hub.log\"\n# our server should be gone; only kill a python whose cwd is under this tmp\nfor pid in $(pgrep -f 'python3 -u -m http.server' || true); do\n  cwd=$(readlink -f /proc/$pid/cwd 2>/dev/null || true)\n  case \"$cwd\" in\n    \"$td\"|$td/*) kill -TERM \"$pid\" 2>/dev/null || true ;;\n  esac\ndone\nrm -rf \"$td\"\necho HUB:$ec\ncat \"$SCRATCH/hub.log\"","description":"Re-run the AI Hub harness after the port fix","block_until_ms":600000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":522,"output_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":90240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0