addles during flatline before the code is created, the rising-edge press fires and consumes one try. When the code timer expires, the player loses with \"The line stays flat.\" The skeptic wants exactly one try per hold, not zero or many.\n\nThe current code spends zero tries during a flatline paddle hold, so the operation survives with two tries remaining. The desired behavior is exactly one try spent on the hold, leaving one try for the green band.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The paddle report is still open, and the launch, UX, and WebGPU logs are the missing checks. I’ll confirm the shipped hold behavior, then run those three and write the evidence."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1883e5f-31bc-4294-9499-73f185dcc319-51","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"paddle","content":"Prove a held paddle from flatline stays in the Code","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"evidence","content":"Write launch-1, launch-2, ux.log, and nowebgpu.log","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1883e5f-31bc-4294-9499-73f185dcc319-52","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/body.ts","offset":40,"limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1883e5f-31bc-4294-9499-73f185dcc319-53","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/body.ts","offset":120,"limit":45}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1883e5f-31bc-4294-9499-73f185dcc319-54","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1883e5f-31bc-4294-9499-73f185dcc319-55","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home