{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_922","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"iPad is treated as a mobile device with touch support.\n\nThe iPad test timeout may be too short. The tablet waits 40 seconds for both engine ready and attract, while the phone splits these into separate 40-second and 15-second windows. A slow iPad viewport could exhaust that combined budget.\n\nThe tablet test will be restructured to match the phone: a 40-second wait for engine ready and message, followed by a 15-second wait for attract. The timeout handler will also capture the actual screen and touch text to diagnose failures.\n\nThe tablet test now waits 40 seconds for the touch-only message and 15 seconds for the attract screen. A failure will reveal exactly which wait timed out. The Pixel 7 works while the iPad does not despite both being mobile with touch support, so the cause is likely not the user agent.\n\nPlaywright's `isMobile` flag may not reliably set `pointer: coarse`, which would explain why the iPad fails while the Pixel 7 passes. The iPad's large viewport might also cause the page to treat it as desktop, though `touchOnly` relies on JavaScript matchMedia rather than CSS width. Another possibility is that the touch message was present but the attract screen never started, since iPad screens are tall and the engine waits ten seconds before entering attract mode.\n\nThe iPad device descriptor might be causing a page error before the engine becomes ready. The current catch block only reports the timeout message, so I will evaluate the actual page state before throwing to diagnose exactly what went wrong.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The phone gate passed. The tablet check timed out, so I’ll see whether that profile never shows the message or just misses the attract loop."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a6f43644-16cb-431c-8803-f8a53b1e22d3-99","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"PKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\"\ncd \"$PKG\"\ncat > labs/game/tools/tablet-once.mjs << 'EOF'\nimport { chromium, devices } from 'playwright';\nconst FILE = new URL('../../../../Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731.html', import.meta.url);\nconst browser = await chromium.launch({\n  executablePath: process.env.CHROMIUM_PATH,\n  headless: true,\n  args: ['--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-vulkan=swiftshader','--use-angle=swiftshader','--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader'],\n});\nconst tablet = await browser.newContext({ ...devices['iPad Pro 11'] });\nconst page = await tablet.newPage();\nconst errors = [];\npage.on('pageerror', (e) => errors.push(e.message));\nawait page.goto(FILE.href);\nawait page.waitForTimeout(12000);\nconst state = await page.evaluate(() => ({\n  ready: !!window.__engine?.ready,\n  screen: window.__compass?.screen ?? '',\n  touch: document.querySelector('[data-game=\"touch\"]')?.textContent ?? '',\n  fine: window.matchMedia?.('(any-pointer: fine)').matches ?? null,\n  coarse: window.matchMedia?.('(any-pointer: coarse)').matches ?? null,\n  hover: window.matchMedia?.('(hover: hover)').matches ?? null,\n}));\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({ errors, state }));\nawait browser.close();\nEOF\ntd=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\nexport TMPDIR=\"$td\"\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=/home/micha/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium-1243/chrome-linux64/chrome\nnode labs/game/tools/tablet-once.mjs\nrm -f labs/game/tools/tablet-once.mjs\nrm -rf \"$td\"","description":"See why the iPad profile missed the touch gate"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":749,"output_tokens":1384,"cache_read_input_tokens":146560,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"515a4113-824f-425f-9097-7d0cafc2f2ea"}
