{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_923","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"On iPad, touchOnly() should be true because fine and hover are false while coarse is true.\n\nThe touch gate is missing from the DOM. The engine has not become ready after 12 seconds, so the shell is likely static HTML before the module boots.\n\nThe iPad viewport is much larger than the Pixel 7, so a software WebGPU context may hang or take far longer to initialize. The module might also be failing to start the engine on this specific viewport.\n\nThe iPad canvas is 1668 by 2388 pixels. That large surface likely causes the software WebGPU hang.\n\nOverriding deviceScaleFactor to 1 while keeping the tablet viewport and touch should fix this. The tablet profile already covers the viewport and UA. Only the retina check needs adjustment.\n\nThe iPad viewport is actually similar in pixel count to the Pixel 7, so the engine failure likely stems from a software WebGPU hang rather than canvas size alone. I will wait up to 45 seconds to see if ready flips. If it does not, overriding deviceScaleFactor to 1 is the practical fix. The empty touch gate simply means the shell has not painted yet; onFrame will render it once the engine starts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a2672f77-a8f0-4e47-b361-e1fabbbce07f-100","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"PKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\ncd \"$PKG\"\ncat > labs/game/tools/tablet-once.mjs << 'EOF'\nimport { chromium, devices } from 'playwright';\nconst FILE = new URL('../../../../Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731.html', import.meta.url);\nconst browser = await chromium.launch({\n  executablePath: process.env.CHROMIUM_PATH,\n  headless: true,\n  args: ['--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-vulkan=swiftshader','--use-angle=swiftshader','--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader'],\n});\nfor (const spec of [\n  ['ipad', devices['iPad Pro 11']],\n  ['ipad-dpr1', { ...devices['iPad Pro 11'], deviceScaleFactor: 1 }],\n]) {\n  const ctx = await browser.newContext(spec[1]);\n  const page = await ctx.newPage();\n  const errors = [];\n  page.on('pageerror', (e) => errors.push(String(e).slice(0, 200)));\n  await page.goto(FILE.href);\n  let state = null;\n  try {\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__engine?.ready, null, { timeout: 45000 });\n    state = await page.evaluate(() => ({\n      ready: true,\n      screen: window.__compass?.screen ?? '',\n      touch: document.querySelector('[data-game=\"touch\"]')?.innerText ?? '',\n      errors: (window.__engine?.errors ?? []).map((item) => item.code),\n    }));\n  } catch (error) {\n    state = await page.evaluate(() => ({\n      ready: !!window.__engine?.ready,\n      screen: window.__compass?.screen ?? '',\n      touch: document.querySelector('[data-game=\"touch\"]')?.innerText ?? '',\n      msg: document.querySelector('#msg')?.innerText ?? '',\n    }));\n    state.wait = String(error).slice(0, 120);\n  }\n  console.log(JSON.stringify({ name: spec[0], errors, state }));\n  await ctx.close();\n}\nawait browser.close();\nEOF\ntd=$(mktemp -d /tmp/g.XXXXXX)\nexport TMPDIR=\"$td\"\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=/home/micha/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium-1243/chrome-linux64/chrome\nnode labs/game/tools/tablet-once.mjs\nrm -f labs/game/tools/tablet-once.mjs\nrm -rf \"$td\"","description":"Compare iPad readiness at full DPR and DPR 1","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1590,"output_tokens":1315,"cache_read_input_tokens":147200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"e646e401-87f5-44f0-87ef-cc82a2373a1d"}
