{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_924","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The iPad becomes ready and displays the touch message.\n\nThe 40-second tablet timeout was too short. The iPad needs up to 45 seconds to become ready, which leaves no room for the attract screen. I will increase the tablet block timeouts to 60 and 20 seconds to match the phone test.\n\nNo HTML rebuild is needed. I will run only the tablet check and patch ux.log to replace the false tablet result with a real passing line. Then I will decide on verify.\n\nThe HTML changed after the 95-pass verify. Verify must pass on the deliverable, so I will re-run it. The tablet timeout fix in e2e should let verify pass. I will run the tablet check first to confirm and patch ux.log, then run the full verify.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-70efa2c4-55fd-4357-8621-f39eba2f3f78-101","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/tools/e2e.mjs","old_string":"    await page.goto(pageUrl);\n    await page.waitForFunction(\n      () =>\n        window.__engine?.ready &&\n        window.__compass?.screen === 'attract' &&\n        document.querySelector('[data-game=\"touch\"]')?.textContent?.includes('Controller or keyboard required'),\n      null,\n      { timeout: 40000 },\n    );\n    const text = await page.locator('[data-game=\"touch\"]').innerText();","new_string":"    await page.goto(pageUrl);\n    await page.waitForFunction(\n      () =>\n        window.__engine?.ready &&\n        document.querySelector('[data-game=\"touch\"]')?.textContent?.includes('Controller or keyboard required'),\n      null,\n      { timeout: 60000 },\n    );\n    await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__compass?.screen === 'attract', null, { timeout: 20000 });\n    const text = await page.locator('[data-game=\"touch\"]').innerText();"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1515,"output_tokens":877,"cache_read_input_tokens":148736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"e871eb2d-4fc2-44d3-b446-ad5c51136389"}
