{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_929","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The webkit failure was caused by a Python crash at `page = browser.new_page(...)`. The log line was truncated to `page = b` because `tail()` limits output to 600 characters.\n\nThe webkit crash was likely an environmental resource issue after the chrome failure, not a logic bug. The chrome target crashed during mouse and dev verification after replay. I will check memory and leftover processes before retrying verify.\n\nA repeated crash at the same spot would suggest a leak from replay leaving Chrome running. I will move the failed verify log to verify-r7.log before retrying. The successful ux and launch logs are the evidence the evaluator asked for. I will check free memory first and wait if it is low.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-88544089-5131-415d-8c94-f30981f60678-106","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"free -h\necho \"--- chrome ---\"\npgrep -af 'chrome|verify.mjs' | head -40 || true\necho \"--- our once ---\"\nls labs/game/tools/*once* 2>/dev/null || echo none\n# package path check\nPKG=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731\"\nls \"$PKG/labs/game/tools/\"*once* 2>/dev/null || echo \"no once files\"","description":"Check memory and leftover browsers before retrying verify"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1391,"output_tokens":486,"cache_read_input_tokens":154368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"4d6b2638-660b-4d1f-93e3-9a23d3952378"}
