:117,\"content\":\"    body: 'When the line goes flat, both paddles in the green band. Two tries. Land it and the vitals climb back to twenty-five.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/bot.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":67,\"content\":\"    hand.paddle = codeBand(op);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/casesLate.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":265,\"content\":\"      phase('mercy-final', 'Restart the heart.', 'code', [], 'flatline', 'Every paddle. Then we are done.'),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/sequencer.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":25,\"content\":\"    paddle: false,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/world.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":237,\"content\":\"    prevPaddle: false,\"},{\"line_number\":276,\"content\":\"    paddle: false,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/casesEarly.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":200,\"content\":\"        'Both paddles while the band is green. Two tries.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/work/Trauma-Compass-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224731/labs/game/op/op.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":89,\"content\":\"    for (let i = 0; i < 200 && saved.code && saved.status === 'p