{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_939","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"verify.log is newer than html and body.ts.\n\n98 tests passed. verify-oom at 05:12 is earlier than verify.log at 05:29. verify-r5 failed at 04:33 before the successful run. I need to check verify-oom.log to see if earlyoom killed browsers or if this was an app failure. A captured app failure counts as a defect, not flakiness. I also noticed body.ts at 04:00 is older than sim.log at 04:17 and verify at 05:29.\n\nHTML rebuilt at 04:57, after sim.log at 04:17. The verify run at 05:29 included npm test, so unit tests ran again then. This suggests code changes between the earlier simulation and the HTML rebuild were tested before the final verification.\n\nThe test is honest. It calls play() which calls stepOp. The hub bug is also fixed. countPress increments every held frame and take() fires every tick. The simulation edges this correctly. applyHands is used consistently.\n\nThe null-hands path leaves prevPaddle uncleared. A release during a menu frame persists until the next non-null frame resets it. This is acceptable. The gap is fixed. Now searching for a new defect.\n\nThe anti-ratchet rule excludes new nits. The null-hands path is unlikely to be a real bug. A player who misses the band and holds through the green window still gets only one try. They must release and press inside the band to succeed.\n\nThe success test still uses `paddle: codeBand` for the entire window, so it succeeds on the first frame and shows no regression. A quick 2-second reproduction run would confirm the exact try counts.\n\nThe test logic is sound. After one idle step and six off-band presses, the tick reaches 7 and the band opens at 28. The first off-band press triggers an edge miss, reducing tries to 1 while the status remains playing. The assertion holds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-959f1180-ad67-4ce5-8906-7e2d2aa08165-87","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/verify-oom.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-959f1180-ad67-4ce5-8906-7e2d2aa08165-88","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/verify-r6.log"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2885,"output_tokens":1311,"cache_read_input_tokens":186880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"66a9163b-575f-47ae-9a3f-13502ca5357a"}
