1,46,32,73,102,32,101,97,114,108,121,111,111,109,32,107,105,108,108,115,32,105,116,44,32,99,97,112,116,117,114,101,32,116,104,97,116,32,116,101,120,116,32,97,110,100,32,114,101,116,114,121,32,116,104,97,116,32,114,117,110,32,111,110,99,101,59,32,105,102,32,105,116,32,115,116,105,108,108,32,100,105,101,115,44,32,116,104,101,32,50,45,112,108,97,121,101,114,32,104,97,114,110,101,115,115,32,112,108,117,115,32,116,104,101,32,78,111,100,101,32,115,101,113,117,101,110,99,101,114,32,116,101,115,116,32,97,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,98,97,114,32,111,110,108,121,32,119,104,101,110,32,96,123,83,67,82,65,84,67,72,125,47,104,117,98,45,111,111,109,46,108,111,103,96,32,115,104,111,119,115,32,116,104,101,32,107,105,108,108,46,32,68,111,32,110,111,116,32,99,108,97,105,109,32,116,104,101,32,52,45,112,108,97,121,101,114,32,114,117,110,32,112,97,115,115,101,100,46,10,50,53,58,56,46,32,103,97,116,105,110,103,58,32,76,111,97,100,32,116,104,101,32,72,84,77,76,32,105,110,32,70,105,114,101,102,111,120,32,97,110,100,32,105,110,32,87,101,98,75,105,116,32,119,105,116,104,32,97,110,32,105,80,104,111,110,101,32,112,114,111,102,105,108,101,32,40,115,121,115,116,101,109,32,80,121,116,104,111,110,32,80,108,97,121,119,114,105,103,104,116,32,49,46,54,51,44,32,110,111,32,98,114,111,119,115,101,114,32,105,110,115,116,97,108,108,41,46,32,80,97,115,115,32,111,110,108,121,32,105,102,32,98,111,116,104,32,115,104,111,119,32,116,104,101,32,112,108,97,105,110,32,87,101,98,71,80,85,45,114,101,113,117,105,114,101,100,32,109,101,115,115,97,103,101,32,97,110,100,32,100,111,32,110,111,116,32,114,117,110,32,116,104,101,32,111,112,101,114,97,116,105,111,110,46,32,67,97,112,116,117,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,118,105,115,105,98,108,101,32,116,101,120,116,32,116,111,32,96,123,83,67,82,65,84,67,72,125,47,110,111,119,101,98,103,112,117,46,108,111,103,96,46,32,84,104,105,115,32,105,115,32,110,111,116,32,105,79,83,32,83,97,102,97,114,105,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":10,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3%2Fwork/01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"## Acceptance criteria\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"1. gating: In the dev workspace, add or extend the engine’s existing `npm test` suite so it calls the shipped sim from a fresh start (not a copy of the rules). Assert tool-on-target effects and a refusal for every pair that has no effect, rating bands, vitals and clock failure, slip limit, flatline Code success and failure, other sites worsening while away, Stillpoint and Second Pulse, Consult, each strain’s distinguishing transition (including Mercy’s three phases), difficulty scaling, and balance sliders staying in range with reset restoring defaults. Capture the run to `{SCRATCH}/sim.log`. Pass only if those assertions pass.\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\"2. gating: Same suite: for three seeds, the shipped bot wins each of the eight story cases on Resident from that case’s own start; Cases 1 and 8 also on Intern and Attending; a 2-seat and a 4-seat bot run finish. A separate test drives the shipped flow from the title through story, all eight operations (bot), debrief, credits, and Free Surgery unlocked, with no browser. Capture to `{SCRATCH}/bot.log`. Pass only if each case win and the ending unlock are reported, not merely that the process exited.\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"3. gating: Assert story and case data cover the §8 case list and §9 arc, every scene is 12–35 short boxes, postcard lines exist per rank, voice synthesis is deterministic per line, and a scan of game text finds no never-use names and no TODO, placeholder, or lorem. Capture to `{SCRATCH}/content.log`.\"},{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\"4. gating: From the dev folder run `npm run verify` (it must set a short `TMPDIR` itself). Capture the full log to `{SCRATCH}/verify.log`. Pass only if the process exits 0 and the last line is `verify: <N> passed, 0 failed`. The command must include the sim tests above, the engine check, and browser checks against the root deliverable HTML, not only against a dev server.\"},{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"5. gating: Launch the deliverable HTML from `file://` twice, sequentially, in headless Chromium via the already-installed browser (`CHROMIUM_PATH`, WebGPU software flags, short `TMPDIR`, no `playwright install`). Each run: zero page errors, engine ready, canvas pixel size equal to the requested size, and either the engine shot path or in-page state shows a substantially filled title or operating field (painted coverage of most of the surface, not a few pixels). Inject a standard-mapping stub pad or a key and assert a real change (menu focus moves, or an operation cursor or tool changes). Write `{SCRATCH}/launch-1/` and `{SCRATCH}/launch-2/` (log, state, shot). Both runs must succeed the same way. If the browser process cannot start, save that output as `{SCRATCH}/launch-error.log`; sim tests in steps 1–3 then stand as the launch bar. A shot that succeeds and is blank or nearly empty is a failure, not an unavailable readback. Do not treat a known-blank WebGPU canvas bitmap from a plain  [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\"6. gating: Against that same HTML, scripted checks (DOM and engine state, not a watched playthrough) must show: attract starts after 10 seconds of no input and a key, a mouse move, a pad button, and a stick past the dead zone each exit it with nothing saved; glyphs follow the last device and the Xbox setting; Dev Mode opens from pause, one slider changes the live value, reset restores it; two stub pads claim two couch seats and move two cursors; an AnalyserNode or offline render shows music present at the default 0.1 music volume and a synthesized effect, and the file contains no audio file, `<audio>` tag, or audio data URL. Touch phone and tablet profiles, tapped via the touchscreen API, show exactly “Controller or keyboard required”, a working settings control, no engine touch layer, and attract still running. Capture to `{SCRATCH}/ux.log`.\"},{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\"7. gating: Serve the deliverable with `python3 -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1` (record the printed port and PID). Run the AI Hub harness scenarios from PLAN.md §16 (`players=2&auto=1`, `players=4` with latency 150, jitter 50, loss 5, `scenario=host-leave`, `scenario=server`) and require `window.__hubCheck.pass` plus zero state-hash mismatches. Also open the game with no session and confirm the title flow. Stop that server by its PID. A Node test of the shipped sequencer (host plus three clients, latency, jitter, 5% loss on unreliable input, a leaver) must keep hashes equal across 3600 ticks. Capture to `{SCRATCH}/hub.log`. Run the four-browser harness alone. If earlyoom kills it, capture that text and retry that run once; if it still dies, the 2-player harness plus the Node sequencer test are the bar only when `{SCRATCH}/hub-oom.log` shows the kill. Do not claim the 4-player run passed.\"},{\"line_number\":25,\"content\":\"8. gating: Load the HTML in Firefox and in WebKit with an iPhone profile (system Python Playwright 1.63, no browser install). Pass only if both show the plain WebGPU-required message and do not run the operation. Capture the visible text to `{SCRATCH}/nowebgpu.log`. This is not iOS Safari.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-df434353-6299-42bf-83d5-9f39a80aa604-2","content":"{\"type\":\"ListDir\",\"Content\":{\"content\":\"- /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer/\\n  - boot-check.mjs\\n  - bot.log\\n  - check.log\\n  - check2.log\\n  - content.log\\n  - debug-gala.ts\\n  - debug-restore.mts\\n  - e2e-r3.err\\n  - e2e-r3.log\\n  - e2e-r3.tmp\\n  - e2e-r4.err\\n  - e2e-r4.log\\n  - e2e-r4.tmp\\n  - e2e-r5.err\\n  - e2e-r5.log\\n  - e2e-r5.tmp\\n  - e2e-r6.err\\n  - e2e-r6.log\\n  - e2e-r6.tmp\\n  - e2e.err\\n  - e2e.log\\n  - e2e.tmp\\n  - engine-src.txt\\n  - hub-r4.log\\n  - hub-r5.log\\n  - hub.err\\n  - hub.log\\n  - hub.tmp\\n  - launch-1/\\n    - log.txt\\n    - shot.txt\\n    - state.json\\n  - launch-2/\\n    - log.txt\\n    - shot.txt\\n    - state.json\\n  - launch.log\\n  - launch.mjs\\n  - nowebgpu.log\\n  - onefile-r4.log\\n  - onefile-r5.log\\n  - paddle-hold.log\\n  - paddle-hold.mts\\n  - run-cases.ts\\n  - sim.log\\n  - smoke.ts\\n  - tablet.log\\n  - tmpdir.txt\\n  - tsc.txt\\n  - ux-once.log\\n  - ux.log\\n  - verify-oom.log\\n  - verify-r1.log\\n  - verify-r2.log\\n  - verify-r3.log\\n  - verify-r4.log\\n  - verify-r5.log\\n  - verify-r6.log\\n  - verify.log\\n  - verify.pid\\n  - watch-e2e.sh\\n  - watch-hub.sh\\n  - watch-tests.sh\\n  - watch-verify.sh\",\"absolute_root_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224731__x59c1d3/tmp/grok-goal-0593a9c03d8d/implementer\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa3f-84ea-7700-ba58-234d6f85e151","uuid":"bef67a0f-5684-4560-8103-f50b3177de9d"}
